(window.PL_LANG_Q = window.PL_LANG_Q || []).push([{"Welcome to Amity Square! In the square, the Pokémon at the front of your team walks with you.":"欢迎来到互动广场！在广场里，队伍最前面的宝可梦会陪你一起散步。","So that everyone stays safe, only these Pokémon may come in: {list}.":"为了大家的安全，只有这些宝可梦可以进去：{list}。","I am sorry, {mon} cannot come into the square. Please put one of the Pokémon listed here at the front of your team.":"抱歉，{mon}不能进广场。请把名单上的宝可梦放在队伍的最前面。","{mon} seems to have found something in the grass!":"{mon}好像在草丛里找到了什么东西！","Good day! I walk here every day, and every day I find more berries than I can carry. Here, have one.":"你好！我每天都来这里散步，每天捡到的树果多得拿不动。来，送你一颗。","Come back tomorrow, and I will have another berry for you.":"明天再来吧，我会再给你一颗树果。","My Pikachu and I come here every morning. It always finds something before I do!":"我每天早上都和皮卡丘来这里。它总是比我先找到东西！","It flicks its ears and squeaks happily.":"它抖了抖耳朵，开心地叫了一声。","Buneary keeps one ear rolled up when it is happy. Today both ears are rolled up!":"卷卷耳开心的时候会卷起一只耳朵。今天两只都卷起来了！","It bounces up and down on the spot.":"它在原地蹦蹦跳跳。","Happiny carries a round white stone everywhere. It thinks it is an Egg, bless it.":"小福蛋走到哪里都抱着一块圆圆的白石头。它以为那是蛋呢，真可爱。","It hugs its round white stone and smiles at you.":"它抱着圆圆的白石头，对你笑了笑。","Amity Square. Walk with your Pokémon and enjoy the flowers. Please do not battle here.":"互动广场。和你的宝可梦一起散步、赏花吧。请不要在这里对战。","The Battle Arcade. A roulette before every battle: anything can happen!":"对战轮盘。每场对战前先转轮盘：什么都可能发生！","Lower HP":"降低HP","Freeze":"冰冻","Get Berries":"获取树果","Get Items":"获取道具","Level Up":"等级提升","Sandstorm":"沙暴","Swap Teams":"宝可梦交换","Speed Up":"加速","Slow Down":"缓慢","Get 1 BP":"获取1BP","Get 3 BP":"获取3BP","No Battle":"无对战","No Event":"无项目","Your Pokémon lost some HP!":"你的宝可梦的HP减少了！","The opponent's Pokémon lost some HP!":"对手的宝可梦的HP减少了！","Your Pokémon were poisoned!":"你的宝可梦中毒了！","The opponent's Pokémon were poisoned!":"对手的宝可梦中毒了！","Your Pokémon were paralyzed!":"你的宝可梦麻痹了！","The opponent's Pokémon were paralyzed!":"对手的宝可梦麻痹了！","Your Pokémon were burned!":"你的宝可梦灼伤了！","The opponent's Pokémon were burned!":"对手的宝可梦灼伤了！","One of the opponent's Pokémon fell asleep!":"对手的一只宝可梦睡着了！","One of the opponent's Pokémon was frozen solid!":"对手的一只宝可梦冻住了！","The opponent's Pokémon got Berries to hold!":"对手的宝可梦拿到了树果！","The opponent's Pokémon got items to hold!":"对手的宝可梦拿到了道具！","Your Pokémon grew three levels for this battle!":"你的宝可梦在这场对战中提升了三级！","The opponent's Pokémon grew three levels for this battle!":"对手的宝可梦在这场对战中提升了三级！","The sunlight will be harsh in this battle!":"这场对战会是大晴天！","It will rain in this battle!":"这场对战会下雨！","A sandstorm will rage in this battle!":"这场对战会刮沙暴！","It will hail in this battle!":"这场对战会下冰雹！","A deep fog will cover this battle!":"这场对战会起浓雾！","The dimensions will be twisted at the start of this battle!":"这场对战一开始时空就会扭曲！","Swap! You will battle with the opponent's Pokémon, and the opponent with yours!":"交换！你要用对手的宝可梦对战，对手则用你的！","The roulette will spin faster!":"轮盘会转得更快！","The roulette will spin slower!":"轮盘会转得更慢！","Next time, the roulette will move at random!":"下一次轮盘会乱跳！","No battle! Battle No. {n} counts as won.":"无对战！第 {n} 场算你赢。","No event this time.":"这次什么都没有。","Let's see what the roulette has in store for us!":"来看看轮盘为我们准备了什么吧！","Luck is part of skill. That's what I tell myself.":"运气也是实力的一部分。我是这么告诉自己的。","Whatever the panel says, I'm ready!":"不管停在哪一格，我都准备好了！","Round and round it goes. Let's battle!":"转啊转的。开始对战吧！","The roulette was on your side.":"轮盘站在你那边。","Luck had nothing to do with it, did it?":"跟运气没关系吧？","Spun out...":"转晕了……","Not my lucky day.":"今天不是我的幸运日。","Twenty wins in a row! I'm Dahlia, the Arcade Star. Shall we see whose luck burns brighter?":"连胜二十场！我是轮盘女神大丽。来看看谁的运气更旺吧？","Forty-eight wins! You really know how to ride your luck. Let's make this one count!":"四十八连胜！你真懂得乘着运气往前冲。这一场可要好好打！","What a thrill! Fortune smiles on those who battle with heart.":"太刺激了！幸运会眷顾用心对战的人。","Amazing! Nobody has ever spun my roulette like that.":"太厉害了！从来没有人能这样转动我的轮盘。","Battle No. {n}: stop the roulette!":"第 {n} 场：停下轮盘！","Welcome to the Battle Arcade! This counter is for double battles.":"欢迎来到对战轮盘！这里是双打的柜台。","Welcome to the Battle Arcade! This counter is for single battles.":"欢迎来到对战轮盘！这里是单打的柜台。","Enter three Pokémon. Here they do not hold their own items, and they are healed after every battle.":"请报名三只宝可梦。在这里它们不能带自己的道具，每场对战后都会回满。","Before each battle the roulette spins. Stop it, and the panel it lands on changes the battle: for you, for your opponent, or for both.":"每场对战前轮盘都会转动。停下它，停住的那一格会改变这场对战：对你、对对手，或对双方。","Battle well and the panels favor your opponent more often. Win seven in a row to finish a round and earn Battle Points.":"对战打得好，格子就更常落在对手身上。连赢七场完成一轮，就能拿到对战点数。","The Arcade Star has come to battle you herself!":"轮盘女神亲自来和你对战了！","The roulette stopped on {panel} ({who})!":"轮盘停在了{panel}（{who}）！","The roulette stopped on {panel}!":"轮盘停在了{panel}！","Dahlia recognizes your skill. You earned the Silver Print!":"大丽认可了你的实力。你得到了银色印记！","Dahlia recognizes your skill. You earned the Gold Print!":"大丽认可了你的实力。你得到了金色印记！","The Arcade Star, Dahlia, battles Trainers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row. The roulette spins for her too!":"轮盘女神大丽会和单打连胜到第 21 场和第 49 场的训练家对战。轮盘也会为她转动！","The better you battle, the more panels land on your opponent and the field. Battle slowly, and they land on you.":"对战打得越好，格子越常落在对手和场地上。打得慢吞吞，就会落在你身上。","Past the mist, a still lake fills the cave under Mt. Coronet. Now and then something splashes far out on the water.":"穿过雾气，一座平静的湖泊填满了天冠山底下的洞窟。远处的水面上不时有什么东西溅起水花。","Below Victory Road the cave opens onto a cold, dark lake. The water is so still that it looks like a second ceiling.":"冠军之路的下方，洞窟通向一座又冷又暗的湖。湖水静得像是另一片洞顶。","Travelers say there is another lake like this one, deep in Victory Road, past where most Trainers ever go.":"旅行者们说，冠军之路的深处也有一座这样的湖，在大多数训练家都没去过的地方。","Travelers say there is another lake like this one under Mt. Coronet, below the tunnel of Route 211.":"旅行者们说，天冠山底下、211号道路的隧道下方，也有一座这样的湖。","Two lakes under two mountains, and you have stood on the shore of both.":"两座山底下的两座湖，你都站在它们的岸边看过了。","You caught a Feebas here? Then the lake trusts you. I have been fishing it for three days and seen nothing but Magikarp.":"你在这里钓到了丑丑鱼？看来这座湖信任你。我已经钓了三天，除了鲤鱼王什么都没见到。","Feebas live in this lake, they say. But only on a few spots of the water, and the spots change every day.":"听说这座湖里住着丑丑鱼。不过只在水面上的几个地方，而且那几个地方每天都会变。","Any rod will do. Cast once on every spot you can reach, and keep going. That is all the advice I have.":"用哪根钓竿都行。能到的每个地方都甩一次竿，一直钓下去。我能给的建议就这些了。","Welcome to the Battleground! Gym Leaders and strong Trainers from all over Sinnoh come here to battle, a few of them each day.":"欢迎来到对决场！神奥各地的道馆馆主和强大的训练家都会来这里对战，每天来几位。","Here today: {a}, {b}, {c} and {d}. Talk to whoever you like. Each of them battles you once a day.":"今天来的是：{a}、{b}、{c}和{d}。想和谁对战就去找谁。每人每天只和你对战一次。","Every morning I run over here to see who has come. It is better than anything on TV!":"我每天早上都跑来看今天来了谁。比电视上的节目都好看！","I left the mine in good hands for the day. My Pokémon have been digging deeper than ever. Want to see?":"我把矿山交给可靠的人照看一天。我的宝可梦挖得比以前更深了。想见识一下吗？","Ha! You dug right through us again.":"哈！又被你一口气挖穿了。","The mine will still be there tomorrow, and so will I. Probably.":"矿山明天还在，我也还在。大概吧。","The flowers here are tough, like the Trainers. Let us see how much you have grown!":"这里的花和训练家一样顽强。让我看看你成长了多少！","You have grown more than my whole garden.":"你成长得比我整个花园还快。","I bring seeds from Eterna every time I come. Nothing grows in the Survival Area yet, but I will not give up.":"我每次来都会带百代市的种子。生存区现在还什么都长不出来，但我不会放弃的。","I walked here barefoot from Veilstone to toughen my feet. Now let me toughen my fists on you!":"我从帷幕市光着脚走来，为了练脚力。现在让我拿你来练拳头吧！","My feet are tough. My fists still have work to do.":"脚是练硬了，拳头还得再练。","Lucario and I train on the rocks out back every morning. You are welcome to join us.":"我和路卡利欧每天早上都在后面的岩石上修行。欢迎你一起来。","WAHAHAHA! Crasher Wake makes a splash even in a dry town like this one! Ready?":"哇哈哈哈！就算在这么干燥的小镇，吉宪也能掀起浪花！准备好了吗？","WAHAHA! Soaked through, and loving it!":"哇哈哈！浑身湿透，痛快！","There is no sea here, but there is a sea in my heart! Also, Route 226 is right there.":"这里没有海，可我心里有一片海！再说，226号水路就在旁边。","Ah, the Champion! My ghosts have been dancing all morning. Will you dance with them?":"啊，是冠军！我的幽灵们跳了一上午的舞。要和它们一起跳吗？","Magnifique! You lead the dance now.":"太精彩了！现在由你来领舞。","The Battleground has a wonderful echo. My ghosts adore it.":"对决场里的回声好美。我的幽灵们都很喜欢。","BWAHAHAHA! I left a note on the Gym door and sailed straight here. Let us see if you are still made of steel!":"哇哈哈哈！我在道馆门上留了张纸条就坐船过来了。让我看看你是不是还像钢铁一样硬！","BWAHAHA! Steel bends, but it does not break. Neither do I!":"哇哈哈！钢铁会弯，但不会断。我也一样！","Do not tell Roark I said so, but you are the best Trainer I have ever faced.":"别告诉瓢太是我说的，你是我遇到过的最强的训练家。","It is so hot here! My team is about to melt, so I need to cool off with a battle!":"这里好热！我的队伍都快化了，得打一场来降降温！","I feel much cooler now. Beaten, but cooler!":"现在凉快多了。输是输了，但凉快！","Snowpoint misses you, you know. Come and have a snowball fight sometime.":"雪峰市的大家都很想你。有空来打雪仗吧。","I heard you would be here. That is the only reason I came. Do not hold back.":"听说你会来，我才来的。别手下留情。","That woke me up. Thank you.":"这下我清醒了。谢谢。","Flint dragged me here the first time. Now I come on my own.":"第一次是大叶硬拉我来的。现在我自己会来。","We walked through Eterna Forest together, remember? I have trained so much since then!":"我们一起走过百代森林，还记得吗？那以后我练了好多！","You are still so strong. I am happy for you.":"你还是那么强。我替你高兴。","My Blissey looks after everyone here. Even the people who beat me.":"我的幸福蛋会照顾这里的每一个人。连打败我的人也照顾。","The aura in this room is fierce today. Mine and Lucario's, against yours.":"今天这个房间里的波导很激烈。我和路卡利欧的波导，对上你的。","Your aura has grown. I can feel it from here.":"你的波导变强了。我在这里都能感觉到。","Byron says hello. He always says hello. Loudly.":"东瓜让我向你问好。他总是问好，而且嗓门很大。","Welcome to Grandfather's Battleground! On the mountain we fought side by side. Today, we fight each other!":"欢迎来到爷爷的对决场！在山上我们并肩作战，今天我们来一决胜负！","Wow! Grandfather was watching, too. Now I will never hear the end of it!":"哇！爷爷也在看。这下他要念叨我一辈子了！","Heatran still sleeps under the mountain. I go and say hello sometimes. From far away.":"席多蓝恩还睡在山底下。我有时会去打个招呼，远远地。","Oh, and a girl called Mira has started coming too. She says a Champion once led her out of a cave.":"对了，一个叫麦儿的女孩也开始来了。她说曾经有一位冠军带她走出了洞窟。","I said I would battle you one day, remember? I have not been lost once since then. Not even once!":"我说过总有一天要和你对战的，还记得吗？从那以后我一次都没迷过路。一次都没有！","I lost the battle, but I did not get lost. That is progress!":"对战输了，可我没迷路。这就是进步！","Next time I go into a cave, I am taking a map. And a Champion.":"下次进洞窟，我要带地图。还要带一位冠军。","...I came, like I said I would. Arcanine wanted a real battle. So do I.":"……我说过会来，就来了。风速狗想要一场真正的对战。我也是。","...You are still the strongest person I know.":"……你还是我认识的人里最强的。","I went back to the stone. Still nothing there. I will keep going back.":"我又去了石碑那里。还是什么都没有。我会一直去的。","Rodolfo":"罗多尔福","Ashlee":"阿什莉","Audrey":"奥黛丽","Geoffrey":"杰弗里","Deanna":"迪安娜","{player}! I knew you would get on that ship! Welcome to the Battle Zone!":"{player}！我就知道你会上那条船！欢迎来到对战特区！","This whole island is for Trainers who want to get stronger. Come on, come on! There is something you have to see!":"这整座岛都是给想变强的训练家准备的。快来快来！有样东西你一定要看！","So the Champion found us. I thought you might turn up, {player}.":"冠军找到我们了。我就猜你会来，{player}。","They are building a Battle Frontier behind us. It is not open yet, so there is nothing to do. You know what happens when he has nothing to do.":"我们身后正在建对战开拓区。还没开张，所以没什么可做的。你知道他没事做的时候会怎样。","I get bored.":"我会无聊。","Wait! Two against two! {player} and me against you two, right now! You will never be bored again!":"等等！二对二！我和{player}对你们两个，现在就打！保证你再也不无聊！","...That might keep me awake.":"……这倒能让我醒着。","Ha! That is the spirit! Let us burn!":"哈！这才对嘛！烧起来吧！","Hold on, let me fix up your team first. No excuses!":"等一下，我先帮你的队伍恢复。不许找借口！","Not bad. You two make a strange pair, and a dangerous one.":"不错。你们俩真是奇怪又危险的搭档。","We are going to want a rematch! Past Route 225 there is a town called the Survival Area, with a Battleground for Trainers like us. Look for us there one day.":"我们还要再打一场！过了225号道路有个地方叫生存区，那里有给我们这种训练家准备的对决场。改天来那儿找我们。","We did it, {player}! I am going on ahead to the Survival Area. Do not be late, or I am fining you!":"我们赢了，{player}！我先去生存区了。不许迟到，不然罚款！","That was a good fire. Come and find us at the Battleground when it opens.":"烧得真痛快。对决场开张后来找我们吧。","Let us burn!":"烧起来吧！","I am not bored. It is a strange feeling.":"我不无聊了。这感觉真奇怪。","Ready to go back to Snowpoint City?":"要回雪峰市吗？","The ship sailed back across the northern sea...":"船穿过北方的海回去了……","A good Trainer aims for the weak spot. I never hit anything else.":"好的训练家都瞄准弱点。我这辈子就没打过别的地方。","A young Trainer, all the way out here! When I was your age I carried this lens into every battle. It is yours now.":"这么年轻的训练家，居然跑到这里来了！我像你这么大时，每场对战都带着这枚镜片。现在给你吧。","Give it to a Pokémon to hold. It helps it land critical hits.":"让宝可梦带着它，就更容易打出会心一击。","They say the fishing is better on the far side of the island, past the volcano. I am too old to find out.":"听说岛那边、火山后面的鱼更好钓。我太老了，去不动了。","I came to the Battle Zone with a team of six and a suitcase. I have been here for a year.":"我带着六只宝可梦和一个行李箱来到对战特区，已经待了一年了。","This island was all fishermen and wind, once. Now every ship brings another Trainer.":"这座岛以前只有渔夫和风。现在每条船都会带来新的训练家。","Fight Area. North: Route 225 to the Survival Area.":"战斗区。北：225号道路，通往生存区。","Route 225. North: Survival Area. South: Fight Area.":"225号道路。北：生存区。南：战斗区。","Only the strongest Trainers come to this island. Let me see if you are one of them.":"只有最强的训练家才会来这座岛。让我看看你是不是其中之一。","Yes. You are.":"是的。你是。","This road gets harder the further north you go.":"这条路越往北越难走。","I look after the wild Pokémon on this road. You look like you need a lesson in respect!":"我负责照看这条路上的野生宝可梦。看来你需要学学什么叫尊重！","Well, they respect you now.":"好吧，它们现在尊重你了。","Keep to the path, please, and leave the berries for the Pokémon.":"请走大路，把树果留给宝可梦。","My birds have flown over every inch of this island. Have you ever seen it from the air?":"我的鸟飞遍了这座岛的每个角落。你从空中看过它吗？","From up there, the volcano in the east looks close enough to touch.":"从天上看，东边的火山近得好像伸手就能摸到。","Slowpoke and I knew you were coming. It took us a while, but we knew.":"呆呆兽和我早知道你要来。想了好一阵，但我们知道。","We did not know that, though.":"这个我们倒是不知道。","Give it a few minutes. Slowpoke is still thinking about the battle.":"等几分钟吧。呆呆兽还在想刚才的对战。","So you crossed the river. Now try crossing me!":"你渡过河了。现在试试过我这一关！","My dragons will want a word with you next time.":"下次我的龙可要找你算账。","Some Trainers stay on this road for years before they dare go any further.":"有些训练家在这条路上待了好几年，才敢继续往前走。","Everything grows bigger and stronger out here. Even the fruit on my Tropius!":"这里什么都长得又大又壮。连我的热带龙结的果子也是！","You have grown bigger and stronger too, it seems.":"看来你也长大变强了。","Tropius grows its fruit all year. Nobody goes hungry on this road.":"热带龙一年四季都结果。这条路上没人会挨饿。","Three Pokémon, three different ways to lose. Pick one!":"三只宝可梦，三种输法。选一种吧！","I had not thought of that one.":"这一种我倒没想到。","A ranger has to know the land. The Survival Area is at the top of this road, then east.":"巡护员得熟悉地形。生存区在这条路的尽头，再往东走。","The Survival Area is just ahead. If you cannot get past me, you will not last a day there!":"前面就是生存区了。过不了我这关，你在那儿一天也撑不下去！","You will last.":"你撑得下去。","Go on. The town is just east of here.":"去吧。城镇就在东边。","There you are, {player}! What took you so long? I have already been all over town!":"你可算来了，{player}！怎么这么慢？我都把镇子逛遍了！","They call this the Survival Area, and only the toughest Trainers come here. So I am staying, obviously!":"这里叫生存区，只有最强悍的训练家才来。所以我当然要留下！","That big building is the Battleground. When it opens, every Gym Leader in Sinnoh is going to come here to battle.":"那座大楼就是对决场。等它开张，神奥所有的道馆馆主都会来这里对战。","I am training here until that road opens. Next time we meet, I will be the one fighting you, not beside you!":"路开之前我就在这里修炼。下次见面，我就是你的对手，不是搭档了！","Survival Area. A town for Trainers who want to find their limits.":"生存区。这里属于想挑战自己极限的训练家。","Everyone here is training for something. Nobody can quite remember what.":"这里每个人都在为了什么而修炼。至于为了什么，谁也记不清了。","I buy Full Heals by the crate. You never know what is living on that volcano.":"我的万灵药都是整箱买的。谁知道那座火山上住着什么。","This is the Battleground. One day the Gym Leaders of Sinnoh will meet here to battle anyone who asks. We are not quite ready for them yet.":"这里是对决场。总有一天，神奥的道馆馆主会聚在这里，和所有想挑战的人对战。我们还没准备好。","I came all this way to see Roark battle, and he is not here! I can wait. I have sandwiches.":"我大老远来看瓢太对战，他居然不在！我可以等。我带了三明治。","My grandson has gone off to the volcano again. He says the mountain talks to him. It only ever says one thing to me: stay away.":"我孙子又跑去火山了。他说山在跟他说话。山跟我只说一句：别靠近。","A note on the table says: \"Gone to look for shards. Back when I have enough.\"":"桌上的字条写着：\"出门找碎片了。找够了就回来。\"","And the road east goes to a volcano, over the sea. I am training here first, so do not you dare go up there and have all the fun!":"往东走过海就是一座火山。我先在这里修行，你可别一个人跑上去把好玩的都玩了！","We have only just cleared this road. A lot of mountain came down here, and it keeps moving.":"这条路我们才刚清理好。山上塌下来好多石头，而且还在动。","My grandson came home covered in soot, carrying the seal of the mountain under his arm. That boy will be the end of me.":"我孙子一身煤灰地回来，胳膊底下夹着这座山的封印。这孩子迟早要把我吓死。","East: Route 226. Beyond the sea, Stark Mountain.":"东：226号水路。海的那边是严酷山。","{player}! Perfect timing! I went to challenge Byron, but his Gym is shut. So I will take it out on you!":"{player}！来得正好！我去挑战东瓜，结果他的道馆关着。那我就拿你出气了！","My team has all grown up since Pastoria. Look!":"我的队伍比在湿原市时成长多了。你看！","No way! I trained so hard!":"不会吧！我练得那么努力！","Byron went off to Iron Island, by the way. Ask the sailor at the harbour. I am going to train some more. See you!":"对了，东瓜去钢铁岛了。去港口问问水手吧。我要继续修行了。再见！","The next Gym is in Snowpoint City, far to the north. Its Leader, Candice, trains in the snow!":"下一个道馆在雪峰市，在遥远的北方。那里的馆主小菘在雪中修行！","The Gym is shut. A note on the door says: \"Gone to Iron Island. Back soon! Byron\"":"道馆关着。门上的纸条写着：“去钢铁岛了。马上回来！东瓜”","Ahoy! Shall I take you out to Iron Island?":"喂！要我送你去钢铁岛吗？","The boat sailed out to Iron Island...":"船驶向了钢铁岛……","Any time. The sea is not going anywhere.":"随时都行。大海又不会跑掉。","Hey, Champion! Byron uses Steel-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠军！东瓜使用钢属性的宝可梦。","Fire, Fighting and Ground moves are what you want. His Bastiodon is part Rock, so Fighting and Ground moves hit it four times as hard!":"要用火、格斗和地面属性的招式。他的护城龙也是岩石属性，所以格斗和地面招式有四倍效果！","Careful with Metal Burst: it hits back harder than it was hit. Up to level 50, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"小心金属爆炸：它会用更大的力量打回来。在这里，你从家乡带来的宝可梦在50级以下都会听话。","Take the Mine Badge! It is as hard as the one who earned it.":"收下矿物徽章吧！它和赢得它的人一样坚硬。","{player} received the Mine Badge from Byron!":"{player}从东瓜那里得到了矿物徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 60 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，60级以下的宝可梦在神奥都会听你的话，就算来自其他地区也一样。","And take TM91, Flash Cannon. A blast of steel light that may lower the foe's Special Defense!":"再收下招式学习器91，加农光炮。这道钢铁之光有时能降低对手的特防！","Two lines, two Gyarados. Today is my lucky day!":"两根钓竿，两只暴鲤龙。今天运气真好！","Not so lucky after all.":"看来运气也没那么好。","You need Surf to get across. There is no other way to Canalave from here.":"要用冲浪才能过去。从这里去水脉市没有别的路。","Tony":"托尼","The sea is my stage! Listen to this!":"大海就是我的舞台！听好了！","My strings broke...":"我的琴弦断了……","Kricketune and I play for the ships in Canalave harbour.":"我和音箱蟀在水脉市的港口为船只演奏。","The bridge goes up when big ships come through the canal. It is the best thing in town!":"大船经过运河时，桥会升起来。这是城里最棒的景象！","Our Gym Leader built his Gym with his own hands, and he has a son who leads a Gym too.":"我们的馆主亲手建了这座道馆，他的儿子也是道馆馆主。","Fire, Fighting and Ground moves are the answer to Steel. Almost nothing else hurts it much!":"对付钢属性就要用火、格斗和地面。其他招式几乎都打不痛它！","A sailor always stocks up before going to sea. Iron Island has no shop!":"水手出海前一定要备好物资。钢铁岛上可没有商店！","My husband worked the mines on Iron Island. The steel of Sinnoh came from there.":"我丈夫以前在钢铁岛的矿山工作。神奥的钢铁都是从那里来的。","Every story in this library starts in Sinnoh. Strange, is it not?":"这座图书馆里的每个故事都从神奥开始。很奇怪吧？","Jackson":"杰克逊","We built this Gym with Byron, one steel beam at a time!":"我们和东瓜一起，一根钢梁一根钢梁地建起了这座道馆！","Needs more welding.":"还得再焊一焊。","Steel types resist nearly everything. Do not waste your time on weak moves.":"钢属性几乎什么都能抵抗。别在弱招式上浪费时间。","David":"大卫","Two Steelix, hard as the island they came from!":"两只大钢蛇，和它们的故乡钢铁岛一样坚硬！","Even steel can bend.":"钢铁也会弯的。","Steelix are part Ground, so Water moves work on them too.":"大钢蛇也是地面属性，所以水属性招式也有效。","This Magnemite keeps my tools sharp. And it bites!":"这只小磁怪帮我保养工具。而且它可不好惹！","Back to the workshop.":"回工坊去了。","Magnemite are part Electric. Ground moves hit them four times as hard.":"小磁怪也是电属性。地面招式对它有四倍效果。","You have to get past my Steelix first!":"你得先过我的大钢蛇这一关！","Byron and his son Roark argue about whose Pokémon are tougher. Every single day.":"东瓜和他儿子瓢太天天争论谁的宝可梦更硬。","Breanna":"布丽安娜","Bronzor can be Levitate or Heatproof. Do you know which is which?":"铜镜怪的特性可能是飘浮或耐热。你分得清吗？","You worked it out.":"被你看穿了。","Steel and Psychic together have very few weak spots. Fire is one of them.":"钢和超能力属性组合起来弱点很少，火属性是其中之一。","Cesar":"塞萨尔","I am the last one before Byron. My Scizor will end this!":"我是东瓜前面最后一关。我的巨钳螳螂会结束这一切！","Go on. Byron is ready.":"去吧。东瓜已经准备好了。","Scizor has only one weak spot: Fire. It is a big one.":"巨钳螳螂只有一个弱点：火。不过这个弱点非常致命。","Ha! So you are the one who chased Team Galactic out of my island! I am Byron, and my Steel Pokémon are the hardest in Sinnoh. A Champion of three regions? Then hit me as hard as you can!":"哈！原来就是你把银河队赶出了我的岛！我是东瓜，我的钢属性宝可梦是神奥最硬的。三个地区的冠军？那就使出全力打过来吧！","Ha ha! What a blow! Even steel rings when it is struck like that.":"哈哈！好重的一击！这样打下去，连钢铁都会响。","Route 218. West: Canalave City, across the water. East: Jubilife City.":"218号道路。西：水脉市（要过海）　东：祝庆市","Canalave City. A port town, split in two by its canal.":"水脉市。被运河一分为二的港口城市。","Canalave City Gym. Leader: Byron, the Steel man.":"水脉道馆。馆主：钢铁之人东瓜","Canalave Harbour. Ask the sailor about the boat to Iron Island.":"水脉港。去钢铁岛的船请问水手。","A book of old stories: \"When the world began, there was only one egg. From it came the first Pokémon, and the first Pokémon made time and space.\"":"一本古老的故事书：“世界之初只有一颗蛋。第一只宝可梦从蛋中诞生，并创造了时间和空间。”","A book of old stories: \"Three spirits sleep in Sinnoh's three lakes. They gave people knowledge, feeling and will.\"":"一本古老的故事书：“三个精灵沉睡在神奥的三座湖中。它们赐予人们知识、情感和意志。”","...Oh, it is you. Sorry, my head is somewhere else today.":"……啊，是你啊。抱歉，我今天心不在焉的。","My boy will not wake up. He sleeps day and night and cries out in his dreams, as if something dark were standing over him.":"我儿子醒不过来了。他白天黑夜都在睡，还在梦里大叫，好像有什么黑乎乎的东西站在他身边。","The old folk here say a feather from Fullmoon Island, the Lunar Wing, chases bad dreams away. Nobody goes out there anymore...":"这里的老人们说，满月岛上有一种羽毛叫新月之羽，能赶走噩梦。可是已经没有人去那里了……","My boy is up and running around again, all thanks to you! I owe you more than a boat ride.":"我儿子又能下床到处跑了，全多亏了你！我欠你的可不只是一趟船。","Will you go to Fullmoon Island for my boy? I will take you there right away.":"你愿意为了我儿子去一趟满月岛吗？我马上送你过去。","The boat sailed out to Fullmoon Island...":"船向满月岛驶去……","The boy is fast asleep, tossing and turning. He mumbles something about a shadow...":"男孩睡得很沉，翻来覆去的。他嘴里嘟囔着什么影子……","{player} held the Lunar Wing near the sleeping boy. It glowed like the moon...":"{player}把新月之羽靠近熟睡的男孩。羽毛像月亮一样发出了光……","...Huh? Is it morning? I had such a long, scary dream. Then a bright Pokémon came, and the scary thing went away.":"……咦？天亮了吗？我做了一个好长好可怕的梦。后来来了一只发着光的宝可梦，可怕的东西就走了。","Thank you! I am going to tell Dad!":"谢谢你！我要去告诉爸爸！","My dad sails the boat to Iron Island. One day I will be a sailor too!":"我爸爸开船去钢铁岛。总有一天我也要当船员！","I dreamed of a Pokémon that shone like the moon. It chased the dark thing away, and then I woke up.":"我梦到一只像月亮一样发光的宝可梦。它把黑乎乎的东西赶跑了，然后我就醒了。","The Battle Castle. Castle Points pay for everything: win well to earn them.":"对战城堡。一切都用城堡点数支付：赢得漂亮才拿得到。","Welcome to the castle, challenger. Allow me to show you how we battle here.":"欢迎来到城堡，挑战者。请让我示范这里的对战方式。","Your Pokémon look tired. Good.":"你的宝可梦看起来很累了。正合我意。","Every point you spend is a point you do not have. Did you spend wisely?":"花掉的每一点都回不来了。你花得明智吗？","A noble battle, then!":"那就来一场高贵的对战吧！","A royal performance.":"真是一场王者风范的表现。","I should have saved my points...":"我应该把点数留着的……","You are welcome at court any time.":"宫廷随时欢迎你。","Defeated with grace, at least.":"至少输得很优雅。","Twenty wins in my lady's castle! I am Darach, the Castle Valet. Allow me to battle you in her place.":"在我家小姐的城堡里连赢二十场！我是城堡管家石兰。请让我代替她与你对战。","Forty-eight wins. My lady would be delighted. I, however, intend to stop you here.":"四十八连胜。小姐一定会很高兴。不过，我打算在这里阻止你。","Magnificent. I shall report your victory to my lady at once.":"了不起。我这就去向小姐禀报你的胜利。","Splendid... I have served the castle many years, and seen nothing finer.":"太精彩了……我在城堡服务多年，从没见过这么出色的对战。","Castle Points: {n}.":"城堡点数：{n}。","{mon} HP {hp}/{max}":"{mon} HP {hp}/{max}","Rent an item":"租道具","Battle No. {n}. Castle Points: {cp}. What will you do?":"第 {n} 场。城堡点数：{cp}。要做什么？","Skip battle No. {n} for {cp} CP?":"要花 {cp} CP 跳过第 {n} 场吗？","You do not have enough Castle Points.":"城堡点数不够。","HP · {cp} CP":"HP · {cp} CP","PP · {cp} CP":"PP · {cp} CP","HP and PP · {cp} CP":"HP 和 PP · {cp} CP","{mon} recovered!":"{mon}恢复了！","Which Pokémon will hold it?":"要让哪只宝可梦携带？","{item} · {cp} CP":"{item} · {cp} CP","{mon} is holding the {item}.":"{mon}携带了{item}。","Who they are · {cp} CP":"对手是谁 · {cp} CP","Their summary · {cp} CP":"详细资料 · {cp} CP","Their moves · {cp} CP":"招式 · {cp} CP","Their level +5 · {cp} CP":"等级 +5 · {cp} CP","Their level -5 · {cp} CP":"等级 -5 · {cp} CP","Your opponents will battle at level {n}.":"对手会以 {n} 级出战。","{mon}, level {lvl}, at full HP.":"{mon}，{lvl} 级，HP 全满。","{mon}, level {lvl}, holding {item}.":"{mon}，{lvl} 级，携带{item}。","{mon}: {moves}.":"{mon}：{moves}。","Recovery":"回复","{kind}: rank {r} (the top)":"{kind}：等级 {r}（最高）","{kind}: rank {r} → {next} · {cp} CP":"{kind}：等级 {r} → {next} · {cp} CP","{kind} rank up! It is now rank {r}.":"{kind}升级了！现在是等级 {r}。","Welcome to the Battle Castle! This counter is for double battles.":"欢迎来到对战城堡！这个柜台是双打对战。","Welcome to the Battle Castle! This counter is for single battles.":"欢迎来到对战城堡！这个柜台是单打对战。","Enter three Pokémon. Here they do not hold their own items, and nothing heals them between battles.":"请带三只宝可梦参加。在这里不能带自己的道具，战斗之间也不会自动回复。","Castle Points pay for everything: healing, items to hold, a look at your opponents. You earn them by winning well.":"一切都用城堡点数支付：回复、租道具、查看对手。赢得漂亮就能得到点数。","Win seven in a row to finish a round and earn Battle Points. Your Castle Points last as long as your streak.":"连赢七场就完成一轮，可以获得对战点数。城堡点数在连胜期间一直保留。","Battle No. {n} was skipped.":"跳过了第 {n} 场。","The Castle Valet has come to battle you himself!":"城堡管家亲自来和你对战了！","{player} earned {n} CP! Castle Points: {cp}.":"{player}得到了 {n} CP！城堡点数：{cp}。","Darach recognizes your skill. You earned the Silver Print!":"石兰认可了你的实力。你得到了银色印记！","Darach recognizes your skill. You earned the Gold Print!":"石兰认可了你的实力。你得到了金色印记！","The Castle Valet, Darach, battles in his lady's place against Trainers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row.":"城堡管家石兰会代替小姐，和单打连胜到第 21 场和第 49 场的训练家对战。","Castle Points: {cp}. Ranks: Info {i}, Recovery {r}, Items {t}.":"城堡点数：{cp}。等级：查看 {i}、回复 {r}、道具 {t}。","The ruins have stood for longer than anyone can remember. We only look after them.":"这座遗迹存在的时间，比任何人记得的都久。我们只是守护它而已。","Those people in the space suits have gone into the ruins. Please, can you stop them?":"那些穿太空服的人进了遗迹。拜托了，你能阻止他们吗？","Thank you for driving them out of the ruins. And what is this? The Old Charm! So my Cynthia sent you.":"谢谢你把他们赶出遗迹。咦，这是？古代护符！原来是我家竹兰让你来的。","This charm has been in our family for a very long time. Sinnoh's oldest stories are tied to it.":"这个护符在我们家传了很久很久。神奥最古老的传说都和它有关。","I would give you HM03 for your trouble, but I see you carry Surf already. Take this instead.":"本来想把秘传学习器03送给你当谢礼，不过你已经有冲浪了。收下这个吧。","TM51 is Roost. The user lands and rests, and gets back half its HP.":"招式学习器51是羽栖。使用者降落休息，回复一半的HP。","Welcome to the Cafe Cabin! Our Moomoo Milk is the best on Route 210.":"欢迎光临咖啡小屋！我们的哞哞鲜奶是210号道路上最棒的。","Go in if you want. The boss will finish you off!":"想进就进吧。老大会收拾你的！","The spirit is a flaw in this world. One day I will remove it, and then you will understand.":"心是这个世界的缺陷。总有一天我会把它抹去，到时你就明白了。","Cyrus left the ruins without another word.":"赤日一句话也没再说，离开了遗迹。","Celestic Town Elder":"神和镇的长老","Patrick":"帕特里克","A Dragon Tamer fears nothing, not even fog. Come on!":"驯龙师什么都不怕，连雾也不怕。来吧！","Dragons are hard to raise, you know.":"龙可是很难养的。","Gible loves caves, but I have to walk it through here to reach Celestic Town.":"圆陆鲨喜欢洞穴，不过要去神和镇，只能带它走这里。","I cannot see a thing in this fog, but I can hear you. Hiyah!":"这雾里什么都看不见，但我听得到你。嘿呀！","I never saw that coming. Really.":"我真的没看到你出招。","Walking in fog trains your ears as well as your legs.":"在雾里走路，既练腿也练耳朵。","Brianna":"布莉安娜","My owls see through this fog as if it were night. And you?":"我的猫头鹰在雾里就像在夜里一样看得清。你呢？","They did not see that coming.":"这下它们也没料到。","Noctowl never loses its way, fog or no fog.":"猫头夜鹰从不迷路，有雾没雾都一样。","A battle on the bridge road, with the fog all around. Perfect!":"在桥边的路上对战，四周都是雾。太棒了！","Well fought.":"打得好。","A Nosepass evolves near Mt. Coronet. Mine became a Probopass right there.":"朝北鼻在天冠山附近会进化。我的就是在那里变成大朝北鼻的。","Alyssa":"艾莉莎","If you got this far in the fog, you must be good. Show me!":"能在雾里走到这里，你一定很厉害。让我看看！","I knew it.":"果然如此。","Celestic Town is just over the bridge. It is quiet there, and very old.":"过了桥就是神和镇。那里很安静，也很古老。","Nathan":"内森","Ninja art: hiding in the fog! You found me? Then we battle!":"忍法：雾隐之术！被你发现了？那就对战吧！","I should have hidden better...":"我应该藏得更好才对……","A true ninja needs no fog. I am still learning.":"真正的忍者不需要雾。我还在学。","Nothing warms you up after the fog like a glass of fresh milk.":"走完雾路，来杯鲜奶最暖身了。","Route 211 climbs into Mt. Coronet from here. The rocks are loose today, so you had better stay in town.":"211号道路从这里通往天冠山。今天岩石松动，你还是留在镇上吧。","Those people in the space suits showed up this morning. They want something in the ruins!":"那些穿太空服的人今天早上来的。他们想要遗迹里的什么东西！","The elder looks after the ruins, as her family always has.":"长老守护着遗迹，她的家族世代如此。","The boss is busy in there. Nobody goes in!":"老大正在里面忙。谁也不准进去！","Ugh! Boss, I tried!":"呜！老大，我尽力了！","Scholars come from all over Sinnoh to see the mural in the ruins. Nobody can agree on what it means.":"全神奥的学者都来看遗迹里的壁画，但谁也说不清它的含义。","My grandfather told me that long ago, people and Pokémon were the same. I still wonder about that.":"爷爷告诉过我，很久以前人和宝可梦是一样的。我到现在还在想这件事。","So we meet again. This mural tells of the Pokémon that shaped time and space. With that power, a new world can begin. If you mean to stand in my way, then show me your strength.":"我们又见面了。这幅壁画讲述的是创造时间与空间的宝可梦。有了那份力量，新的世界就能开始。如果你想挡我的路，就让我看看你的实力。","I see. Your strength is real. It changes nothing.":"原来如此。你的实力是真的。但这改变不了什么。","Route 210. West: Celestic Town. South: Solaceon Town. Mind the fog!":"210号道路。西：神和镇　南：随意镇　小心大雾！","Celestic Town. A quiet town that keeps the old stories of Sinnoh.":"神和镇。守护着神奥古老传说的宁静小镇。","The Celestic Ruins. Nobody remembers who built them.":"神和遗迹。没有人记得是谁建造的。","A mural of two great Pokémon, face to face. One seems to hold back time, the other to bend space itself.":"壁画上有两只巨大的宝可梦相对而立。一只仿佛能止住时间，另一只仿佛能扭曲空间。","So here is the new Champion. My Cynthia speaks of nothing else. I have been waiting for you.":"这就是新冠军啊。我家竹兰整天都在说你。我一直在等你。","You saw {dialga} and {palkia} at the Spear Pillar, dragged there by a chain. That is not how the old stories say they should be met.":"你在枪之柱见到的{dialga}和{palkia}，是被锁链拖来的。古老的传说里，不该这样与它们相见。","The mural in our ruins shows two orbs, the {adamant} and the {lustrous}. They were left long ago in Mt. Coronet, on the way up to the peak.":"我们遗迹的壁画上有两颗宝珠：{adamant}和{lustrous}。它们很久以前就留在天冠山里，在通往山顶的路上。","Find them and carry them to the Spear Pillar. To one who comes without a chain, the masters of time and space may yet answer.":"找到它们，带到枪之柱去。对不带锁链而来的人，时间和空间的主宰也许会回应。","The orbs lie in Mt. Coronet, on the way up to the Spear Pillar. Mind your step up there.":"宝珠就在天冠山里，在去枪之柱的路上。上山要当心。","A little girl is standing at the far end of the table, looking at you without a word...":"餐桌的另一头站着一个小女孩，一言不发地看着你……","You blink, and she is gone. There is no other door in the room.":"你眨了一下眼，她就不见了。这个房间明明没有别的门。","An old TV. Its screen stays dark.":"一台旧电视。屏幕一直是黑的。","An old TV. It is not even plugged in. People say it switches itself on at night, though.":"一台旧电视，连插头都没插。不过听说它到了晚上会自己打开。","The unplugged TV flickers on by itself! Something is moving inside the screen...":"没插电的电视自己闪烁着亮了起来！屏幕里有什么东西在动……","{mon} slipped back into the wires, and the screen went dark.":"{mon}又钻回了电线里，屏幕黑了下来。","A painting of a Pokémon and its Trainer. Wherever you stand, its eyes seem to be looking right at you...":"一幅画着宝可梦和它的训练家的画。不管你站在哪里，画里的眼睛好像都在盯着你……","Welcome to the Contest Hall! Here Pokémon show how fine they look, how well they dance and how they perform.":"欢迎来到华丽大赛会场！宝可梦在这里展示它们的外表、舞蹈和演技。","There are three rounds. In the Visual round, the judges look at your Pokémon's condition: Poffins help.":"比赛分三轮。在视觉审查中，评审会看宝可梦的状态：宝芬能帮上忙。","{mon} may now enter the {rank} of the {cat} contest.":"{mon}现在可以参加{cat}组的{rank}了。","Welcome to the Poffin House! We cook Poffins from berries. Pokémon love them, and they make them shine in contests.":"欢迎来到宝芬屋！我们用树果做宝芬。宝可梦很爱吃，吃了在比赛里会更出色。","{player} received a Poffin Case!":"{player}得到了宝芬盒！","Cook Poffins":"做宝芬","Feed a Poffin":"喂宝芬","Come back any time. The pot is always warm!":"随时欢迎再来。锅子一直是热的！","You have no berries to cook with. The clerk sells some.":"你没有可以用的树果。店员那里有卖。","Cook!":"开始做！","In the pot: {list}":"锅里：{list}","Your Poffin Case is full.":"宝芬盒已经满了。","{player} made a {poffin}! Level {n}, smoothness {s}.":"{player}做出了{poffin}！等级 {n}，顺滑度 {s}。","Your Poffin Case is empty. Cook some first!":"宝芬盒是空的。先做一些吧！","{poffin} Lv. {n}":"{poffin} Lv. {n}","Which Poffin?":"哪个宝芬？","{mon} can't eat any more Poffins.":"{mon}已经吃不下宝芬了。","{mon} ate the {poffin}!":"{mon}吃了{poffin}！","Plain berries, perfect for Poffins!":"普通的树果，最适合做宝芬！","Poffin chef":"宝芬厨师","The dance is my favourite part! You have to step right on the beat.":"我最喜欢舞蹈了！一定要踩准节拍。","A Pokémon in good condition shines in the Visual round. The Poffin House east of the road can help with that.":"状态好的宝可梦在视觉审查里很亮眼。路东边的宝芬屋能帮上忙。","Four berries in one Poffin make it much stronger. But a Pokémon can only eat so many!":"一个宝芬里放四颗树果会强很多。不过宝可梦能吃的数量有限！","A poster: \"Win a ribbon at every rank! Normal, Great, Ultra, Master.\"":"海报：“每个等级都拿一枚奖章！普通、高手、究极、大师。”","The boss is going up to the peak, and nobody follows him. Nobody!":"首领要上山顶，谁也不准跟着。谁也不准！","You followed him. I said nobody!":"你还是跟上来了。我都说了谁也不准！","There are more of us higher up. Many more.":"再往上还有我们的人。多得是。","I carried boxes all the way up this mountain. I am in no mood for you!":"我一路把箱子搬上这座山，没心情跟你耗！","And now my arms hurt and I have lost.":"现在胳膊疼，还输了。","I do not know what was in the boxes. I am not paid to know.":"我不知道箱子里装的是什么。这不归我管。","A kid, this high up? You should have stayed at the bottom!":"小孩子跑这么高？你该待在山脚下的！","I should have stayed at the bottom.":"该待在山脚下的是我。","It gets cold outside. I hope you brought a coat.":"外面很冷。希望你带了外套。","The way out to the snow is mine to guard. Turn around!":"通往雪地的出口归我看守。回去吧！","I was told this would be an easy post.":"他们说这个岗位很轻松的。","The boss walked past me without a word. He never even looked at me.":"首领一言不发地从我身边走过，看都没看我一眼。","You came through the snow for this? You must really want to lose!":"你穿过雪地就为了这个？这么想输吗！","My feet are too cold to think straight.":"脚太冷了，脑子都转不动了。","The ladder goes on up. I would stay here if I were you.":"梯子还能继续往上爬。换作是我就留在这里。","A new world is about to begin, and you are spoiling it!":"新世界就要开始了，你却来搅局！","Spoiled.":"全搅黄了。","What do you mean, a place for us? Of course there is a place for us. The boss said so.":"什么叫有没有我们的位置？当然有了。首领亲口说的。","The air is thin up here. Let me take your breath away!":"这里空气稀薄。让我来叫你喘不过气！","I think you took mine.":"喘不过气的好像是我。","Can you feel the mountain shaking? It started when the boss went up.":"你感觉到山在晃吗？首领上去之后就开始了。","This is the last cave before the peak. You will not see the end of it!":"这是山顶前最后一个洞穴。你走不到头的！","You saw the end of it.":"你走到头了。","The ruins on the peak are older than anybody knows.":"山顶的遗迹古老得没人说得清。","My Golbat has been waiting in the dark for days. It is not in a good mood!":"我的大嘴蝠在黑暗里等了好几天，心情很差！","Now it is in a worse one.":"现在它心情更差了。","Go on, then. The Commanders are up there.":"去吧。干部们就在上面。","Nobody reaches the Spear Pillar today!":"今天谁也别想到枪之柱！","Somebody just did.":"刚刚就有人做到了。","I have never seen the boss look happy before today. It was not a nice thing to see.":"我今天才第一次看到首领高兴的样子。那可不是什么好景象。","Nothing is getting past me while I watch this place. Go on, you will be late!":"有我守着这里，什么也别想过去。快去吧，要迟到了！","The boss has begun, and nobody is to disturb him. It will take both of us to make sure of that!":"首领已经开始了，谁也不许打扰。我们两个就是为这个守在这里的！","Both of us were not enough!":"我们两个都不够！","So you climbed all this way. You are just in time to watch.":"你竟然一路爬到了这里。来得正好，看着吧。","This is the Red Chain. With it, the masters of time and space must answer to me.":"这就是红色锁链。有了它，时间和空间的主宰都得听命于我。","{dialga} and {palkia} appeared among the pillars!":"{dialga}和{palkia}出现在石柱之间！","The old world ends here. Mars. Jupiter. See that I am not disturbed.":"旧世界到此为止。伙星，岁星，别让任何人打扰我。","You heard the boss. This is as far as you go.":"听到首领的话了吧。你只能走到这里。","I told you not to bother, did I not? Two Commanders at once. Good luck.":"我不是说过别白费力气吗？两位干部一起上。祝你好运。","Hold it right there! You are not doing this without me, {player}!":"等一下！这种事不能少了我，{player}！","I trained until I dropped, and then I ran all the way up here. That Commander owes me a rematch!":"我练到累趴下，然后一路跑上来。那个干部还欠我一场比赛！","Your team looks tired. Here, let me fix that.":"你的队伍看起来累了。来，交给我。","Two against two, {player}! Let us show them!":"二对二，{player}！让她们见识一下！","No! We are Commanders of Team Galactic!":"不！我们可是银河队的干部！","Stop now, if you like. It hardly matters. The boss has already won.":"想停手就停手吧，无所谓了。首领已经赢了。","Yes. Watch closely. The chain holds, and the world begins again, with no spirit left to spoil it.":"没错。看清楚了。锁链不会断，世界将重新开始，再也没有心灵来败坏它。","Suddenly the ground shook. A huge shadow rose out of the stones and spread across the pillars.":"地面突然震动起来。一道巨大的影子从石头里升起，笼罩了所有石柱。","{dialga} and {palkia} were gone!":"{dialga}和{palkia}消失了！","What is this? Something is tearing the air apart. This was no part of my world!":"这是什么？有东西在撕开空气。我的世界里没有这种东西！","A rift split the air, and dark shapes dragged Cyrus inside!":"空气裂开了一道缝隙，黑色的影子把赤日拖了进去！","Boss? Boss!":"首领？首领！","This is not what we were told would happen. Come on, Mars. We are leaving.":"这和说好的不一样。走吧，伙星。我们撤。","I came as fast as I could, and I see I am too late to stop it.":"我已经尽快赶来了，看来还是来不及阻止。","That shadow was Giratina. The old stories of Celestic Town tell of a Pokémon sent away for its violence, to a world behind our own.":"那道影子是骑拉帝纳。神和镇的古老传说里，有一只宝可梦因为太过暴戾，被放逐到了我们世界背后的另一个世界。","Cyrus reached for time and space, and it came to answer him. Now the way is open, and that world is pressing against this one.":"赤日想要夺取时间和空间，把它引了出来。现在通道已经打开，那个世界正压向这边。","Somebody has to go in after him. I am going, and I would be glad to have you beside me, {player}.":"必须有人进去追他。我要去，如果你能和我一起，那就太好了，{player}。","I will stay and guard this place. Somebody has to, and I just ran up a mountain. Do not be late coming back!":"我留下来守着这里。总得有人守，而且我刚跑完一座山。别太晚回来！","Fallen rocks block the ladder. There is no way up for now.":"落石挡住了梯子。现在上不去。","People in white uniforms came through in a great hurry. They cleared the rocks and went up that ladder!":"刚才有一群穿白制服的人急匆匆地过来，搬开落石，从那个梯子上去了！","The way up the mountain is closed by a rockfall. Nobody has been to the peak in years.":"上山的路被落石封住了。已经好多年没人上过山顶了。","The boss will not be pleased. Not that he is ever pleased.":"首领不会高兴的。虽说他也从没高兴过。","The rift has closed. Only a faint shimmer is left in the air.":"裂缝已经闭合，空气中只剩下一点微光。","Step into the rift when you are ready. I will be right behind you.":"准备好了就走进裂缝吧。我就跟在你后面。","So this is the world behind our own. Nothing here keeps still, not even the ground.":"原来这就是我们世界背后的世界。这里什么都不安定，连地面也一样。","A vast shadow slid across the dark overhead, and sank away below.":"一道巨大的影子掠过头顶的黑暗，沉向了下方。","Giratina. It went down, and Cyrus must be down there too. If this distortion keeps growing, it will swallow our world as well.":"是骑拉帝纳。它往下去了，赤日一定也在下面。这种扭曲再扩大下去，连我们的世界也会被吞没。","Those panels must lead deeper. I will go on ahead and look for the way. Do not stop for long.":"那些传送板一定通往更深的地方。我先去探路。别耽搁太久。","{uxie}, {mesprit} and {azelf} are here! They came after us.":"{uxie}、{mesprit}和{azelf}都来了！它们跟着我们过来了。","You set them free, and now they want to help. They know this place. Follow the panels, and they will meet us further down.":"你救了它们，现在它们想帮忙。它们熟悉这里。沿着传送板走，它们会在下面等我们。","He is just ahead. Your team has come a long way, so let me see to them first.":"他就在前面。你的队伍走了很远的路，先让我照看一下吧。","I will stay close, but this is your fight. He has never once listened to me.":"我就在附近，但这一战是你的。他从来没听过我的话。","Giratina sank away into the shadows.":"骑拉帝纳沉入了阴影之中。","Do you feel that? The ground has stopped shaking. Time and space are settling again.":"你感觉到了吗？地面不再震动了。时间和空间正在恢复平静。","So you have taken my new world from me as well. It makes no difference. I will stay here. In this place, at least, nobody feels anything.":"你连我的新世界也夺走了。无所谓。我留在这里。至少在这个地方，谁也不会有感情。","Cyrus...":"赤日……","Cyrus turned and walked away into the dark.":"赤日转过身，走进了黑暗。","We cannot make him come back. Over here, {player}. There is a way out, and I think it was left open for us.":"我们没办法逼他回来。这边，{player}。这里有出口，我想是特意为我们留着的。","We are back. The air smells of water. I have only read about this place: it is Sendoff Spring, a lake hidden in the mountains.":"我们回来了。空气里有水的味道。我只在书上读到过这里：这是送泉，藏在群山之中的湖。","The way we came has closed behind us. You did well in there, {player}. Better than I could have done alone.":"我们来时的路已经关上了。你在里面做得很好，{player}。比我一个人做得更好。","They say the cave over there leads back towards that world. If anything is left unfinished, that is where it will be.":"据说那边的洞窟通往那个世界。如果还有什么没了结的事，就在那里。","Professor Rowan needs to hear about this. Rest for a while first. You have earned it.":"这件事得告诉七灶博士。你先休息一下吧，这是你应得的。","I do not understand. Why can a heart as weak as yours not be broken?":"我不明白。这么软弱的心，为什么就是打不碎？","You did it. Quickly, let me help your team.":"你做到了。快，让我帮帮你的队伍。","Giratina came down out of the dark, and the whole island shook!":"骑拉帝纳从黑暗中降下，整座浮岛都震动起来！","It is furious. It will tear both worlds apart unless somebody stops it. {player}, it is looking at you!":"它怒不可遏。没人阻止的话，两个世界都会被它撕裂。{player}，它在盯着你！","Giratina is waiting in the dark of the cave.":"骑拉帝纳在洞窟的黑暗中等待着。","Giratina sank away into the shadows. It may come back if you leave the cave.":"骑拉帝纳沉入了阴影之中。离开洞窟后，它也许还会回来。","The warp panel is dark. Something is keeping it from working.":"传送板暗着。有什么东西让它无法启动。","Uxie is watching the hole beside it, and it does not blink.":"由克希目不转睛地盯着旁边的洞。","Mesprit looks from you to the hole, and back again.":"艾姆利多看看你，又看看洞，再看看你。","Azelf hovers over the hole, waiting.":"亚克诺姆悬在洞的上方，静静等待。","Those three are showing us something. A strong Pokémon could fill those holes, and I think that is what this panel is waiting for.":"它们三个在给我们指路。力气大的宝可梦可以把那些洞填上，我想这块传送板等的就是这个。","So you followed me, even here. Look around you. There is no spirit in this world, and that makes it perfect. I need nothing from yours. If you came to drag me back, you will have to defeat me.":"你竟然追到了这里。看看周围吧。这个世界没有心灵，所以才完美。我不需要你们世界的任何东西。想把我拖回去，就先打败我。","Even here. Even now.":"即使在这里。即使到了现在。","Excuse me! Are you going through Eterna Forest? It is dark and full of Trainers, and I am a little nervous on my own.":"不好意思！你要穿过百代森林吗？里面又暗又有很多训练家，我一个人有点害怕。","May I come along with you? My Chansey can heal your Pokémon after every battle.":"我可以跟你一起走吗？我的吉利蛋可以在每场对战后帮你的宝可梦回复。","Thank you! I will stay right behind you.":"谢谢你！我会紧跟在你后面的。","Oh... Then I will wait here a little longer. Tell me if you change your mind!":"哦……那我在这里再等一会儿。改变主意的话就告诉我！","We made it out of the forest! Thank you so much for letting me come along.":"我们走出森林了！谢谢你让我跟你一起走。","Eterna City is just ahead. Good luck at the Gym!":"百代市就在前面。道馆战加油！","The next Gym is in Hearthome City, on the far side of Mt. Coronet. Its Leader, Fantina, uses Ghost types. Spooky!":"下一个道馆在天冠山另一边的家缘市。那里的馆主梅丽莎使用幽灵属性。好吓人！","Cheryl's Chansey looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"芽米的吉利蛋照顾了你的宝可梦。它们完全恢复了！","The door is locked. A sign says: \"Team Galactic Eterna Building. Staff only.\"":"门锁着。告示写着：“银河队百代大楼。闲人免进。”","The cycle shop is closed. A note on the door says: \"Back soon!\"":"自行车店关着。门上的纸条写着：“马上回来！”","Hey, {player}! I went through the forest in no time. Did you get lost?":"喂，{player}！我一下子就穿过森林了。你是不是迷路了？","I am off to challenge Gardenia right now! Grass types do not stand a chance against my Starly!":"我现在就去挑战菜种！草属性根本打不过我的姆克儿！","Hey, Champion! Gardenia uses Grass-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠军！菜种使用草属性的宝可梦。","Fire, Flying, Bug, Poison and Ice moves work great on them. Water, Ground and Rock moves barely tickle them.":"火、飞行、虫、毒和冰属性的招式对它们很有效。水、地面和岩石属性的招式只是给它们挠痒痒。","Picked Piplup? Bring a Starly, or a Pokémon from home with the right moves. Up to level 25, they will listen to you here.":"选了波加曼？带上姆克儿，或是会合适招式的家乡宝可梦吧。25级以下的话，它们在这里都会听你的。","This is the Forest Badge. You earned it!":"这是森林徽章。这是你应得的！","{player} received the Forest Badge from Gardenia!":"{player}从菜种那里得到了森林徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 30 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，30级以下的宝可梦在神奥都会听你的话，就算来自其他地区也一样。","And take this. TM86 is Grass Knot: the heavier the foe, the harder it trips!":"还有这个。招式学习器86是打草结：对手越重，摔得越狠！","Wurmple evolve into Silcoon or Cascoon. Nobody can tell which until it happens.":"刺尾虫会进化成甲壳茧或盾甲茧。不到进化的那一刻谁也不知道。","Lindsey":"琳赛","This forest is full of strange feelings. Some come from the Pokémon, some from somewhere older.":"这片森林充满了奇怪的感觉。有些来自宝可梦，有些来自更古老的东西。","Zackary":"扎卡里","I finally made it out of the forest. I need a battle to celebrate!":"我终于走出森林了。得来场对战庆祝一下！","Some celebration that was.":"这算什么庆祝啊。","Eterna City is the oldest city in Sinnoh. People say its statue is older than the city itself.":"百代市是神奥最古老的城市。听说那里的雕像比城市本身还要古老。","Sharon":"莎伦","Going to Eterna? Then test your team on mine first!":"要去百代市？那先拿我的队伍试试你的吧！","Your team passed the test.":"你的队伍通过考验了。","Gardenia, the Eterna Gym Leader, sometimes walks in the forest to talk to the trees.":"百代道馆的馆主菜种有时会到森林里散步，和树木说话。","Rocks fell on the path to Mt. Coronet. Nobody gets through until they are cleared!":"通往天冠山的路上落石了。清理完之前谁也过不去！","Cycling Road is closed for repairs. Come back when it is finished!":"自行车道正在维修，暂时关闭。修好了再来吧！","This is the Team Galactic Eterna Building. Members only. Scram, kid!":"这里是银河队百代大楼。只准成员进入。快滚，小鬼！","Gardenia's Gym is full of plants. Some days you cannot even see the Trainers for the leaves!":"菜种的道馆里到处都是植物。有时候叶子多到连训练家都看不见！","Eterna is a city of old things: old stories, old trees, and a statue nobody can date.":"百代市是座充满古老事物的城市：古老的传说、古老的树木，还有一座没人知道年代的雕像。","Grass types can put you to sleep or paralyze you with their powders. Bring Awakenings and Paralyze Heals!":"草属性宝可梦会用粉末让你睡着或麻痹。多带些解眠药和解麻药！","The statue in the square? My grandmother said it shows a Pokémon that rules over time itself. Who knows!":"广场上的雕像？我奶奶说，那是一只掌管时间的宝可梦。谁知道呢！","Jenna":"珍娜","Breathe in. Smell that? That is the scent of your defeat!":"深呼吸。闻到了吗？那是你失败的味道！","My perfume did not work...":"我的香水不管用……","Gardenia says every plant has its own scent, and every Pokémon its own strength.":"菜种说，每株植物都有自己的香气，每只宝可梦都有自己的力量。","This Gym is like a jungle! I love it here.":"这个道馆就像丛林一样！我好喜欢。","Lost in the jungle...":"在丛林里迷路了……","Fire burns, Flying pecks, Bug bites: Grass types have lots of weak spots!":"火会烧、飞行会啄、虫会咬：草属性的弱点可多了！","Angela":"安琪拉","My Roselia's roses are lovely, but they have thorns!":"我的毒蔷薇的玫瑰很漂亮，但是有刺哦！","Pricked by my own thorns.":"被自己的刺扎到了。","Gardenia's Roserade is the most elegant Pokémon I have ever seen.":"菜种的罗丝雷朵是我见过最优雅的宝可梦。","Mariah":"玛丽亚","Gardenia is right behind me. You will not reach her!":"菜种就在我后面。你别想过去！","Go on, then. She is waiting.":"去吧。她在等你。","Gardenia's Turtwig is so cute. Do not let that fool you!":"菜种的草苗龟超可爱的。可别被它骗了！","Welcome to the Eterna Gym! I am Gardenia, the Gym Leader, and I just love Grass-type Pokémon. A Champion of three regions? My Grass Pokémon will not wilt for anybody!":"欢迎来到百代道馆！我是馆主菜种，最喜欢草属性的宝可梦了。三个地区的冠军？我的草属性宝可梦可不会为任何人枯萎！","Amazing... You made my garden bloom in a whole new way!":"太厉害了……你让我的花园以全新的方式绽放了！","Route 205. East: Eterna City. West: Eterna Forest.":"205号道路。东：百代市　西：百代森林","An ancient statue of a Pokémon. The plaque says it stood here long before the city, and that it shows a Pokémon from the oldest stories of Sinnoh.":"一座古老的宝可梦雕像。铭牌上写着，它早在城市建成之前就在这里了，雕的是神奥最古老的传说中的宝可梦。","Team Galactic grabbed my Clefairy right out of my shop and took it into that building!":"银河队从我店里抢走了我的皮皮，带进那栋大楼里了！","I cannot fight them on my own. Please, help my Clefairy!":"我一个人对付不了他们。求求你，救救我的皮皮！","Oh, {player}! Team Galactic took the cycle shop owner's Clefairy into their building.":"啊，{player}！银河队把自行车店老板的皮皮带进他们的大楼了。","You beat me, so I know you are strong. Go on in! I will stay out here and make sure none of them sneak away.":"你打败过我，我知道你很强。进去吧！我会守在外面，不让他们任何人溜走。","Cycle Shop Owner":"自行车店老板","The Trainers here like to battle two at a time. If they do, Chansey and I will battle beside you!":"这里的训练家喜欢两个人一起对战。真遇上了，我和吉利蛋会在你身边一起战斗！","Stay close! If Trainers come at us two at a time, Chansey and I will battle beside you.":"别走散了！要是训练家两个人一起过来，我和吉利蛋会在你身边一起战斗。","Phillip & Donald":"菲利普和唐纳德","We are bug hunting in pairs today. Want to see what we caught?":"今天我们两个人一起抓虫子。想看看我们抓到了什么吗？","Our bugs got squashed...":"我们的虫子被打扁了……","Jack & Briana":"杰克和布丽安娜","The forest is our bug paradise! Two of you? Then two of us!":"森林是我们的虫子天堂！你们有两个人？那我们也两个！","My collection got squashed, and her Pachirisu too...":"我的收藏被打扁了，她的帕奇利兹也是……","Pachirisu are not bugs, but Briana says it can come along anyway.":"帕奇利兹不是虫子，不过布丽安娜说它也可以一起来。","Kody & Rachael":"柯迪和瑞秋","We saw the two of you coming in a dream. In the dream, we won!":"我们在梦里看到你们两个来了。在梦里，是我们赢了！","The dream was wrong...":"梦是假的……","The old house deep in the forest? Even we cannot see what waits inside.":"森林深处的那栋旧房子？连我们也看不见里面有什么。","Lindsey & Elijah":"琳赛和以利亚","We sensed you coming from far away. We also sense that you will lose!":"我们老远就感应到你们来了。我们还感应到你们会输！","Our senses failed us...":"我们的感应失灵了……","Please take this as a token of my thanks. A Pokémon wearing it grows fond of you faster.":"请收下这个，当作我的谢礼。带着它的宝可梦会更快和你亲近。","The Battle Factory. Rental Pokémon, at level 50 or the Open Level.":"对战工厂。租借宝可梦，可选 50 级或开放级别。","Every rental in this building has a weakness. I know all of them. Do you?":"这栋楼里的每只租借宝可梦都有弱点。我全都知道。你呢？","A team you have never trained, against a team you have never seen. That is the Factory!":"用从没训练过的队伍，对抗从没见过的队伍。这就是工厂！","I spent all night reading the rental list. Let us see if it pays off.":"我整晚都在读租借名单。看看有没有用吧。","Choose well, battle better!":"选得好，打得更好！","You used them better than I would have...":"你用得比我还好……","I chose the wrong three. Again.":"我又选错三只了。","Not bad! Want to trade one of mine?":"不错嘛！要不要换一只我的？","Rentals, but no luck at all on my side.":"都是租来的，可运气一点也不站在我这边。","Twenty wins with rentals? Then you can read a Pokémon at a glance. I am Thorton, the Factory Head. I can too. Let us compare!":"用租借宝可梦连赢二十场？那你一眼就能看透宝可梦。我是工厂头目捩木。我也能。来比比看吧！","You again! I have run every number since our last battle. This time the odds are mine.":"又是你！上次对战后我把所有数字都算了一遍。这次胜算在我这边。","Hm. Your choices beat my calculations. Take this, you earned it.":"嗯。你的选择胜过了我的计算。拿去吧，这是你应得的。","Unbelievable... No table I made predicted that. You are the real deal.":"难以置信……我做的表格没有一张预料到这个。你是货真价实的高手。","Here, you battle with rented Pokémon. Out of the six we offer, choose three, for single and for double battles alike.":"这里用租借宝可梦对战。我们提供六只，单打和双打都从中选三只。","At level 50, every Pokémon battles at level 50. At the Open Level, every Pokémon battles at level 100.":"50 级时，所有宝可梦都以 50 级对战。开放级别时，所有宝可梦都以 100 级对战。","Which level will you challenge?":"要挑战哪个级别？","Thorton recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Silver Print!":"捩木认可了你的知识。你得到了银色印记！","Thorton recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Gold Print!":"捩木认可了你的知识。你得到了金色印记！","Nobody here battles with their own Pokémon. Read the moves and the held item of each rental before you choose.":"这里没有人用自己的宝可梦对战。选之前，先看清每只租借宝可梦的招式和携带道具。","The Factory Head, Thorton, battles Trainers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row. He knows every rental by heart.":"工厂头目捩木会和单打连胜到第 21 场和第 49 场的训练家对战。他把每只租借宝可梦都记得清清楚楚。","At the Open Level, everything battles at level 100. Only this Factory offers that.":"开放级别时，全都以 100 级对战。只有这座工厂有这种玩法。","A notebook lies open on the desk: \"What the first Pokémon in your party does outside battle.\"":"桌上摊着一本笔记本：《队伍里第一只宝可梦在对战以外的作用》。","\"{a} and {b}: more wild Pokémon. {c} and {d}: fewer. {e} in a sandstorm and {f} in the snow: fewer too.\"":"“{a}和{b}：野生宝可梦变多。{c}和{d}：变少。{e}在沙暴中、{f}在下雪时：也会变少。”","\"{a} and {b}: wild Pokémon much weaker than it often run off. {c}, {d} and {e}: wild Pokémon at their strongest more often.\"":"“{a}和{b}：比它弱很多的野生宝可梦常常会逃走。{c}、{d}和{e}：更常遇到等级最高的野生宝可梦。”","\"{a}: more Steel types. {b}: more Electric types. {c}: often the same nature as it. {d}: often the other gender.\"":"“{a}：钢属性的变多。{b}：电属性的变多。{c}：常常和它同样性格。{d}：常常是异性。”","\"{a} and {b} sometimes find something after a battle won. With {c} or {d} in the party, Eggs hatch twice as fast.\"":"“{a}和{b}在赢得对战后有时会捡到东西。队伍里有{c}或{d}时，蛋孵化的速度加倍。”","A textbook lies on the desk: \"Walking with a Partner.\"":"书桌上放着一本教科书：《和伙伴同行》。","\"When someone walks with you through tall grass or a cave, wild Pokémon often come out two at a time. You and your partner battle them together.\"":"“有人和你一起走在草丛或洞窟里时，野生宝可梦常常会两只一起出现。你和伙伴要一起对付它们。”","\"A Poké Ball cannot be aimed while two wild Pokémon are out. Knock one out first, then throw at the other.\"":"“两只野生宝可梦都在的时候，精灵球是瞄不准的。先打倒一只，再对另一只丢球。”","\"On the water, your partner still battles beside you, though only one wild Pokémon comes at a time.\"":"“在水上，伙伴也会在你身边一起战斗，只是野生宝可梦一次只来一只。”","Come on, old man! Hand over all your Honey. Team Galactic needs it!":"快点，老头！把你的甜甜蜜全交出来。银河队要用！","{player}! Help! These people want every jar of Honey I have!":"{player}！救命！这些人要把我的甜甜蜜全部抢走！","Who is this, a Trainer? Get lost, kid! ...No? Then you can battle us both, one after the other!":"这是谁，训练家吗？滚开，小鬼！……不走？那就一个接一个跟我们两个打吧！","This kid is too strong! Back to the windworks, quick!":"这小鬼太强了！快回发电厂！","In their hurry, the grunts dropped a key. It is the key to the Valley Windworks!":"手下们慌忙之中掉了一把钥匙。是山谷发电厂的钥匙！","Thank you! They wanted my Honey to lure Pokémon. And they were talking about the windworks, south-east of town across Route 205.":"谢谢你！他们想用我的甜甜蜜来引诱宝可梦。他们还提到了发电厂，就在镇子东南边，穿过205号道路就到。","Pokémon love sweet Honey. Spread some on a tree and they come from all around!":"宝可梦最爱甜甜蜜了。把它涂在树上，宝可梦就会从四面八方聚过来！","Please, help me! Those two will not leave me alone!":"求求你，帮帮我！那两个人一直缠着我！","My dad came home from the windworks! He says a Trainer chased the bad people away. Was it you? Thank you!":"爸爸从发电厂回来了！他说有个训练家把坏人赶走了。是你吗？谢谢你！","My dad works at the Valley Windworks. People in strange space suits took it over, and now he cannot come home...":"我爸爸在山谷发电厂工作。一群穿着奇怪太空服的人占领了那里，爸爸回不了家……","I saw some of them in Floaroma Meadow, north of town, too.":"我在镇子北边的苑之镇花田也看到了他们的人。","An Oran Berry heals a Pokémon a little when its HP runs low. Let your Pokémon hold one!":"橙橙果能在宝可梦HP变少时帮它回复一点。让你的宝可梦带一颗吧！","Welcome to our flower shop! We grow Berries as well as flowers.":"欢迎光临我们的花店！我们除了花，也种树果。","A Trainer passing through? Then take these, with our compliments.":"路过的训练家？那这些送给你吧。","The door is locked. A Team Galactic sign says: \"Keep out!\"":"门锁着。银河队的告示写着：“禁止进入！”","Thank you! I am going home to my daughter in Floaroma. She must be so worried.":"谢谢你！我要回苑之镇见我女儿了。她一定担心坏了。","Help! Those people in strange suits locked me in. They want the windworks' power for something.":"救命！那些穿着奇怪衣服的人把我关在这里。他们想拿发电厂的电力去做什么事。","Hmph. So you are the real thing. Fine: we got the readings we came for anyway.":"哼。看来你是真有本事。算了，反正我们要的数据已经到手了。","Team Galactic is going to make a brand-new world, and nobody will get in our way. Bye-bye!":"银河队要创造一个全新的世界，谁也别想阻挠我们。拜拜！","Team Galactic left the Valley Windworks.":"银河队离开了山谷发电厂。","A Drifloon is drifting by the windworks, riding the valley wind...":"一只飘飘球乘着山谷的风，飘到了发电厂旁边……","Honey Seller":"卖甜甜蜜的人","Sarah":"莎拉","The road north was blocked for days. Now that it is open, I want a battle!":"北边的路封了好几天。现在通了，我要来场对战！","I waited all that time for this?":"我等了这么久就为了这个？","Past the cave is Floaroma Town. It smells of flowers all year round.":"穿过洞窟就是苑之镇。那里一年到头都飘着花香。","My Wurmple might become a Beautifly or a Dustox. Help it grow!":"我的刺尾虫可能会变成狩猎凤蝶，也可能变成毒粉蛾。帮它成长吧！","It grew a little, I think.":"它好像长大了一点。","Nobody knows which one a Wurmple will become. That is the fun of it!":"谁也不知道刺尾虫会变成哪一种。这才有意思嘛！","This tunnel was dug to carry flowers from Floaroma to the city. Now it is mostly Zubat.":"这条隧道原本是为了把苑之镇的花运到城里而挖的。现在里面几乎全是超音蝠。","Liv & Liz":"丽芙和丽兹","We are twins, and so are our Pachirisu! Two against two!":"我们是双胞胎，我们的帕奇利兹也是！二对二！","Two of us, and we still lost...":"我们有两个人，还是输了……","In a double battle, pick a move that hits both foes at once. We learned that the hard way.":"双打对战时，要选能同时攻击两个对手的招式。我们是吃了苦头才学会的。","I am camping by the flowers tonight. First, a battle!":"今晚我要在花丛边露营。先来场对战吧！","Time to pitch my tent...":"该搭帐篷了……","Budew close up at night and open again in the morning sun.":"含羞苞晚上会闭起来，早上晒到太阳又会张开。","North of town is Floaroma Meadow, where the man who sells Honey keeps his flowers.":"镇子北边是苑之镇花田，卖甜甜蜜的人在那里种花。","The flowers here bloom all year. Grandpa says it is because the people who live here care for them so much.":"这里的花一年四季都开。爷爷说，那是因为住在这里的人都很用心照顾它们。","East of town, Route 205 crosses the river. Its south side leads to the Valley Windworks.":"镇子东边的205号道路跨过一条河。往南走就是山谷发电厂。","Eterna Forest is long and dark. Take plenty of Potions, dear.":"百代森林又长又暗。多带些伤药吧，孩子。","Berries grow on plants, too. Here we grow them for Trainers and their Pokémon.":"树果也是植物结的。我们在这里为训练家和他们的宝可梦种树果。","Long ago this land was all bare rock. One person planted a single flower, and Floaroma grew from it.":"很久以前，这片土地全是光秃秃的岩石。有人种下了一朵花，苑之镇就从那里开始了。","Erick":"艾瑞克","Shh! You will scare the fish! ...Oh well, they are gone. Battle me instead!":"嘘！你会把鱼吓跑的！……算了，已经跑了。那就和我对战吧！","Even the Magikarp swam away...":"连鲤鱼王都游走了……","The Shellos in this river are pink. In the east of Sinnoh they are blue, they say.":"这条河里的无壳海兔是粉红色的。听说在神奥东部是蓝色的。","I hiked here all the way from Oreburgh. My legs are tired, but my Pokémon are not!":"我从黑金市一路走到这里。我的腿累了，但我的宝可梦可不累！","Now my Pokémon are tired too.":"现在我的宝可梦也累了。","The windworks to the south makes power from the wind that blows down the valley.":"南边的发电厂利用顺着山谷吹下来的风发电。","Siena":"西耶娜","A picnic by the river, and then a battle. Perfect day!":"在河边野餐，再来场对战。完美的一天！","Well, the picnic was nice.":"嗯，野餐还是挺开心的。","People say Eterna Forest is full of Trainers. Be careful in there.":"听说百代森林里有很多训练家。进去要小心哦。","This windworks belongs to Team Galactic now. Go home, kid!":"这座发电厂现在归银河队了。回家去吧，小鬼！","Hey! That was not supposed to happen!":"喂！怎么会这样！","Even if you get in, the Commander will deal with you.":"就算你进去了，干部也会收拾你的。","An intruder? The Commander will not be happy. I will stop you right here!":"有入侵者？干部会不高兴的。我就在这里拦住你！","I am going to be in so much trouble...":"我要倒大霉了……","Commander Mars is not someone you want to make angry.":"最好别惹伙星干部生气。","Huh? A kid made it all the way in here? I am Mars, one of Team Galactic's Commanders. We are borrowing this place's power for a little project. Want to stop me? Go ahead and try!":"咦？居然有小鬼闯到这里来了？我是银河队的干部伙星。我们正借用这里的电力做个小计划。想阻止我？那就试试看吧！","Ugh! I lost to a kid?":"可恶！我居然输给了小鬼？","Route 204. North: the Ravaged Path and Floaroma Town. South: Jubilife City.":"204号道路。北：荒芜小路、苑之镇　南：祝庆市","Route 204. North: Floaroma Town. South: the Ravaged Path.":"204号道路。北：苑之镇　南：荒芜小路","Floaroma Town. A town of flowers, where the air always smells sweet.":"苑之镇。花之小镇，空气中总是飘着甜美的香气。","Floaroma Meadow. Please do not pick the flowers.":"苑之镇花田。请勿摘花。","Route 205. North: Eterna Forest. South: the Valley Windworks. West: Floaroma Town.":"205号道路。北：百代森林　南：山谷发电厂　西：苑之镇","Valley Windworks. The wind of the valley turns into power for all of Sinnoh.":"山谷发电厂。将山谷的风化为电力，送往整个神奥。","Or use it right where you stand, in tall grass or a cave. Wild Pokémon will come out at once!":"或者就在你站的地方用，在草丛或洞窟里，野生宝可梦马上就会出来！","The Battle Frontier. The Battle Tower is open: the other facilities follow soon.":"对战开拓区。对战塔已经开放，其他设施也会陆续开放。","This tower is the top of Sinnoh. Every Trainer here came to win. So did I.":"这座塔是神奥的顶点。来这里的训练家都是为了赢。我也一样。","Twenty-one battles, forty-nine... the number means nothing until you win the next one.":"二十一场、四十九场……在赢下一场之前，数字都没有意义。","Show me the bond you built on your way up!":"让我看看你一路爬上来建立的羁绊吧！","I have watched your streak from the stands. Now I want to see it up close.":"我在看台上看着你一路连胜。现在我想近距离看看。","No more warm-ups. Let us battle!":"热身结束了。来对战吧！","Ha! Not bad at all.":"哈！很不错嘛。","That stung. Keep climbing.":"真痛啊。继续往上爬吧。","Your team clearly trusts you.":"你的队伍显然很信任你。","I lost, but what a battle!":"我输了，不过真是一场好对战！","All right, you earned that one.":"好吧，这场是你应得的。","So you are the one who has won twenty in a row! I am Palmer, the Tower Tycoon. My son never stops talking about you. Now show me why!":"原来连赢二十场的就是你！我是塔主桄榔。我儿子成天都在说你的事。让我看看为什么吧！","Forty-eight wins! I have been waiting for you. This time I bring my strongest team. Hold nothing back!":"四十八连胜！我一直在等你。这次我带来了最强的队伍。拿出全力吧！","Ha ha! What a battle! I can see why my son calls you his rival.":"哈哈！真是一场好对战！我明白为什么我儿子说你是他的劲敌了。","Wonderful! I have nothing left to show you. You are the true master of this tower!":"太精彩了！我已经没有什么能教你的了。你才是这座塔真正的主人！","The Tower Tycoon has come to battle you himself!":"塔主亲自来和你对战了！","Palmer recognizes your strength. You earned the Silver Print!":"桄榔认可了你的实力。你得到了银色印记！","Palmer recognizes your strength. You earned the Gold Print!":"桄榔认可了你的实力。你得到了金色印记！","Your Pokémon received the {ribbon}!":"你的宝可梦得到了{ribbon}！","Fifty double battles in a row! Your Pokémon received the {ribbon}!":"双打五十连胜！你的宝可梦得到了{ribbon}！","The Tower Tycoon, Palmer, battles challengers who reach the 21st and the 49th single battle in a row.":"塔主桄榔会和单打连胜到第 21 场和第 49 场的挑战者对战。","Beat him and you earn a Print, and your Pokémon earn a ribbon. Fifty double battles in a row earn a ribbon too.":"打败他就能得到印记，你的宝可梦也会得到奖章。双打五十连胜也能得到奖章。","Silver Print: {s}. Gold Print: {g}. Battle Points: {n}.":"银色印记：{s}。金色印记：{g}。对战点数：{n}。","Welcome to the Training Stall! Vitamins and held items, for Battle Points.":"欢迎光临训练摊位！营养饮料和携带道具，都用对战点数兑换。","Welcome to the Move Stall! Our TMs teach the moves the Battle Frontier's best Trainers use.":"欢迎光临招式摊位！我们的招式学习器能教会对战开拓区高手们爱用的招式。","They say the Tower Tycoon is the father of a boy from Twinleaf Town. He waits at the top for anyone who wins twenty in a row.":"听说塔主是双叶镇某个男孩的父亲。他在塔顶等着连赢二十场的人。","Battle Points from the Tower can be spent at the Battle Shops. I want a Scope Lens!":"对战塔的对战点数可以在对战商店用掉。我想要焦点镜！","The Battle Shops. Battle Points for items and TMs.":"对战商店。用对战点数兑换道具和招式学习器。","In multi battles, a Trainer you have traveled with battles beside you. Fifty wins in a row earn a ribbon as well.":"组队对战中，旅途上同行过的训练家会和你并肩作战。连赢五十场也能获得奖章。","Welcome to the Battle Frontier! Five facilities wait for the strongest Trainers.":"欢迎来到对战开拓区！五个设施等待着最强的训练家。","All five facilities are open at last. I hope I am still young enough to battle in every one of them.":"五个设施终于都开放了。希望我还打得动，每一个都去挑战看看。","The Battle Tower. Single, double and multi battles, seven in a row, for Battle Points.":"对战塔。单打、双打与组队对战，连赢七场，就能获得对战点数。","Ho! A visitor who rode my belts all the way here! I am Fuego, and this is my ironworks.":"哈！居然有人坐着我的传送带一路来到这里！我是多多罗，这里是我的钢铁厂。","Anyone who makes it this far gets a present. Here: a stone with a fire burning inside it.":"能走到这里的人都有礼物。来，这是一块里面燃着火焰的石头。","Some Pokémon change when they touch it. Find out which!":"有些宝可梦碰到它就会起变化。去找找看是哪些吧！","Fire and iron, that is all I need. Well, and my belts.":"火和铁，我就只需要这两样。噢，还有我的传送带。","Dillan":"迪伦","No visitors on the factory floor! Unless they can battle!":"工厂车间不准外人进来！除非你会对战！","Back to the furnace for me.":"我还是回熔炉那边去吧。","Mind the belts. They do not stop for anyone.":"小心传送带。它们可不会为谁停下来。","Holden":"霍尔顿","These Magnemite keep the machines running. Want to feel the current?":"这些小磁怪让机器一直运转。想尝尝电流的滋味吗？","Magnemite stick to the iron here. Sometimes I have to peel them off.":"小磁怪老是吸在这里的铁上。有时候我得把它们一只只剥下来。","Conrad":"康拉德","Magmar keeps the furnace hot. Let us see if you can take the heat!":"鸭嘴火兽让熔炉一直保持火热。看看你受不受得了这股热气！","You cooled us right down.":"你一下子就让我们冷静下来了。","Mr. Fuego says the hottest iron makes the best steel. I think he means people too.":"多多罗先生说，烧得最热的铁才能炼出最好的钢。我觉得他说的也是人。","Fuego Ironworks. Iron goes in, wonders come out!":"多多罗钢铁厂。送进去的是铁，造出来的是奇迹！","In the pale light of the clearing, {mon} turns and looks at you. Its wings shimmer like thin clouds.":"在林间空地淡淡的光里，{mon}转过身来看着你。它的翅膀像薄薄的云一样闪着微光。","{mon} gave a clear cry and rose into the sky!":"{mon}发出一声清亮的鸣叫，飞上了天空！","Something glows softly where {mon} was standing...":"{mon}刚才站着的地方，有什么东西在微微发光……","Shall we head back to Canalave?":"我们回水脉市吧？","Take your time. I will wait here with the boat.":"慢慢来。我在这里守着船等你。","Fullmoon Island. They say a Pokémon that brings good dreams rests in the wood on nights of the full moon.":"满月岛。传说有一只带来美梦的宝可梦，会在满月之夜于林中歇息。","You! You are the kid who keeps turning up at the lakes!":"是你！就是你老在湖边冒出来！","There is nothing here for you! And I have never heard of any storage key, so do not ask me about it!":"这里没你的事！我也从没听说过什么仓库钥匙，别问我！","I just remembered something I have to do. Somewhere else. Far from here!":"我突然想起有件事要办。在别的地方。离这里很远的地方！","The grunt ran off, and a stranger in a long coat stepped up from nowhere and picked something off the ground.":"手下逃走了。一个穿长风衣的陌生人不知从哪里冒出来，从地上捡起了什么东西。","Aha! He has dropped the very thing I was after. A most fortunate accident.":"啊哈！他掉的正是我要找的东西。真是幸运的意外。","Forgive me, I should introduce myself. They call me Looker, of the International Police. Do not tell anyone.":"失礼了，我该先自我介绍。大家叫我帅哥，是国际警察。别告诉任何人。","This key opens their warehouse in the north-east of the city, and the warehouse is the back way into this building.":"这把钥匙能打开他们在城市东北边的仓库，而仓库就是这栋大楼的后门。","The three Pokémon from the lakes must be somewhere inside. It is too much for one detective.":"三只湖里的宝可梦一定就在里面。这件事我一个侦探应付不来。","Will you come in with me?":"你愿意和我一起进去吗？","I understand. It is a great deal to ask. But those Pokémon cannot wait for long.":"我明白，这个请求确实不小。但那些宝可梦等不了太久。","Splendid! I will meet you at the warehouse. Walk casually, and try not to look like a detective.":"太好了！我们在仓库见。走路自然一点，别让人看出你像个侦探。","There you are. Excellent timing. Allow me.":"你来了。时机正好。交给我吧。","Looker used the storage key. The door slid open!":"帅哥用了仓库钥匙。门滑开了！","The stairs beyond go down to the basement, and from there the way runs under the city to their building.":"那边的楼梯通往地下室，从那里可以穿过城市地下，走到他们的大楼。","Look out for the panels on the floor down there, and for a key to the doors of the building. I will search the rooms up here.":"下面地板上有传送板，要留意。还要找到打开大楼各扇门的钥匙。我来搜查上面这些房间。","Friends. Look at the world outside these walls. It is unfinished and weak, and it is ruled by feelings.":"各位。看看这些墙外面的世界吧。它残缺、软弱，被感情所支配。","Soon the power of time and space will be in our hands. With it we will make a new world, and each of you will have your place there.":"时间和空间的力量很快就会落入我们手中。我们将用它创造新的世界，你们每个人在那里都会有一席之地。","Long live Team Galactic!":"银河队万岁！","The day is close. Go back to your posts.":"那一天不远了。回到各自的岗位去吧。","Cyrus and the grunts left the meeting room.":"赤日和手下们离开了会议室。","The console has gone dark. There is nothing more it can do.":"控制台已经暗了下来，什么也做不了了。","There is a large red switch on the console. Press it?":"控制台上有一个红色的大开关。要按下去吗？","The glass tanks slid open!":"玻璃舱滑开了！","{uxie}, {mesprit} and {azelf} shot out of their tanks, circled the room once and were gone, each to its own lake.":"{uxie}、{mesprit}和{azelf}冲出玻璃舱，在房间里绕了一圈，便各自飞回了自己的湖。","So they go home. It changes nothing. The boss has the Red Chain, and that was all he ever wanted from them.":"它们回家了啊。这改变不了什么。首领已经拿到红色锁链，他要的就只有这个。","He has gone up Mt. Coronet to call the two he really wants. If he can truly make a new world, I wonder who will be left in it.":"他上天冠山去召唤他真正想要的那两只了。如果他真能创造新世界，不知道那里还会剩下谁。","{player}! Three Pokémon just flew straight through the wall past my ear! You did it!":"{player}！刚才有三只宝可梦穿墙而过，从我耳边飞走了！你成功了！","I will take care of what is left of this building. But Cyrus has gone to Mt. Coronet, and I do not think the International Police can climb that high.":"这栋大楼剩下的事交给我。不过赤日去了天冠山，国际警察恐怕爬不了那么高。","Rest, and get ready. I have a feeling this is not over.":"好好休息，做好准备。我有预感，事情还没有结束。","The warp panel is switched off. Nothing happens.":"传送板没有启动。什么也没发生。","What I needed from the lake Pokémon is already mine: the Red Chain. The three of them are of no more use to me.":"我需要从湖之宝可梦身上得到的东西已经到手了：红色锁链。那三只对我已经没有用处。","Take this. It is a ball that never fails. There will be no need for it in my world.":"拿去吧。这是绝不会失手的球。在我的世界里用不上它。","If you want those three, they are in the laboratory, through the warp panel in this room. Saturn is there. I am leaving for Mt. Coronet.":"你要找那三只的话，它们在实验室，从这个房间的传送板过去。镇星在那里。我要去天冠山了。","Cyrus left the room. The warp panel began to hum.":"赤日离开了房间。传送板嗡嗡地响了起来。","Enough. The machine has done its work, so it no longer matters who touches it.":"够了。机器的任务已经完成，谁碰它都无所谓了。","The switch is on the console, behind me. Do as you like.":"开关在我身后的控制台上。随你的便吧。","This basement is off limits! How did you even get down here?":"这个地下室禁止入内！你到底是怎么下来的？","That door was supposed to stay locked!":"那扇门本来应该一直锁着的！","The panels on the floor are how we get around down here. Just step on one.":"这里靠地上的传送板走动。踩上去就行了。","Somebody left a key lying around down here. I am guarding it until they remember where it was!":"有人把钥匙忘在这里了。在他想起来之前，由我看守！","Guarding things is harder than it looks.":"看守东西比想象中难多了。","That key opens every locked door in the building. Do not tell anyone I told you.":"那把钥匙能打开大楼里所有上锁的门。别说是我告诉你的。","You came in the back way? Nobody comes in the back way!":"你从后门进来的？根本没人走后门！","From now on I will watch the back way.":"从今以后我要盯紧后门。","The stairs are right over there. Not that it will do you any good.":"楼梯就在那边。不过对你也没什么用。","Fredrick":"弗雷德里克","An intruder! Good. Let me record how quickly you lose.":"有入侵者！正好。让我记录一下你输得有多快。","The result does not match my prediction...":"结果和我的预测不符……","We drew something remarkable out of the three lake Pokémon: a chain, as red as a warning light. The boss has plans for it.":"我们从三只湖之宝可梦身上提取出了了不起的东西：一条红得像警示灯的锁链。首领自有打算。","Members only on this floor. Do you have a card? I did not think so!":"这层只有成员才能进。你有会员卡吗？我就知道没有！","I should have asked for the card first.":"我应该先查卡的。","There is a lock on that door. If you have the key, it is no business of mine.":"那扇门上了锁。你要是有钥匙，就不关我的事了。","The boss is giving a speech today, and I will not miss it because of you!":"今天首领要演讲，我可不能因为你错过！","Now I am going to be late.":"这下要迟到了。","Step on that panel and you will come out on the far side of the wall.":"踩上那块传送板，就会到墙的另一边。","You used the panel? Those are for staff!":"你用了传送板？那是员工专用的！","I will be writing a very angry report.":"我要写一份非常生气的报告。","Everyone is gathering upstairs. You could go and listen, I suppose.":"大家都在楼上集合。你想听的话，大概也能去听听。","The world as it is cannot be mended.":"这个世界已经无法修补了。","Quiet! The boss is speaking!":"安静！首领在讲话！","The meeting is about to start, and you are not on the list!":"会议马上要开始了，名单上没有你！","You are still not on the list.":"名单上还是没有你。","The boss always speaks in the room behind that door. You will want the key.":"首领总是在那扇门后面的房间讲话。你得有钥匙才行。","A new world is coming, and I am going to be in it!":"新世界就要来了，里面一定有我的位置！","It will still come. You will see.":"它还是会来的。你等着瞧。","The boss promised us a place in the new world. All of us.":"首领答应过，新世界有我们的位置。我们所有人。","Nobody gets to the boss. Not while I am standing here!":"只要我站在这里，谁也别想见到首领！","I am still standing, at least.":"至少我还站着。","The boss will not be as easy as me. I hope.":"首领可不会像我这么好对付。但愿如此。","Only one Pokémon, but it is a very smelly one!":"我只有一只宝可梦，但它臭得很！","I can still smell it on my uniform.":"我的制服上还留着那股味道。","The stairs by the statue go up to the boss's office.":"雕像旁边的楼梯通往首领的办公室。","So it is you again. You heard my speech, I suppose. It was a lie. There is no place for them in the new world, for it will hold one person alone: me. Spirit only spoils a world. Come, and I will show you what it is worth.":"又是你。我的演讲你听到了吧。那是谎言。新世界没有他们的位置，因为那里只会有一个人：我。心灵只会败坏世界。来吧，让我告诉你它究竟有多少价值。","I see. So it can still do that.":"原来如此。它竟然还能做到这种事。","Uxie floats in the glass tank with its eyes shut tight.":"由克希紧闭双眼，漂浮在玻璃舱里。","Mesprit floats in the glass tank. It looks very sad.":"艾姆利多漂浮在玻璃舱里，看起来非常悲伤。","Azelf floats in the glass tank. It is not moving at all.":"亚克诺姆漂浮在玻璃舱里，一动也不动。","The switch is over there. Go on. It no longer matters to us.":"开关就在那边。去吧。这对我们已经无所谓了。","The boss sent you to me, did he? Then you beat him. I had a feeling you would. Still, I have my orders, and nobody passes this door.":"是首领让你来找我的？那么你赢了他。我早有预感。不过命令就是命令，谁也别想通过这扇门。","That makes it twice. I will not pretend to be surprised.":"这是第二次了。我也不必装作吃惊。","A report is fixed to the base of the statue: \"Dialga, said to rule time. Palkia, said to rule space. The Red Chain can bind them both.\"":"雕像底座上贴着一份报告：“帝牙卢卡，传说掌管时间。帕路奇亚，传说掌管空间。红色锁链能将两者束缚。”","Come back tomorrow. I will think of another level for you.":"明天再来吧。我会再想一个等级给你。","I collect sightings of Pokémon at just the right level. Today, show me a Pokémon at level {n}.":"我在收集刚好某个等级的宝可梦的目击纪录。今天，让我看看 {n} 级的宝可梦吧。","Your {mon} is level {n}, exactly what I was looking for! Here, a little thank-you.":"你的{mon}是 {n} 级，正是我要找的！来，一点小小的谢礼。","Glasses change the way the world looks. And a Pokémon wearing them sees things differently too.":"眼镜会改变世界看起来的样子。戴着眼镜的宝可梦，看事情的方式也会不一样。","Choice Specs make special moves stronger, but the holder can only use the first move it picks.":"讲究眼镜能提高特殊招式的威力，但携带者只能使用一开始选的招式。","BlackGlasses make Dark-type moves stronger.":"黑色眼镜能提高恶属性招式的威力。","Wise Glasses make special moves a little stronger.":"博识眼镜能稍微提高特殊招式的威力。","You have Combee of both kinds. You are a real bug expert!":"你有两种三蜜蜂呢。你真是虫子专家！","Did you know a Combee can be a boy or a girl? Show me both kinds in your party, and I will give you something good!":"你知道三蜜蜂分公的和母的吗？让我看看你队伍里两种都有，我就送你好东西！","Not a single Combee with you? Look for them in the sweet-smelling trees.":"你身上一只三蜜蜂都没有？去那些甜甜香味的树上找找吧。","That is a Combee, all right! Now show me one of the other kind too.":"这确实是三蜜蜂！现在也让我看看另一种吧。","A boy Combee and a girl Combee! Amazing. This is for you: it makes a Pokémon grow strong from every battle.":"公的三蜜蜂和母的三蜜蜂！太厉害了。这个给你：它能让宝可梦在每场对战中变强。","A Pokémon holding the Exp. Share gets some of the Exp. Points without battling.":"携带学习装置的宝可梦，不用出战也能得到一部分经验值。","I am one of Professor Rowan's aides. How many kinds of Pokémon have you seen? {n}, it says here.":"我是七灶博士的助手。你见过几种宝可梦呢？这上面写着 {n} 种。","Come back when you have seen at least 35 kinds. Then I will have something for you.":"等你见过至少 35 种再来吧。到时我有东西要给你。","That is plenty! The professor asked me to give you this.":"真不少！博士请我把这个交给你。","Some Pokémon evolve when traded holding a Metal Coat. Steel suits them.":"有些宝可梦携带金属膜进行交换就会进化。钢铁很适合它们。","Ah, the Trainer who helped Riley on this island. My apologies for leaving my Gym back then. Take this as thanks.":"啊，你就是在这座岛上帮了亚玄的训练家。那时我丢下道馆不管，真是抱歉。收下这个当作谢礼吧。","Your Pokémon looks like it wants to go first. Let it hold this!":"你的宝可梦看起来很想抢先行动呢。让它带着这个吧！","A Pokémon holding a Quick Claw sometimes moves first.":"携带先制之爪的宝可梦，有时会抢先行动。","I have something for your Pokémon. Here!":"我有东西要送给你的宝可梦。拿去吧！","A Shell Bell gives its holder back some HP each time it deals damage.":"贝壳之铃会在携带者造成伤害时，回复一些 HP。","Please let one of your Pokémon wear this. It will be fond of you in no time.":"请让你的宝可梦戴上这个。它很快就会和你亲近的。","A Pokémon with a Soothe Bell grows fond of you faster.":"戴着安抚之铃的宝可梦，会更快和你亲近。","Ace Trainer":"精英训练家","The steel from this island goes all over Sinnoh. Byron works the mine himself, you know.":"这座岛的钢铁会运到神奥各地。东瓜还亲自在矿坑里干活呢。","The Battle Hall. One Pokémon, a type of your choice for every battle.":"对战舞台。只带一只宝可梦，每场自选对手的属性。","I specialize in exactly this type. You chose well... or very badly.":"我专攻的正是这个属性。你选得好……或者选得很糟。","Every Pokémon here is a star. Mine is about to shine.":"在这里每只宝可梦都是明星。我的马上就要发光了。","A one-on-one on this stage? Let the audience decide!":"在这个舞台上一对一？让观众来评判吧！","Pick a type, pick a fight. You picked me!":"选了属性，就选了对手。你选中了我！","The spotlight is yours.":"聚光灯是你的了。","Bravo... even if it hurts to say so.":"精彩……虽然说出来很不甘心。","That was a performance.":"这才叫表演。","Encore? Not for me, I am afraid.":"安可？恐怕轮不到我了。","Fifty wins with the same Pokémon! You and your partner make a fine pair. I am Argenta, the Hall Matron. Show me how it shines on my stage!":"用同一只宝可梦连赢五十场！你们真是好搭档。我是舞台名伶青葙。让我看看它在我的舞台上如何发光吧！","One hundred and seventy wins. You came back to my stage, and so did I. Let us give them a finale!":"一百七十连胜。你回到了我的舞台，我也是。让我们献上压轴演出吧！","Splendid! I can see how much it trusts you.":"太出色了！看得出它有多信任你。","A standing ovation! Nobody has ever performed like that on my stage.":"全场起立鼓掌！从来没有人在我的舞台上有过这样的表演。","Welcome to the Battle Hall! On this stage, one Pokémon takes on one opponent at a time.":"欢迎来到对战舞台！在这个舞台上，一只宝可梦每次对抗一个对手。","Before each battle, you choose the type of your opponent. Every type has ten ranks: each win raises it one, and a win at rank 10 closes it until every type is done.":"每场对战前，你要选对手的属性。每种属性有十个等级：每赢一场升一级，在第 10 级获胜后，这个属性就会关闭，直到所有属性都打完。","Enter one Pokémon of level 30 or more. Your opponents' levels follow its level and the ranks. A round is ten battles, and you cannot leave before the end.":"参加的宝可梦要 30 级以上。对手的等级会依它的等级和各属性的等级而定。一轮十场，中途不能离开。","Your streak belongs to the Pokémon you enter. Enter another, and it starts over.":"连胜纪录属于参加的那只宝可梦。换别只参加，就会从头算起。","Wins in a row with {mon}: {n}.":"{mon}的连胜：{n} 场。","Below level 30":"未满 30 级","Which Pokémon will take the stage?":"要让哪只宝可梦登上舞台？","Your streak belongs to {old}. With {mon}, it starts over. Is that all right?":"连胜纪录属于{old}。换成{mon}的话会从头算起。这样可以吗？","Thank you. Please follow me to the stage.":"谢谢。请跟我到舞台上来。","Battle No. {n}. Which type will you face?":"第 {n} 场。要对战哪个属性？","{type} · Rank {r}":"{type} · 第 {r} 级","The Hall Matron has come to the stage herself!":"舞台名伶亲自登台了！","Battle No. {n}! A {type}-type challenger takes the stage.":"第 {n} 场！{type}属性的挑战者登上舞台。","Argenta recognizes your bond. You earned the Silver Print!":"青葙认可了你们的羁绊。你得到了银色印记！","Argenta recognizes your bond. You earned the Gold Print!":"青葙认可了你们的羁绊。你得到了金色印记！","Congratulations! You won ten battles in a row!":"恭喜！你连赢了十场！","{mon} was healed. On to battle No. {n}!":"{mon}恢复了。进入第 {n} 场！","The Hall Matron, Argenta, takes the stage against Trainers who reach the 50th and the 170th battle in a row.":"舞台名伶青葙会和连胜到第 50 场和第 170 场的训练家对战。","{mon}: {n} wins in a row. Ranks: {list}.":"{mon}：连胜 {n} 场。等级：{list}。","all at rank 1":"全部是第 1 级","The door to the stage. Challengers must register at the counter first.":"通往舞台的门。挑战者要先在柜台报名。","...You there. Do you know where you are standing? This mountain is said to be where Sinnoh began.":"……你。知道自己站在什么地方吗？传说这座山就是神奥开始的地方。","My name is Cyrus. I have been thinking about this world. The land, the people, even the heart: everything in it wears away. It is all incomplete.":"我叫赤日。我一直在思考这个世界。大地、人，甚至是心，一切都会磨损消逝。一切都不完整。","I intend to make a new world, one without that weakness. Remember my name. We will meet again.":"我要创造一个没有这种软弱的新世界。记住我的名字。我们会再见面的。","The man in the grey coat walked off into the dark of the mountain.":"穿灰色大衣的男人走进了山中的黑暗里。","The next Gym is in Veilstone City, east past Route 209 and Solaceon Town. Its Leader, Maylene, uses Fighting types!":"下一个道馆在帷幕市，往东经过209号道路和随意镇就到。那里的馆主阿李使用格斗属性！","Berries grow best with patience. Come back when you have planted some of your own!":"树果要有耐心才长得好。等你自己种了树果再来吧！","I am the Berry Master! I grow Berries of every kind behind this house.":"我是树果名人！我在这房子后面种了各式各样的树果。","A traveling Trainer, eh? Take these. A Sitrus Berry heals a good deal of HP when a Pokémon needs it.":"旅行中的训练家啊？收下这些吧。文柚果能在宝可梦需要时回复不少HP。","Hey, {player}! I crossed Mt. Coronet ahead of you. I bumped into a weird guy in a grey coat in there...":"喂，{player}！我比你先穿过天冠山了。我在里面撞见一个穿灰大衣的怪人……","Anyway! Fantina's Ghost types are tough, so I am training first. Do not you dare beat her before me!":"总之！梅丽莎的幽灵属性很难对付，我要先去训练。你可别比我先赢她！","Hey, Champion! Fantina uses Ghost-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠军！梅丽莎使用幽灵属性的宝可梦。","Ghost and Dark moves work great on them. Normal and Fighting moves pass right through them!":"幽灵和恶属性的招式对它们很有效。一般和格斗属性的招式会直接穿过去！","Bring a team! A Pokémon that knows Bite, like a Luxio, is a big help, and Awakenings for when they put you to sleep. Up to level 30, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"带一支队伍来！会咬住的宝可梦（比如勒克猫）很有帮助，也要带解眠药以防被催眠。30级以下的家乡宝可梦在这里会听你的话。","This is the Relic Badge. Take it, with my compliments!":"这是遗迹徽章。请收下，以表我的敬意！","{player} received the Relic Badge from Fantina!":"{player}从梅丽莎那里得到了遗迹徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 35 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，35级以下的宝可梦在神奥都会听你的话，就算来自其他地区也一样。","And this is for you: TM65, Shadow Claw. A slash from the shadows that often hits a weak spot!":"这个送给你：招式学习器65，暗影爪。从暗影中挥出的爪击，容易击中要害！","Berry Master":"树果名人","Mt. Coronet is the heart of Sinnoh. Show me you have the heart to cross it!":"天冠山是神奥的心脏。让我看看你有没有穿越它的胆量！","You have plenty of heart.":"你胆量十足。","The mountain goes up and up, to a peak nobody I know has climbed.":"这座山一直往上延伸，山顶是我认识的人谁也没爬上去过的。","I train by the mountain every day. Today I train on you!":"我每天都在山边修行。今天就拿你来练练！","My training is not over.":"我的修行还没结束。","Meditite meditate for hours. I can barely sit still for a minute.":"玛沙那能冥想好几个小时。我连一分钟都坐不住。","I foresaw this battle. I did not foresee who would win, though.":"我预见了这场对战。不过没预见到谁会赢。","Now I see it clearly.":"现在我看清楚了。","Bronzor were found in ancient tombs. Some say they were made, not born.":"人们在古墓中发现了铜镜怪。有人说它们是被造出来的，而不是生出来的。","The Berry Master's flowers smell wonderful. Battle me while you breathe them in!":"树果名人的花好香啊。一边闻着花香一边和我对战吧！","Ah, I lost my breath.":"啊，我喘不过气了。","Hearthome is just ahead. It is the city where people and Pokémon meet in friendship.":"家缘市就在前面。那是人与宝可梦以友谊相聚的城市。","The bridge on Route 209 is being repaired. You will have to wait a little!":"209号道路的桥正在维修。你得稍等一下了！","Route 212 is flooded after all this rain. Better wait until the water goes down.":"下了这么多雨，212号道路淹水了。还是等水退了再说吧。","In Amity Square, people walk with their Pokémon. It is closed for gardening today, sadly.":"在友好广场，大家会和宝可梦一起散步。可惜今天在整理花木，没有开放。","Fantina, our Gym Leader, travelled the world before coming here. Her Ghost Pokémon are amazing!":"我们的道馆馆主梅丽莎在来这里之前周游过世界。她的幽灵宝可梦超厉害！","Normal and Fighting moves pass right through Ghost-type Pokémon. Bring something else to the Gym!":"一般和格斗属性的招式打不中幽灵属性的宝可梦。去道馆要带别的招式！","Ghost types like to put you to sleep or confuse you. Awakenings are a must!":"幽灵属性喜欢让你睡着或混乱。解眠药一定要带！","Long ago, people from all over came to Hearthome to share what they had. That is how it got its name.":"很久以前，各地的人都会来家缘市分享自己拥有的东西。这就是它名字的由来。","The spirits whisper your name... and they are laughing!":"灵魂们在低语你的名字……还在笑呢！","The spirits went quiet.":"灵魂们安静下来了。","Fantina says Ghost Pokémon are only scary if you do not understand them.":"梅丽莎说，幽灵宝可梦只有在你不了解它们的时候才可怕。","Kendall":"肯德尔","I sense your fear. Or is it mine? Battle!":"我感觉到你的恐惧。还是我自己的？对战吧！","It was mine.":"是我自己的。","Drifloon float toward children at dusk. Hold your balloons tight!":"傍晚时分，飘飘球会飘向小孩子。抓紧你的气球！","Do you feel a chill? That is my Haunter, right behind you.":"感觉到一阵寒意了吗？那是我的鬼斯通，就在你身后。","Even my Haunter has had enough.":"连我的鬼斯通都受够了。","Haunter can slip through walls. Watch your back in here!":"鬼斯通能穿墙而过。在这里要小心背后！","Desmond":"戴斯蒙","Fantina is right behind me, and you will not reach her!":"梅丽莎就在我后面，你别想过去！","Go on, then. She is waiting in the dark.":"去吧。她在黑暗中等你。","Fantina's Mismagius sings a song that can curse its foes. Be ready!":"梅丽莎的梦妖魔会唱出诅咒对手的歌。做好准备！","Welcome to the Hearthome Gym! I am Fantina, the Gym Leader. I came from far away to learn about Ghost Pokémon, and now I share them with you! A Champion of three regions? How wonderful. Let us dance!":"欢迎来到家缘道馆！我是馆主梅丽莎。我从很远的地方来到这里研究幽灵宝可梦，现在要和你分享它们！三个地区的冠军？太棒了。我们来跳支舞吧！","Ah, magnifique! You are truly strong, mon ami.":"啊，太精彩了！你真的很强，我的朋友。","Route 208. East: Hearthome City. West: Mt. Coronet.":"208号道路。东：家缘市　西：天冠山","Hearthome City. The warm-hearted city, where people and Pokémon come together.":"家缘市。温暖人心的城市，人与宝可梦在此相聚。","Something is clinging to the tree, licking the Honey!":"有什么东西攀在树上舔着甜甜蜜！","The tree is sticky with Honey, but nothing has come yet. Check back in a while.":"树上黏糊糊地沾着甜甜蜜，但还什么都没来。过一阵子再来看看吧。","A tree with a faint, sweet smell. Pokémon that love sweet things might gather here.":"一棵散发着淡淡甜香的树。喜欢甜食的宝可梦也许会聚集过来。","Spread some Honey on the tree?":"要在树上涂甜甜蜜吗？","{player} spread Honey on the tree. Something might come to lick it in a few hours.":"{player}在树上涂了甜甜蜜。过几个小时也许会有什么来舔。","Hello. I am Riley. I come here to train with my Lucario, but today Team Galactic is on the floors below, frightening the Pokémon.":"你好。我叫亚玄。我常和路卡利欧来这里修行，但今天银河队在下面几层吓唬宝可梦。","Let us go down together. My Lucario can look after your team after each battle.":"我们一起下去吧。每场战斗后，我的路卡利欧可以照顾你的队伍。","Riley will come along with you!":"亚玄和你一起走！","I have an Egg for you, but you are carrying six already. Hatch a few, and come back for it.":"我有一颗蛋要给你，但你身上已经有六颗了。等孵化几颗再回来拿吧。","{player} received an Egg from Riley!":"{player}从亚玄那里得到了一颗蛋！","Riolu will hatch from it. It can sense what you feel, so raise it with care.":"里面会孵出利欧路。它能感知你的心情，要好好养育它。","We are getting out of here. There is plenty of steel elsewhere!":"我们撤了。别的地方还有的是钢铁！","That is the last of them. Thank you, {player}. The Pokémon here can rest now.":"这是最后的了。谢谢你，{player}。这里的宝可梦终于能休息了。","Byron was looking into the trouble here. He has gone back to his Gym in Canalave, so you can challenge him now.":"东瓜之前在调查这里的事。他已经回水脉市的道馆了，你可以去挑战他。","Before you go, I want you to have this.":"在你走之前，我想把这个送给你。","Ready to head back to Canalave?":"要回水脉市了吗？","The boat sailed back to Canalave City...":"船驶回了水脉市……","I will wait right here.":"我就在这里等你。","Riley's Lucario looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"亚玄的路卡利欧照顾了你的宝可梦。它们完全恢复了！","I came to camp in the old mine. It is quiet. Too quiet. Battle me!":"我来这座老矿山露营。这里很安静，太安静了。和我对战吧！","At least that was not quiet.":"至少刚才不安静了。","I heard people in strange suits on the floor below.":"我听到下面一层有穿着奇怪衣服的人。","A picnic in a mine is not as nice as I thought. A battle will cheer me up!":"在矿山里野餐没有想象中好。来场对战让我打起精神吧！","Not cheered up.":"精神没打起来。","Raichu lights up the tunnels for me. It is very handy.":"雷丘帮我照亮隧道，非常方便。","Damon":"戴蒙","Solid.":"够硬。","Onix evolve with a Metal Coat. This island is full of old steel.":"大岩蛇要用金属膜才能进化。这座岛上到处都是旧钢铁。","All right, all right.":"好吧好吧。","Riley trains here with his Lucario. They read each other's minds.":"亚玄和他的路卡利欧在这里修行。他们能读懂彼此的心。","Those people in the space suits went that way. Be careful.":"那些穿太空服的人往那边去了。小心点。","Kendal":"肯德尔","Time to run!":"快跑！","Iron Island. The mine has been closed for years. Enter at your own risk.":"钢铁岛。矿山已关闭多年。入内风险自负。","The Trainers below battle in pairs, so we will face them as a pair too.":"下面的训练家都是两人一组对战，所以我们也两个人一起应战吧。","Lucario can feel the Pokémon of this mine. They are frightened. Let us hurry.":"路卡利欧能感觉到这座矿坑里的宝可梦。它们很害怕。我们快走吧。","Damon & Maurice":"戴蒙和莫里斯","Two Hikers, two of you. This mine made our Pokémon as hard as its steel!":"两个登山男对你们两个。这座矿坑让我们的宝可梦变得跟这里的钢铁一样硬！","Solid... but not solid enough.":"够硬……但还不够硬。","Jonah & Brenda":"约拿和布伦达","We came down here to train in peace, and here you are with Riley. Fine: two against two!":"我们下来这里是想安静地修行，结果你和亚玄来了。好吧，二对二！","All right, all right. You two work well together.":"好啦好啦。你们两个配合得真好。","Tyler & Kendal":"泰勒和肯德尔","We train in the dark so we can fight anywhere. Hiyah!":"我们在黑暗中修行，在哪里都能战斗。嘿呀！","We need more light... and more training.":"我们需要更多光……还有更多修行。","Brendon & Quentin":"布伦登和昆汀","We dig this mine, and those strange people scared off every Pokémon in it. You look like trouble too!":"我们在这座矿坑干活，那些怪人把这里的宝可梦全吓跑了。你看起来也像来捣乱的！","Sorry! You are the good kind of trouble.":"对不起！你是来解决麻烦的那种人。","The people in space suits went down that narrow way.":"穿太空服的那些人从那条窄路下去了。","Two of you? Then two of us! The steel in this mine belongs to Team Galactic!":"你们有两个人？那我们也两个！这座矿坑的钢铁归银河队所有！","{player}! The professor asked me to see you off. Jubilife City is just north of here.":"{player}！博士让我来送送你。祝庆市就在这里北边。","Oh, a wild Bidoof! You have caught plenty of Pokémon, I know. But let me show you how we do it in Sinnoh!":"哎呀，是野生的大牙狸！我知道你已经抓过很多宝可梦了，不过让我示范一下神奥的做法吧！","{assistant} sent out a Pokémon and wore the Bidoof down, then threw a Poké Ball...":"{assistant}派出宝可梦削弱了大牙狸，然后扔出了精灵球……","Gotcha! The wild Bidoof was caught!":"抓到了！野生的大牙狸被收服了！","Weaken it first, then throw. A sleeping or paralyzed Pokémon is even easier to catch!":"先削弱它，再扔球。睡着或麻痹的宝可梦更容易抓到！","I will go on ahead to Jubilife City. See you there!":"我先去祝庆市了。那里见！","Come on, hand it over! Professor Rowan's notes on evolution. Team Galactic has a use for them.":"快交出来！七灶博士关于进化的研究笔记。银河队用得着它。","{player}! Over here! These two will not leave me alone!":"{player}！这边！这两个人一直缠着我！","Beaten by two kids? This is not over. Team Galactic will remember you!":"居然输给两个小孩？这事没完。银河队会记住你们的！","Thank you, {player}! Why would anyone want the professor's research? I will tell him right away.":"谢谢你，{player}！为什么会有人想要博士的研究呢？我得马上告诉他。","Barry ran east to Route 203, looking for you. The first Gym of Sinnoh is in Oreburgh City, past Oreburgh Gate at the end of the route.":"阿驯往东跑去203号道路找你了。神奥的第一个道馆在黑金市，穿过道路尽头的黑金关口就到。","Jubilife TV. The doors are shut: a show is being filmed inside.":"祝庆电视台。大门紧闭：里面正在录节目。","The Pokétch Company. A sign on the door says: \"Our watch for Trainers is coming soon!\"":"宝可表公司。门上的告示写着：“我们的训练家手表即将推出！”","Welcome to the Trainers' School! In Sinnoh, even a Champion can learn something new.":"欢迎来到训练家学校！在神奥，就算是冠军也能学到新东西。","Here, Pokémon evolve in ways you may not have seen: holding an item at night, or once they know a certain move. Have a look at the blackboard!":"这里的宝可梦有些进化方式你可能没见过：在夜里携带道具，或者学会某个招式。看看黑板吧！","Tristan":"崔斯坦","You came up from Sandgem? Then you have to battle me. Those are the rules of Route 202!":"你是从真砂镇过来的？那就得和我对战。这是202号道路的规矩！","I made the rules up anyway...":"反正规矩是我自己编的……","Bidoof look sleepy, but they are tougher than they seem.":"大牙狸看起来呆呆的，其实比看上去顽强。","Logan":"罗根","Listen to my Kricketot! It knocks its antennae together like a little drum!":"听听我的圆法师！它把触角碰在一起，像在打小鼓！","The song is over...":"曲子结束了……","When Kricketot evolves, it plays a real melody. I cannot wait.":"圆法师进化以后，就能演奏真正的旋律了。我好期待。","Natalie":"娜塔莉","My Shinx sparks when it is happy. Let me show you how happy it gets in a battle!":"我的小猫怪一高兴就会冒出火花。看看它对战时有多高兴吧！","Oh, the sparks went out.":"啊，火花熄灭了。","Shinx glow in the dark. At night the grass here twinkles with them.":"小猫怪会在黑暗中发光。到了晚上，这里的草丛就一闪一闪的。","Rocks came down on the path to Route 204. We are clearing them, but it will take a while!":"通往204号道路的路上落石了。我们正在清理，不过还要一阵子！","Jubilife has a TV station and the company that makes the Pokétch. It is the place to be in Sinnoh!":"祝庆市有电视台，还有制造宝可表的公司。这里是神奥最热闹的地方！","Team Galactic? They talk about making a brand-new world. Strange people, if you ask me.":"银河队？他们说要创造一个全新的世界。要我说，真是群怪人。","Route 203 is east of the city. Past it, a tunnel through the mountain leads to Oreburgh City.":"203号道路在城市东边。过了那里，有一条穿山隧道通往黑金市。","The Gym Leader in Oreburgh uses Rock-type Pokémon. Water and Grass moves are the way to go!":"黑金市的道馆馆主使用岩石属性的宝可梦。水属性和草属性的招式最有效！","A Repel keeps weak wild Pokémon away for a while. Very handy in a long cave!":"除虫喷雾能让弱小的野生宝可梦暂时不靠近。在长长的洞窟里特别好用！","Harrison":"哈里森","Today we are learning about battles. Will you be my homework?":"今天我们在学对战。你愿意当我的作业吗？","I think I failed that test...":"这次考试我好像不及格了……","I will read the blackboard again. Twice!":"我要再看一遍黑板。看两遍！","Christine":"克莉丝汀","I got top marks in type matchups. Let me prove it!":"我的属性相克考了满分。让我证明给你看！","Top marks are not everything, I guess.":"看来满分也不代表一切。","Electric moves are great against Flying types. That part I got right!":"电属性招式对飞行属性很有效。这一题我答对了！","My neighbor works at the Pokétch Company. They are making a watch for Trainers, full of handy little apps.":"我的邻居在宝可表公司上班。他们在做一款给训练家用的手表，里面有很多好用的小程序。","Route 202. North: Jubilife City. South: Sandgem Town.":"202号道路。北：祝庆市　南：真砂镇","Jubilife City. The busiest city in Sinnoh, where people and Pokémon come together.":"祝庆市。神奥最热闹的城市，人与宝可梦在此相聚。","Trainer Tips: the Oreburgh Gym is east of here, past Route 203 and Oreburgh Gate.":"训练家小提示：黑金道馆在东边，穿过203号道路和黑金关口就到。","The blackboard says: \"Some Pokémon evolve when they level up holding an item, some only by day or only by night, and some once they know a certain move.\"":"黑板上写着：“有些宝可梦要携带道具升级才会进化，有些只在白天或只在夜晚进化，有些则要学会某个招式。”","The blackboard says: \"The Shiny Stone, the Dusk Stone and the Dawn Stone each make certain Pokémon evolve.\"":"黑板上写着：“光之石、暗之石和觉醒之石都能让特定的宝可梦进化。”","The boats to Canalave are not running, and the sea on Route 218 is too rough today. Better come back another time.":"去水脉市的船停开了，今天218号道路的海浪也太大。改天再来吧。","That notebook on the desk is mine. Did you know abilities work outside battle too? My Slugma keeps the Eggs I carry warm, so they hatch in no time!":"桌上那本笔记本是我的。你知道特性在对战以外也有用吗？我的熔岩虫会帮我把带着的蛋保温，很快就孵出来了！","Who are you, another Trainer? Fine: two of us, two of you. Team Galactic does not lose!":"你是谁，又一个训练家？好啊，二对二。银河队是不会输的！","{player}, let us battle them together! Two against two!":"{player}，我们一起对付他们吧！二对二！","Rupert":"鲁伯特","Veteran Rupert":"老练训练家 鲁伯特","Splendid. You saw through every trick I played.":"精彩。我的每一招你都看穿了。","Power alone does not win battles. Spikes on the ground, a taunt at the right moment, a wish for a friend who comes after: that is what I teach.":"光靠力量是赢不了对战的。地上的撒菱、恰到好处的挑衅、留给下一位同伴的祈愿——这些才是我要教的。","Would you like a lesson? Six against six, and no holding back.":"要上一课吗？六对六，全力以赴。","Come back whenever you are ready to learn.":"等你准备好学习了再来吧。","Then take your places, and watch the field as closely as the foe!":"那就各就各位吧，场地和对手一样要看仔细！","Every trick has its answer. Come and try again whenever you like.":"每一招都有破解的方法。随时欢迎再来挑战。","There is little left I can teach you. Pass it on to the children here, will you?":"我已经没什么可以教你的了。把这些教给这里的孩子们吧，好吗？","Hmph. It does not matter. Soon the whole of Sinnoh will feel what we can do!":"哼，无所谓。很快整个神奥都会见识到我们的厉害！","The grunt ran off toward the lake.":"手下朝湖的方向逃走了。","So that is where he was hiding! Well fought. The marsh is safe, thanks to you.":"原来他躲在这里！打得好。多亏了你，大湿地平安无事。","Your friend Barry is back in Pastoria, and he is itching to see you. Off you go!":"你的朋友阿驯回湿原市了，他急着要见你。快去吧！","Fresh rubble blocks the tunnel. A note says: \"Still digging. Come back later!\"":"新塌下来的碎石堵住了隧道。纸条上写着：“还在挖。晚点再来！”","The cottage is locked. A card on the door says: \"Hotel Grand Lake guests only.\"":"小屋锁着。门上的牌子写着：“仅限湖畔饭店的住客。”","Carlos":"卡洛斯","I am on a case. I followed this Goldeen all the way up the hill. Do not ask how.":"我在办案。我一路跟着这只角金鱼爬上了山坡。别问我是怎么做到的。","Case closed... on me.":"结案了……输的是我。","A good detective notices everything. Somebody has been digging in the cliff to the south.":"好侦探什么都看在眼里。南边的山崖有人挖过。","Douglas":"道格拉斯","I collected all the Eevee evolutions I could find. Want to see them up close?":"我收集了能找到的所有伊布进化型。要不要近距离看看？","My collection! Not a scratch, I hope.":"我的收藏！希望没有刮伤。","They say Eevee can evolve in new ways here in Sinnoh. I am going to need a bigger shelf.":"听说在神奥，伊布还有新的进化方式。我得换个更大的架子了。","Mitchell":"米切尔","I saw this battle in a dream. In the dream, I won.":"我在梦里见过这场对战。梦里是我赢了。","Dreams are not what they used to be.":"梦也不比从前了。","Something is stirring under Lake Valor. I can feel it in my spoons.":"立志湖底下有什么在蠢动。我的汤匙感觉得到。","Abigail":"阿比盖尔","My Pokémon whisper that you are strong. Prove them right!":"我的宝可梦悄悄说你很强。证明给它们看吧！","They were right.":"它们说得没错。","The wind from the lake smells strange today.":"今天从湖上吹来的风味道很怪。","My Pokémon come from ruins and fossils. History hits hard!":"我的宝可梦来自遗迹和化石。历史的拳头可是很重的！","Buried again.":"又被埋起来了。","That tunnel in the cliff is mine. I will not stop digging until I find what is down there.":"山崖上那条隧道是我挖的。不找到底下的东西，我绝不停手。","Brady":"布雷迪","Six Pokémon from the Great Marsh, and every one of them a rare find!":"六只大湿地的宝可梦，每一只都很稀有！","All six of them...":"六只全倒了……","I caught them in the Great Marsh at Pastoria. You pay at the gate and throw Safari Balls.":"我是在湿原市的大湿地抓到的。在入口付钱，然后丢狩猎球就行了。","The way to Lake Valor is closed for now. Guests say something odd is going on at the shore.":"去立志湖的路暂时封闭了。住客说湖边有些不对劲。","People come from all over Sinnoh to stay at the Hotel Grand Lake. The view is lovely.":"全神奥的人都会来湖畔饭店住。这里的景色很美。","Seven Stars is the best restaurant in Sinnoh. I saved up for a whole year!":"七星餐厅是神奥最好的餐厅。我存了整整一年的钱！","You followed me all the way here? Too bad for you! That bomb was only the start.":"你一路追到这里？算你倒霉！那颗炸弹只是开始。","No! The mission!":"不！任务！","Welcome to the Hotel Grand Lake. I am sorry, every suite is booked this season.":"欢迎光临湖畔饭店。很抱歉，这一季的套房全都订满了。","I come here every year for the lake. This year it looks... restless.":"我每年都来看湖。今年它看起来……不太平静。","The cottages on the beach belong to the hotel too. You need a key to get in.":"海滩上的小屋也是饭店的。要有钥匙才进得去。","They say the chef here once cooked for the Champion of Sinnoh.":"听说这里的主厨曾经为神奥的冠军下过厨。","The sea air makes a sailor strong. Let me show you!":"海风把水手吹得结结实实。让你见识一下！","You never know what the tide will bring to this beach.":"你永远不知道潮水会把什么冲上这片海滩。","Kenneth":"肯尼斯","I fish from the beach. Today I caught a battle!":"我在海滩上钓鱼。今天钓到了一场对战！","It got away...":"让它跑了……","A Gyarados on the line is no joke. Crasher Wake in Pastoria has one of his own.":"钓到暴鲤龙可不是开玩笑的。湿原市的吉宪也有一只。","Cyndy":"辛蒂","My Glameow and I came for the sun, but I never say no to a battle.":"我和魅力喵是来晒太阳的，不过对战我也从不拒绝。","Oh, my nails!":"哎呀，我的指甲！","The hotel cottages have the best view of the sea. If you can get in.":"饭店的小屋能看到最美的海景。前提是你进得去。","I cannot swim without my float, but I can battle!":"没有泳圈我不会游泳，但我会对战！","Waaah, my Shellos!":"哇啊，我的无壳海兔！","Shellos look different on the other side of the mountain, you know!":"山的另一边，无壳海兔长得不一样哦！","Chelsea":"切尔西","Marill floats just like me! Battle!":"玛力露和我一样会浮在水上！来对战吧！","My big sister says the Great Marsh is all mud and rare Pokémon.":"姐姐说大湿地全是烂泥和稀有的宝可梦。","Evan":"埃文","Swimming clears the head. A battle clears it even more!":"游泳能让头脑清醒。对战更能！","Glub...":"咕噜……","The sea around Sinnoh runs deep. Swim with care.":"神奥周围的海很深。游的时候要小心。","Finneon lights my way at night. By day, we battle!":"荧光鱼在夜里为我照路。白天我们就对战！","Washed ashore!":"被冲上岸了！","From out here you can see Pastoria to the west.":"从这里往西能看到湿原市。","Route 214. North: Veilstone City. South: Valor Lakefront.":"214号道路。北：帷幕市　南：立志湖畔","Valor Lakefront. West: Lake Valor. South: Route 213.":"立志湖畔。西：立志湖　南：213号道路","Hotel Grand Lake. Rest by the water, and leave your cares at the door.":"湖畔饭店。在水边好好休息，把烦恼留在门外。","Route 213. West: Pastoria City. North: Valor Lakefront.":"213号道路。西：湿原市　北：立志湖畔","So you are {player}. I am Cynthia. I study the old stories of Sinnoh, and Professor Rowan told me about you.":"你就是{player}吧。我叫竹兰，在研究神奥的古老传说。七灶博士跟我提起过你。","I was heading north, but a crowd of Psyduck is blocking Route 210. Their heads ache so much that they cannot move.":"我本来要往北走，但一群可达鸭堵住了210号道路。它们头痛得动不了。","This Secret Potion will cure them. I have something to see to here by the lake first. Could you take it to them?":"这瓶秘传之药能治好它们。我在湖边还有点事要办。你能帮我带过去吗？","Route 210 is north of Solaceon Town. I will meet you there!":"210号道路在随意镇的北边。我们在那里见！","The road to Sunyshore City is closed. It will only open when Professor Rowan in Sandgem gives the word.":"通往滨海市的路封闭了。要等真砂镇的七灶博士发话才会开放。","Our double battles run from nine in the morning until eleven at night. Do come back then!":"我们的双打对战从早上九点开始，到晚上十一点结束。请到时候再来吧！","You have battled every pair at our tables today. The whole kitchen is talking about you!":"今天你已经和我们每一桌的组合都对战过了。整个厨房都在谈论你呢！","Welcome to the Seven Stars! Five pairs dine with us today, and each of them would love a double battle.":"欢迎光临七星餐厅！今天有五组客人在这里用餐，他们每一组都很想来一场双打对战。","The pairs change every day, so do come back tomorrow.":"每天来的组合都不一样，明天也请再来吧。","Five double battles in one day! Nobody has done that since we opened. The kitchen is cheering for you!":"一天之内赢下五场双打！自开店以来还没有人做到过。整个厨房都在为你喝彩！","Our parents own half the hotels on this lake. Shall we see if we own this battle too?":"这座湖边一半的饭店都是我们爸妈的。来看看这场对战是不是也归我们吧？","Money cannot buy that kind of teamwork, it seems.":"看来那种默契是花钱买不到的。","Kylie wants dessert now. She always wants dessert after losing.":"琪莉现在想吃甜点了。她每次输了都想吃甜点。","Alison":"艾莉森","My Feebas is the rarest thing in this room. Well, after the soup. Let us battle!":"我的丑丑鱼是这间餐厅里最稀有的东西。嗯，仅次于汤。来对战吧！","My precious Feebas! You were not supposed to be so strong!":"我宝贵的丑丑鱼！你不应该这么厉害的啊！","Alison says Roselia smells nicer than my Feebas. She is right, but do not tell Feebas.":"艾莉森说毒蔷薇比我的丑丑鱼好闻。她说得没错，但别告诉丑丑鱼。","Emanuel":"艾曼纽","Blythe":"布莱丝","My granddaughter and I eat here every week. And every week we battle someone!":"我和孙女每个星期都来这里吃饭。每个星期也都会和人对战一场！","Ha! The young ones keep getting stronger.":"哈！年轻人真是越来越厉害了。","Blythe is learning fast. One day she will beat me, and then I will retire.":"布莱丝学得很快。总有一天她会赢过我，到时候我就退休。","Kendrick":"肯德里克","Gabriella":"加布丽埃拉","I have been watching you since you walked in. A detective notices these things. Battle!":"从你一进门我就在观察你了。侦探总会注意到这些事。来对战吧！","I did not see that coming. Some detective I am.":"我完全没料到。我这个侦探真是失职。","Gabriella is not my partner on the case. Only at dinner.":"加布丽埃拉不是我办案的搭档，只是吃饭的搭档。","Emilio":"埃米利奥","Kaylee raises them, I study them. Let us test our results on you!":"凯莉负责培育，我负责研究。就拿你来检验我们的成果吧！","Interesting. Your results are better than ours.":"有意思。你的成果比我们的好。","Kaylee says I think too much and play too little. My Kadabra agrees with her.":"凯莉说我想得太多、玩得太少。我的勇基拉也同意她的说法。","Leonardo":"莱昂纳多","Rebecca":"丽贝卡","A double battle before the main course. How delightfully civilized!":"主菜上桌前来一场双打对战，真是风雅极了！","A splendid battle. My compliments to the Trainer.":"精彩的对战。请接受我对这位训练家的赞美。","Chatot will be repeating your name all evening now, I fear.":"恐怕聒噪鸟今晚会一直重复你的名字了。","Ismael":"伊斯梅尔","Harley":"哈莉","I paint battles, you know. Give me a beautiful one to paint!":"我可是画对战的画家哦。给我一场漂亮的对战来画吧！","What colors! I will need a bigger canvas.":"多么丰富的色彩！我需要一张更大的画布了。","Harley thinks my paintings of Psyduck are too yellow. Psyduck is yellow!":"哈莉觉得我画的可达鸭太黄了。可达鸭本来就是黄的啊！","Darryl":"达里尔","Valerie":"瓦莱丽","We are doing a story on the best Trainers at the lake. Show the camera what you can do!":"我们在做一期湖边最强训练家的专题报道。让镜头看看你的本事吧！","Did you get that, Darryl? Tell me you got that!":"达里尔，你拍下来了吗？告诉我你拍下来了！","The story will be on the evening news. You might want to comb your hair.":"这段报道会在晚间新闻播出。你最好梳一下头发。","Esteban":"埃斯特万","Meredith":"梅雷迪思","Miss Meredith is teaching me about cute Pokémon. I am teaching her about battling!":"梅雷迪思姐姐在教我可爱的宝可梦。我在教她怎么对战！","I think we both have more to learn.":"看来我们两个都还要多学学。","Meredith says Pichu is the cutest. I say Quagsire. We will never agree.":"梅雷迪思说皮丘最可爱。我说是沼王。我们永远不会有共识的。","Chef":"厨师","Ah, {player}. Good, you are here. Sit down and listen.":"啊，{player}。你来得正好。坐下听我说。","Sinnoh has three great lakes: Verity, Valor and Acuity. An old story says that a Pokémon sleeps in each of them.":"神奥有三座大湖：心齐湖、立志湖和睿智湖。古老的传说讲，每座湖里都沉睡着一只宝可梦。","They are said to have given people feeling, will and knowledge. And Team Galactic has been reading those same stories.":"据说它们赐予了人们情感、意志和知识。而银河队也一直在研究这些传说。","Then we stop them! Simple!":"那就阻止他们！很简单！","A huge boom shook the library, and books fell from the shelves!":"一声巨响震动了图书馆，书从架子上掉了下来！","Professor! That came from the east. People are saying that something blew up at Lake Valor!":"博士！声音是从东边传来的。大家说立志湖发生了爆炸！","So it has begun. We must protect the lakes at once. Barry, you go to Lake Acuity. {assistant}, to Lake Verity.":"果然开始了。我们必须马上保护这几座湖。阿驯，你去睿智湖。{assistant}，你去心齐湖。","{player}, Lake Valor is yours. It lies west of Valor Lakefront. Hurry!":"{player}，立志湖就交给你了。它在立志湖畔的西边。快去！","Lake Acuity, got it! It is way up north, but I will be there before you know it!":"睿智湖，明白！虽然在很北边，但我转眼就到！","You are strong, I will give you that. But I already have what I came for.":"你很强，这点我承认。但我已经拿到想要的东西了。","Mesprit is ours now, just like Azelf. Run along, and try to catch the boss if you dare!":"艾姆利多已经是我们的了，和亚克诺姆一样。有胆量的话，就去追老大吧！","Team Galactic left Lake Verity, and took Mesprit with them.":"银河队离开了心齐湖，带走了艾姆利多。","They took it, and I could not stop them. I have to tell the Professor. Thank you for coming, {player}.":"它被带走了，我没能阻止他们。我得去告诉博士。谢谢你赶来，{player}。","Barry went north to Lake Acuity, past Snowpoint City. I hope he is all right.":"阿驯往北去了睿智湖，要经过雪峰市。希望他没事。","There you are, {player}! Professor Rowan is in the library with Barry. He wants to see you right away!":"{player}，你在这儿！七灶博士和阿驯在图书馆，博士想马上见你！","Go on, then. It will not change anything!":"去吧。反正什么也改变不了！","It makes no difference. Azelf is already ours, and Mars has gone to Lake Verity for the next one.":"无所谓。亚克诺姆已经到手了，伙星也去心齐湖抓下一只了。","You might want to hurry. Not that it will help.":"你最好快点。不过也没什么用。","Saturn left the cavern.":"镇星离开了洞穴。","One Galactic Bomb, and the whole lake is gone. Impressive, right?":"一颗银河炸弹，整座湖就没了。厉害吧？","Hey! We are the ones who won here!":"喂！赢的明明是我们！","The Commander is in the cave. It is too late, anyway.":"干部在洞穴里。反正已经太迟了。","Those Magikarp will be fine. Probably. Who cares?":"那些鲤鱼王不会有事的。大概吧。谁在乎呢？","I care about that, at least.":"这个我倒是在乎。","The lake will fill up again. We got what we wanted.":"湖水还会涨回来的。我们已经得到想要的了。","Commander Saturn is busy. Nobody gets past me!":"镇星干部正忙着。谁也别想过去！","He is going to be so angry...":"他会气坏的……","So you found your way down here. I am Saturn, a Commander of Team Galactic. You are too late, but since you came all this way, let me show you what a Commander can do.":"你居然找到这里来了。我是银河队干部镇星。你来晚了，不过既然来了，就让你见识一下干部的实力。","I see. The boss was right to take note of you.":"原来如此。老大注意到你是有道理的。","Lake Valor. Its waters are said to be the home of a spirit of will.":"立志湖。据说湖中住着意志的精灵。","The Magikarp is flopping on the dry lake bed. It has nowhere to swim.":"鲤鱼王在干涸的湖床上扑腾，没有水可以游。","Lake Valor is full again! The water has come back, and the Pokémon of the lake with it.":"立志湖又满了！湖水回来了，湖里的宝可梦也跟着回来了。","Far out on the water a Magikarp leaps and splashes down. It has somewhere to swim again.":"远处的水面上，一只鲤鱼王跃起又扑通落下。它又有地方可以游了。","The lake shines in the sun, as if the Galactic Bomb had never fallen.":"湖面在阳光下闪闪发亮，就好像银河炸弹从来没有落下过一样。","One morning the lake was simply full again, as if nothing had happened. The fish came back with the water.":"某天早上，湖就这样又满了，好像什么事都没发生过。鱼也跟着水一起回来了。","I walk over from the Hotel Grand Lake every morning. A lake without water was a sad thing to look at.":"我每天早上都从湖畔饭店散步过来。没有水的湖，看着真让人难过。","Beyond this door are the Elite Four of Sinnoh. You battle all four in a row, and then the Champion.":"这扇门后面就是神奥的四天王。你要连续挑战四人，然后是冠军。","Sinnoh's Elite Four use Bug, Ground, Fire and Psychic Pokémon. And the Champion? I hear she spends her days reading old stories.":"神奥的四天王用的是虫、地面、火和超能力属性的宝可梦。那冠军呢？听说她整天都在读古老的传说。","A shelf of records: the names of every Champion of Sinnoh's Pokémon League.":"一排记录架：上面写着神奥宝可梦联盟历代冠军的名字。","Elite Four Aaron":"四天王阿柳","Welcome. I am Aaron of the Elite Four. Most people look at a Bug Pokémon and see something small and weak. I see something that never gives up. Let me show you how far that goes!":"欢迎。我是四天王阿柳。大多数人看到虫属性宝可梦，只觉得它们又小又弱。我看到的却是永不放弃。让我告诉你，这能走多远！","I lost... My Pokémon fought to the very end, and so did yours.":"我输了……我的宝可梦战斗到了最后一刻，你的也一样。","Go on. Bertha is next, and she has been doing this for longer than any of us.":"去吧。下一位是菊野，她比我们谁干这一行都久。","Back again, Champion? My Bug Pokémon have shed their old shells. See what has grown underneath!":"又来了吗，冠军？我的虫属性宝可梦已经蜕去了旧壳。看看里面长出了什么吧！","Elite Four Bertha":"四天王菊野","Well now, such a young face. I am Bertha of the Elite Four. My Pokémon and I are as patient as the ground under your feet. Come along, dear, and show this old woman what you can do.":"哎呀，好年轻的一张脸。我是四天王菊野。我和我的宝可梦就像你脚下的大地一样有耐心。来吧，孩子，让我这老太婆看看你的本事。","Oh my. It has been years since anyone shook the ground under me.":"哎哟。好多年没人能撼动我脚下的地面了。","Flint is next. He may grin at you, but his fire is no joke. Take care, dear.":"下一位是大叶。他也许会冲你笑，但他的火可不是闹着玩的。小心点，孩子。","Back to see me, Champion? How kind of you. The ground has not forgotten your footsteps.":"又来看我了，冠军？真是有心。大地还记得你的脚步。","There you are! Volkner has not stopped talking about you since Sunyshore. You woke him up, so now it is my turn. My team only knows one way to fight: all out. Let us burn!":"你可算来了！自从滨海市之后，电次就一直在说你。你把他点着了，现在轮到我了。我的队伍只会一种打法：全力燃烧。来吧！","Whew! Burned right down to the ashes. Now I see what got Volkner out of that lighthouse.":"呼！烧得连灰都不剩了。现在我明白是什么把电次从灯塔里拉出来的了。","Lucian is the last of us. Good luck getting him to put his book down.":"悟松是我们中的最后一位。想让他放下手里的书，祝你好运。","Champion! Volkner says hello. He also says I will lose again. Let us prove him wrong!":"冠军！电次向你问好。他还说我又要输了。我们来证明他说错了吧！","Elite Four Lucian":"四天王悟松","One moment, please. I would like to finish this page... There. I am Lucian of the Elite Four. Books have taught me a great deal, but some things are only written in a battle. Shall we read each other?":"请稍等，我想读完这一页……好了。我是四天王悟松。书教会了我很多，但有些东西只写在对战里。让我们读一读彼此吧。","Hm. I did not see that ending coming.":"嗯。我没料到会是这样的结局。","The Champion is beyond that door. I believe you have met. Do not expect what you remember.":"冠军就在那扇门后面。我想你们见过面。别指望她还是你记忆中的样子。","Champion. I have read another whole shelf since we last met. Every book was about how to beat you.":"冠军。上次见面之后，我又读完了一整架书。每一本讲的都是怎样打败你。","So you came, {player}. I hoped you would.":"你来了，{player}。我一直希望你会来。","I told you I study the old stories of Sinnoh, and that is true. I did not tell you the rest: I am the Champion of this League.":"我说过我在研究神奥的古老传说，这是真的。但还有一件事我没告诉你：我就是这座联盟的冠军。","We stood together at the Spear Pillar and in that broken world. Today there is nobody to stop, nothing to save. It is only you, me and our Pokémon.":"我们一起站在枪之柱，也一起走过那个破碎的世界。今天没有谁要阻止，也没有什么要拯救。只有你、我，和我们的宝可梦。","I have looked forward to this since the day we met. Come, and hold nothing back!":"从我们相遇的那天起，我就在期待这一刻。来吧，别留一点余力！","...That was the best battle I have had in a very long time. Thank you, {player}. From today, you are the Champion of Sinnoh.":"……这是我很久以来打过的最棒的一场对战。谢谢你，{player}。从今天起，你就是神奥的冠军。","Hm. So it is done. I left my lab to see this with my own eyes, and I am glad I did.":"嗯。总算到了这一步。我离开研究所，就是想亲眼看看，这一趟来得值。","You came to Sinnoh as a stranger and picked up a Pokémon from my briefcase. Look at what the two of you have done since.":"你初到神奥时人生地不熟，从我的公文包里拿了一只宝可梦。看看你们俩后来做到了什么。","Come with us, {player}. There is one more room, and only a Champion may enter it.":"跟我们来吧，{player}。还有最后一个房间，只有冠军才能进去。","Welcome back, Champion. I have found a few new stories, and my team has grown stronger. Shall we?":"欢迎回来，冠军。我又找到了几个新的传说，我的队伍也更强了。开始吧？","Still the Champion. I will never get tired of this. Come back whenever you like.":"依然是冠军。这样的对战我永远不会腻。想来就随时来吧。","The Hall of Fame. Sinnoh's Champions and their Pokémon are remembered here forever.":"殿堂。神奥的冠军和他们的宝可梦将在这里被永远铭记。","The names of Sinnoh's Champions and their Pokémon are kept in this room for as long as the League stands. Today, yours join them.":"只要联盟还在，神奥历代冠军和他们的宝可梦的名字就会留在这个房间里。今天，你们的名字也加入了。","Sinnoh has its old stories, and now it has a new one. Be sure to write to Birch. He will want to hear all of it.":"神奥有它古老的传说，现在又多了一个新的。记得写信给小田卷。他一定想知道全部经过。","Time, space and the lakes are all at peace, thanks to you. Go home and rest, Champion. I will be here when you want another battle.":"时间、空间和三座湖都平静下来了，这都多亏了你。回家好好休息吧，冠军。想再打一场的时候，我会在这里。","A cave opens in the rock of the island. A strange pressure turns you back.":"岛上的岩石间有个洞穴。一股奇怪的压力把你推了回来。","{mon} sits with its eyes closed. As you come near, they begin to open.":"{mon}闭着眼睛。你走近时，它的眼睛慢慢睁开了。","{mon} hovers in the middle of the cave. It seems to have been waiting for you.":"{mon}浮在洞穴中央，好像一直在等你。","{mon} faded away into the dark. It may come back when the cave is quiet.":"{mon}消失在黑暗中。等洞穴安静下来，它也许会回来。","{mon} floats in the dim light and looks straight at you.":"{mon}浮在昏暗的光里，直直地看着你。","{mon} gave a soft cry and vanished!":"{mon}轻轻叫了一声，消失了！","It must be roaming somewhere in Sinnoh now. The Town Map will show where.":"它现在一定在神奥的某处游荡。城镇地图会显示它的位置。","The {item} grows warm in your bag, and {mon} looks down at you. Time itself seems to hold its breath.":"包里的{item}渐渐发热，{mon}低头看着你。时间仿佛屏住了呼吸。","The {item} shines in your bag, and {mon} looks down at you. The air between the pillars begins to bend.":"包里的{item}亮了起来，{mon}低头看着你。柱子之间的空气开始弯曲。","{mon} faded in among the pillars. It may answer you again.":"{mon}消失在柱子之间。它也许还会回应你。","The air over the Spear Pillar grew still. Time and space are flowing as they should.":"枪之柱上空的空气静了下来。时间和空间都在正常流动。","You climbed all the way up to pay your respects? Bless you. Take this. It keeps wild Pokémon from bothering you.":"你一路爬上来扫墓吗？真是好孩子。拿着这个吧。它能让野生宝可梦少来打扰你。","Let the Pokémon at the front of your team hold the Cleanse Tag, and fewer wild ones will come near.":"让队伍最前面的宝可梦带着洁净之符，野生宝可梦就不太会靠近了。","The spirits here are gentle, but they like to play tricks. Here, a tag with their power in it.":"这里的灵魂都很温和，就是爱捉弄人。给你，这张符里有它们的力量。","A Pokémon holding the Spell Tag hits harder with Ghost-type moves. The spirits lend it a hand.":"带着诅咒之符的宝可梦，幽灵属性招式的威力会更强。是灵魂在帮它一把。","I come every week to visit my Starly. The old women at the very top keep all the graves clean.":"我每周都来看我的姆克儿。最顶层的两位婆婆把每座墓都打扫得干干净净。","Oliver":"奥利弗","My friends dared me to climb to the top. Battle me, so I have an excuse to stop here!":"朋友打赌说我不敢爬到顶。跟我对战吧，这样我就有理由停在这里了！","Now I have to keep climbing...":"这下只好继续往上爬了……","Is it just me, or did that grave move?":"是我的错觉吗？那座墓好像动了一下？","I bring my Pichu here so they are not scared of ghosts. It is not working yet!":"我带皮丘来这里，好让它们不再怕幽灵。目前还没什么效果！","Brave little things, all the same.":"不过它们还是很勇敢的小家伙。","Pikachu was the bravest of them. It still is.":"皮卡丘以前是最勇敢的，现在也是。","Do not laugh at my Cleffa. It is tougher than it looks. So am I!":"不准笑我的皮宝宝。它比看起来强悍多了。我也是！","You did not laugh. Respect.":"你没笑。佩服。","I come up here to think. The quiet does me good.":"我上来这里是为了想想事情。安静一点挺好的。","Beth & Bob":"贝丝和鲍勃","Pa and I raised these two Ponyta from foals. Let us show you how they run!":"我和爸爸从小把这两只小火马养大。让你看看它们跑得多快！","They ran their best. That is what counts.":"它们已经尽全力跑了。这才是最重要的。","We came to visit the old farm horse. Well, the old farm Rapidash.":"我们是来看农场的那匹老马的。嗯，是农场那只老烈焰马。","Rebekah":"丽贝卡","My Bonsly cries when it sees the graves. A battle cheers it up!":"我的盆才怪一看到墓碑就哭。对战能让它打起精神！","There, there. You did so well.":"好了好了，你做得很好。","Bonsly is smiling again. Thank you.":"盆才怪又笑了。谢谢你。","Mike & Nat":"迈克和娜特","We came here on a dare. Now we are scared, so we will battle you instead!":"我们是打赌才来的。现在害怕了，所以干脆跟你对战吧！","Even our ghosts were scared of you.":"连我们的幽灵都怕你。","Let us go home. Holding hands. Tightly.":"我们回家吧。手牵着手。牵紧一点。","A gravestone, polished smooth by many hands. \"For all the Pokémon who walked beside us.\"":"一块被许多双手摸得光滑的墓碑。“献给所有曾陪伴在我们身边的宝可梦。”","The biggest grave in the tower. Fresh flowers are laid before it every day.":"塔里最大的一座墓。每天都有人在墓前献上新鲜的花。","Oh, it is you! I would love to battle beside you again. My Pokémon are ready.":"啊，是你呀！真想再和你并肩作战一次。我的宝可梦都准备好了。","Mira remembers you! Mira and her Pokémon want to battle with you!":"麦儿记得你！麦儿和宝可梦都想和你一起对战！","Your aura feels as steady as ever. I would be glad to fight at your side.":"你的波导还是一样沉稳。能和你并肩作战，我很乐意。","...You came. If it is you, I do not mind teaming up.":"……你来了。如果是你的话，组队也没关系。","Hey, it is you! A tag team? Count me in, this is going to be a blast!":"嘿，是你啊！组队对战？算我一份，一定超有意思！","Seven wins in a row! Battling beside you makes my Pokémon so happy.":"连赢七场！和你并肩作战，我的宝可梦都好开心。","We won! Mira had so much fun!":"我们赢了！麦儿玩得好开心！","A fine set of battles. Your Pokémon and mine fought as one.":"真是一连串精彩的对战。你的宝可梦和我的宝可梦配合得天衣无缝。","...We were good together. Let us do it again.":"……我们配合得不错。下次再一起吧。","Ha ha! Did you see that? We were unstoppable!":"哈哈！看到没？我们简直势不可挡！","Welcome to the Battle Tower! This counter is for multi battles.":"欢迎来到对战塔！这个柜台受理组队对战。","In a multi battle, you and a partner each enter two Pokémon and battle two Trainers at once. Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points.":"组队对战中，你和伙伴各派出两只宝可梦，同时对战两位训练家。连赢七场就能完成一轮，获得对战点数。","Your two must be different species holding different items. Your partner waits in the Battle Salon and brings two of their own.":"你的两只必须是不同种类，携带不同道具。伙伴在对战沙龙等你，会带上自己的两只宝可梦。","Partners are Trainers you have traveled with on your journey. No one is waiting in the Battle Salon for you yet.":"伙伴是你在旅途中同行过的训练家。对战沙龙里还没有人在等你。","Thank you. Please choose your partner in the Battle Salon.":"谢谢。请到对战沙龙选择你的伙伴。","Talk to the Trainer you would like to battle beside.":"请和你想并肩作战的训练家说话。","Would you like to call off your challenge?":"要取消这次挑战吗？","Your challenge has been called off.":"这次挑战已经取消了。","Register at the multi battle counter first, and then we can team up.":"先到组队对战的柜台报名，我们再一起组队吧。","I will bring {one}, who knows {m1}, and {two}, who knows {m2}.":"我会带会{m1}的{one}，还有会{m2}的{two}。","Team up with {name}?":"要和{name}组队吗？","Let us do our best together!":"我们一起加油吧！","Battle No. {n}! Here come your opponents.":"第{n}场对战！对手们来了。","Fifty multi battles in a row! Your Pokémon received the {ribbon}!":"组队对战五十连胜！你的宝可梦获得了{ribbon}！","That was a good try. Let us team up again some time.":"这次也打得不错。下次再一起组队吧。","The door to the multi battle room. Talk to the Trainer you would like to battle beside first.":"通往组队对战室的门。请先和你想并肩作战的训练家说话。","{player}! There you are! I heard about Jubilife. You took on Team Galactic without me? Not fair!":"{player}！你可来了！我听说祝庆市的事了。你居然不叫上我就去对付银河队？太不公平了！","I have been training on this route all morning. Let me show you how much stronger we got!":"我一早上都在这条道路上训练。让你看看我们变得多强了！","Argh, again! Fine, fine, I will get you next time. The Oreburgh Gym is right past Oreburgh Gate, and I am getting there first!":"啊啊，又输了！好吧好吧，下次一定赢你。黑金道馆就在黑金关口后面，我要先到！","Ha! Told you we got stronger! The Oreburgh Gym is right past Oreburgh Gate. See you there!":"哈！我就说我们变强了吧！黑金道馆就在黑金关口后面。那里见！","There are seven more Gyms in Sinnoh. The next one is in Eterna City, past Floaroma Town. Its Leader, Gardenia, loves Grass types.":"神奥还有七个道馆。下一个在百代市，要经过苑之镇。那里的馆主菜种最喜欢草属性。","The Gym is locked. A note on the door says: \"Gone down the mine. Back soon! Roark\"":"道馆锁着。门上的纸条写着：“去矿山了，马上回来！瓢太”","Hm? A visitor, all the way down here?":"嗯？居然有人跑到这么深的地方来？","I am Roark, the Gym Leader of Oreburgh. I come down here to check the walls and look for fossils. Old habits!":"我是黑金道馆的馆主瓢太。我常下来检查岩壁、找找化石。老习惯了！","A challenger, you say? A Champion of three regions, no less! Then I had better get back to my Gym. See you there!":"你说你是来挑战的？还是三个地区的冠军！那我得赶紧回道馆了。道馆见！","Hey, Champion! Welcome to the first Gym of Sinnoh. Roark uses Rock-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠军！欢迎来到神奥的第一个道馆。瓢太使用岩石属性的宝可梦。","Water, Grass, Fighting, Ground and Steel moves work great on them. Fire, Normal and Flying moves barely scratch them.":"水、草、格斗、地面和钢属性的招式对它们很有效。火、一般和飞行属性的招式几乎伤不了它们。","Picked Chimchar? Train it until it evolves: Monferno's Mach Punch cracks rocks. Friends from home help too, as long as they are not above level 20.":"选了小火焰猴？把它练到进化：猛火猴的音速拳能击碎岩石。从家乡带来的伙伴也能帮忙，只要不超过20级就行。","This is the Coal Badge. It shows you beat me, fair and square.":"这是煤炭徽章。它证明你堂堂正正地打败了我。","{player} received the Coal Badge from Roark!":"{player}从瓢太那里得到了煤炭徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 25 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones raised in other regions.":"有了它，25级以下的宝可梦在神奥都会听你的话，就算是在其他地区培养的也一样。","Take this as well. TM76 is Stealth Rock: it scatters pointed stones that hurt every foe that comes into battle.":"把这个也收下吧。招式学习器76是隐形岩：撒下尖锐的岩石，伤害每一只上场的对手。","Dallas":"达拉斯","You are heading for the Oreburgh Gym? Then you need practice. Lucky you, I am here!":"你要去黑金道馆？那你得先练练。你运气真好，碰上我了！","I was the one who needed practice...":"需要练习的原来是我……","Starly fly in big flocks around here. One of them is bound to be strong.":"这一带的姆克儿成群结队地飞。总有一只是很强的。","Kaitlin":"凯特琳","My Shinx and I train on this route every day. Ready?":"我和我的小猫怪每天都在这条道路上训练。准备好了吗？","We will train some more tomorrow.":"明天我们再多练练。","Shinx use their sparks to talk to each other. Cute, right?":"小猫怪用火花互相交流。很可爱吧？","My Machop lifts rocks from the mine to get strong. Want to see its muscles?":"我的腕力会搬矿山的石头来锻炼。想看看它的肌肉吗？","Its muscles were not enough...":"光有肌肉还不够……","Fighting moves are great against Rock types. Remember that in Oreburgh!":"格斗属性的招式对岩石属性很有效。到了黑金市可别忘了！","Kyle":"凯尔","I just came out of Oreburgh Gate. The Zubat in there would not leave me alone, so I caught one!":"我刚从黑金关口出来。里面的超音蝠一直缠着我，所以我就抓了一只！","Should have caught two...":"早知道抓两只了……","Bring something to light the way? No need: the gate is lit well enough.":"要带照明的东西？不用啦：关口里够亮的。","This tunnel goes right under the mountain to Oreburgh City. The miners dug it long ago.":"这条隧道从山底下一直通到黑金市。是很久以前矿工们挖的。","Roark? He spends more time in the mine than in his Gym! Try the Oreburgh Mine, at the south end of town.":"瓢太？他待在矿山的时间比待在道馆还多！去城南的黑金矿山找找吧。","Coal from the Oreburgh Mine goes all over Sinnoh. Trains, ships, the power plants: they all run on it.":"黑金矿山的煤炭会送到神奥各地。火车、轮船、发电厂，全都靠它运转。","A blond boy ran into town earlier, shouting that he would beat the Gym before anyone else. He came out looking very red.":"刚才有个金发男孩冲进镇里，喊着要比谁都先打赢道馆。他出来的时候脸涨得通红。","Roark's Rock types hit hard and take hits well. Do not forget to heal before you go in!":"瓢太的岩石属性宝可梦攻击力强又耐打。进去之前别忘了恢复！","Escape Ropes sell well in a mining town. Nobody wants to get lost underground!":"在矿业小镇，离洞绳卖得特别好。谁也不想在地底下迷路！","Welcome to the Oreburgh Mining Museum! Fossils still turn up in the mine. One day we hope to wake the Pokémon inside them.":"欢迎来到黑金矿山博物馆！矿山里至今还会挖出化石。希望有一天能唤醒化石里的宝可梦。","Roark's father is a Gym Leader too, in a port city far to the west. Like father, like son!":"瓢太的父亲也是道馆馆主，在西边很远的一座港口城市。有其父必有其子！","Hey, this is a working mine! If you want to pass, you battle me first!":"喂，这里可是在开工的矿山！想过去就先和我对战！","You dig hard, kid.":"你挖得挺卖力嘛，小家伙。","Roark? He was heading down the ladder at the back.":"瓢太？他往最里面的梯子下去了。","Mason":"梅森","My Onix tunnels faster than any machine. Let it show you!":"我的大岩蛇挖隧道比任何机器都快。让它表演给你看！","Onix hit solid rock...":"大岩蛇撞上了坚硬的岩层……","Onix eat soil as they dig. That is why their bodies are full of stones.":"大岩蛇边挖边吃土。所以它们的身体里全是石头。","Watch out for falling rocks down here! And for me!":"小心这里的落石！还有小心我！","Ouch. That was a big rock.":"哎哟。那块石头可真大。","The boss is checking the walls over there. He likes to do it himself.":"老大在那边检查岩壁。他喜欢亲自动手。","Jonathon":"乔纳森","Roark taught me everything about Rock types. Now I will teach you!":"瓢太教了我所有关于岩石属性的事。现在轮到我教你了！","I need more lessons...":"我还得多上几堂课……","Roark found his Cranidos as a fossil in the mine. Amazing, right?":"瓢太的头盖龙是他在矿山里挖到的化石。很厉害吧？","I work in the mine by day and train in the Gym by night. Rock solid!":"我白天在矿山干活，晚上在道馆训练。坚如磐石！","Roark is right up ahead. His Stealth Rock hurts every Pokémon you switch in, so pick your first one well.":"瓢太就在前面。他的隐形岩会伤害你换上场的每一只宝可梦，所以第一只要选好。","Welcome to the Oreburgh Gym! I am Roark, the Gym Leader. A Champion of three regions, here in my Gym? Then my Rock types will give you everything they have!":"欢迎来到黑金道馆！我是馆主瓢太。三个地区的冠军来到我的道馆？那我的岩石属性宝可梦也要全力以赴了！","Well, that settles it. Your Pokémon dug deeper than mine!":"好吧，胜负已分。你的宝可梦挖得比我的更深！","Route 203. West: Jubilife City. East: Oreburgh Gate.":"203号道路。西：祝庆市　东：黑金关口","Oreburgh City. A mining town whose coal warms all of Sinnoh.":"黑金市。用煤炭温暖整个神奥的矿业城市。","Oreburgh Mine. Mind your step!":"黑金矿山。注意脚下！","A great lump of coal from the mine. Oreburgh's coal has kept Sinnoh warm for a hundred years.":"一大块矿山出产的煤炭。黑金市的煤炭温暖了神奥一百年。","A fossil from deep in the mine. Long ago, very different Pokémon lived in Sinnoh.":"从矿山深处挖出的化石。很久以前，神奥生活着和现在很不一样的宝可梦。","The slope up to Route 207 is all mud after the rain. Nobody can climb it right now. Try again later!":"下过雨后，通往207号道路的坡全是烂泥。现在谁也爬不上去。晚点再来吧！","Play the {item} at the Spear Pillar. If the old songs are true, the way to the Original One will open.":"到枪之柱去吹响{item}吧。如果古老的歌谣说的是真的，通往创世之神的路就会打开。","Those stone plates you carry... {n} of them. The old songs speak of sixteen, one for every power in the world.":"你带着的那些石板……有 {n} 块呢。古老的歌谣里说一共有十六块，世上每一种力量各有一块。","All sixteen plates... I never thought I would live to see them gathered in one place.":"十六块石板全都在……真没想到我这辈子能看到它们聚在一起。","The oldest of our songs tell of the Original One, {mon}, who shaped the world and gave each power its plate.":"我们最古老的歌谣讲述着创世之神{mon}，是它塑造了世界，并把石板分给了每一种力量。","My family has kept this {item} for longer than anyone remembers, waiting for one the plates would answer. I think that one is you.":"我们家守护这支{item}，久到谁也记不清了，一直在等石板愿意回应的人。我想，那个人就是你。","Take it to the Spear Pillar, where Cyrus once tried to remake the world. Play it there, and see what answers.":"把它带到枪之柱去吧，赤日曾经在那里试图重塑世界。在那里吹响它，看看会有什么回应。","{player} took out the {item}. Its clear note rang out between the pillars...":"{player}拿出了{item}。清澈的笛声在柱子之间回荡……","Steps of light formed above the center of the Spear Pillar, climbing up into the sky!":"枪之柱的中央浮现出光之阶梯，一直延伸到天空！","{mon} looks down from the top of the hall. The whole place seems to breathe with it.":"{mon}从大厅的最高处俯视着。整个地方仿佛随着它一起呼吸。","{mon} vanished in a burst of light. It may appear before you again.":"{mon}在一阵光芒中消失了。它也许还会再出现在你面前。","Huh? A kid? Beat it! This is Team Galactic business.":"嗯？小鬼？走开！这是银河队的事。","Well, since you are here, watch this. Our new Galactic Bomb needs a field test!":"算了，既然你在这里，就看好了。我们的新型银河炸弹要做实地测试！","A dull boom rolled across the marsh, and the ground shook!":"一声闷响传遍了大湿地，地面震动起来！","Ha ha! That was a small one. Imagine what a big one could do to a lake!":"哈哈！这只是颗小的。想象一下大的炸在湖上会怎么样！","What was that noise? You there! Hold it right there!":"刚才是什么声音？喂，你！站住！","Crasher Wake?! I am out of here!":"吉宪？！我闪了！","He ran east, toward Route 213 and the lakefront! I will check on the marsh. You go after him!":"他往东逃了，朝213号道路和立志湖畔去了！我去看看大湿地。你快追！","There you are, {player}! Wake told me you ran that guy off. Not bad!":"{player}，你在这儿！吉宪说你把那家伙赶跑了。不赖嘛！","But I spent all day training in the marsh mud. Time to find out who is stronger!":"不过我在大湿地的烂泥里练了一整天。来看看谁更强吧！","Argh! Again?! Okay, okay. I will just have to get even stronger!":"啊啊！又输了？！好吧好吧。我只好变得更强了！","Next time I will not lose! And I am going to catch something amazing, too. See you!":"下次我绝不会输！我还要抓一只超厉害的宝可梦。再见！","The next Gym is in Canalave City, far to the west past Jubilife. Its Leader, Byron, knows everything about Steel!":"下一个道馆在水脉市，往西经过祝庆市还要走很远。那里的馆主东瓜对钢属性无所不知！","Hey, Champion! Crasher Wake uses Water-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠军！吉宪使用水属性的宝可梦。","Electric moves hit Gyarados four times as hard, but they do nothing to his Quagsire, which is part Ground. Grass moves hit Quagsire four times as hard!":"电属性招式对暴鲤龙有四倍效果，但打不到沼王，因为它也是地面属性。草属性招式对沼王有四倍效果！","His Floatzel is fast, and it holds a Sitrus Berry. Up to level 40, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"他的浮潜鼬速度很快，还带着文柚果。在这里，你从家乡带来的宝可梦在40级以下都会听话。","Take the Fen Badge! You earned every drop of it.":"收下湿地徽章吧！这是你一滴一滴赢来的。","{player} received the Fen Badge from Crasher Wake!":"{player}从吉宪那里得到了湿地徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 50 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，50级以下的宝可梦在神奥都会听你的话，就算来自其他地区也一样。","And this is TM55, Brine. It hits twice as hard when the foe is down to half its HP or less!":"还有这个，招式学习器55，盐水。对手的HP在一半以下时，威力会变成两倍！","Hey, {player}! You beat Wake too? Nice, but listen!":"嘿，{player}！你也打赢吉宪了？不错，不过你听我说！","There is a guy in a space suit outside the Great Marsh gate, and he keeps talking about a bomb! That has to be Team Galactic!":"大湿地入口有个穿太空服的家伙，一直在说什么炸弹！肯定是银河队！","Go and check it out! I will keep people away from the marsh!":"你去看看！我来让大家别靠近大湿地！","Welcome to the Great Marsh!":"欢迎来到大湿地！","For ₽500 you get 30 Safari Balls and 500 steps to catch whatever you can. Would you like to go in?":"付₽500，可以得到30个狩猎球和500步，尽情捕捉吧。要进去吗？","We will call you when your steps or your Safari Balls run out. Mind the mud!":"步数或狩猎球用完时我们会叫你。小心烂泥！","Great Marsh attendant":"大湿地的工作人员","Crasher Wake loves this town. He wrestles in the mud with the children every morning!":"吉宪很爱这座城市。他每天早上都和孩子们在泥里摔角！","Nothing beats a walk in the marsh. You lose a boot now and then, that is all.":"在湿地散步最舒服了。只是偶尔会弄丢一只靴子。","Electric moves are great against Water types, but they cannot touch a Pokémon that is part Ground!":"电属性招式对水属性很有效，但打不到带地面属性的宝可梦！","Stock up before the marsh. You cannot use your own items in a Safari Game, though!":"去大湿地之前先备好东西。不过狩猎时不能用自己的道具哦！","Different Pokémon show up in the marsh every day. Nobody has ever seen all of them in one visit.":"大湿地每天都会出现不同的宝可梦。从来没有人一次就看遍过。","Jacky":"杰琪","My Bibarel paddles faster than I do. Splash!":"我的大尾狸游得比我还快。哗啦！","I got water up my nose!":"水跑进鼻子里了！","The walkways go back and forth. Keep going and you will reach Wake.":"走道来来回回绕着走。一直走就能到吉宪那里。","Damian":"达米安","Ahoy! No one crosses this pool without a battle!":"喂！不对战谁也别想过这个泳池！","Man overboard!":"有人落水啦！","Flying types help you stay out of the water, but Electric moves hit them hard.":"飞行属性可以不碰水，但怕电属性招式。","Caitlyn":"凯特琳","All three of us are from the same family. Look!":"我们三只是一家人。你看！","We all lost together...":"我们一起输了……","Azumarill looks soft, but it hits really hard.":"玛力露丽看起来软软的，打起来可狠了。","Samson":"参孙","I sailed all seven seas to train with Crasher Wake!":"我航遍七海，就是为了跟吉宪修行！","Back to port, then.":"那就回港吧。","Wake never stops smiling, even under that mask.":"吉宪总是笑呵呵的，就算戴着面罩也一样。","Fishing in a Gym pool? Wake says it is fine!":"在道馆泳池钓鱼？吉宪说没问题！","Gyarados is part Flying. Ground moves will not reach it.":"暴鲤龙也是飞行属性。地面招式打不到它。","Wake is just past me. My Whiscash will not let you by!":"吉宪就在我后面。我的鲶鱼王不会让你过去！","Go on. He is waiting for you.":"去吧。他在等你。","Whiscash is part Ground, like Wake's Quagsire. Grass moves are what you want.":"鲶鱼王也是地面属性，和吉宪的沼王一样。要用草属性招式。","Ha ha! Welcome! I am Crasher Wake, the masked Leader of the Pastoria Gym! Even a Champion of three regions gets soaked by my waves. Here I come!":"哈哈！欢迎！我是吉宪，湿原道馆的蒙面馆主！就算是三个地区的冠军，也会被我的浪头浇个透。来了！","What a wave! You rode it all the way to the shore!":"好大的浪！你一路乘着它冲到了岸上！","The Pokémon deep in the marsh are the hardest to find. Save your steps for the far side!":"大湿地深处的宝可梦最难找。留点步数到最里面吧！","Pastoria City. Home of the Great Marsh, where the mud runs deep.":"湿原市。大湿地的所在地，这里的烂泥可深了。","A big statue of Croagunk. People here say it brings good luck.":"一座巨大的不良蛙雕像。这里的人说它能带来好运。","The Great Marsh. A Safari Game at the gate: ₽500 for 30 Safari Balls and 500 steps.":"大湿地。入口受理狩猎：₽500，30个狩猎球，500步。","The Great Marsh. Throw Bait to calm a Pokémon, or a Rock to rile it up!":"大湿地。丢饵料能让宝可梦平静，丢石头能让它激动！","A lady named Cynthia came by, looking for you. She is at the lakefront, and she says the Psyduck on Route 210 need help!":"有位叫竹兰的女士来找过你。她在立志湖畔，说210号道路的可达鸭需要帮助！","Resort guide":"名胜区向导","Moira":"莫伊拉","Kyler":"凯勒","Krista":"克丽丝塔","Keegan":"基根","Corbin":"科尔宾","Meagan":"梅根","Davon":"达文","Deshawn":"德肖恩","Sandra":"桑德拉","Glenn":"格伦","Sophia":"索菲娅","Mallory":"马洛里","Joanna":"乔安娜","Route 228. South: Route 229 and the Resort Area. The sand never stops blowing.":"228号道路。南：229号道路和名胜区。这里的风沙从来不停。","Sand in my eyes, sand in my teeth. A battle is the only thing that takes my mind off it!":"眼睛里是沙，牙缝里也是沙。只有对战能让我忘掉这些！","Now I have sand in my pride, too.":"现在连自尊心里都是沙了。","Keep your eyes half shut and keep walking. That is the only way through.":"眯着眼睛一直走。这是唯一的办法。","My team loves the sandstorm. Yours, I am not so sure.":"我的队伍最喜欢沙暴了。你的嘛，就不好说了。","Yours does not seem to mind it either.":"看来你的也不在乎嘛。","Ground types do not feel the sand at all. Lucky them.":"地面属性的完全不怕沙子。真羡慕。","A ranger never gets lost, even in a sandstorm. You, on the other hand...":"巡护员就算在沙暴里也不会迷路。至于你嘛……","You know exactly where you are going. Good.":"你很清楚自己要去哪里。很好。","The road goes south to the coast. The air gets clearer the further you go.":"这条路往南通到海边。越往前走，空气越清新。","I patrol this road every day. Today, I patrol you!":"我每天都在这条路上巡逻。今天就巡逻你了！","Patrol over. You win.":"巡逻结束。你赢了。","There is a pond to the west. Nobody knows how it stays full in all this sand.":"西边有个水塘。在这么多沙子里，谁也不知道它怎么一直是满的。","In the desert, dragons are born from the sand. Let me show you!":"在沙漠里，龙是从沙子里诞生的。让我给你看看！","Mine still has some growing to do.":"我的还得再长大一点。","One day my Vibrava will be a Flygon, and then the sandstorm will be ours.":"总有一天我的超音波幼虫会变成沙漠蜻蜓，到时候沙暴就是我们的了。","I cannot see a thing in this storm. So I see with my mind instead.":"风沙里什么都看不见。所以我用心灵来看。","My mind did not see that one coming.":"这一下我的心灵可没看到。","Close your eyes and listen. The sand sings.":"闭上眼睛听。沙子在唱歌。","I brought an Ice type to the desert. Do not laugh. Battle!":"我带了冰属性来沙漠。不许笑。来对战！","Fine. You may laugh now.":"好吧。现在你可以笑了。","My Abomasnow keeps me cool. It is better than a parasol.":"我的暴雪王能让我凉快下来。比遮阳伞还好用。","Training in the sand makes the legs strong! Hyah!":"在沙地上修行能练出好腿力！嘿呀！","My legs are strong. My Pokémon, less so.":"我的腿是练强了，宝可梦还差点。","Route 229 is just ahead. Then the sea. Then a nap.":"前面就是229号道路。然后是海。然后睡个午觉。","Route 229. South: the Resort Area. West: the sea.":"229号道路。南：名胜区。西：大海。","After the sandstorm, this road feels like paradise. Let us celebrate with a battle!":"穿过沙暴以后，这条路简直是天堂。用一场对战来庆祝吧！","Some celebration. Well done.":"这庆祝可真够呛。干得好。","Those flowers grow nowhere else in the Battle Zone. Please do not step on them.":"那些花在对战特区别的地方都不长。请别踩它们。","I came here to rest. Then I saw you, and I forgot all about resting.":"我是来这里休息的。结果看到你，就把休息全忘了。","Now I really do need a rest.":"这下我是真的需要休息了。","The Resort Area is just south. Everybody there is on holiday, all the time.":"名胜区就在南边。那里的人一年到头都在度假。","A Champion on my road? Then I get to see what a Champion can do!":"冠军走到我这条路上来了？那我正好看看冠军有多厉害！","So that is what a Champion can do.":"原来冠军这么厉害。","I will be a Champion one day, too. Just you wait.":"总有一天我也会成为冠军。你等着瞧。","My team is a little bit of everything. Let us see if you can handle it!":"我的队伍什么属性都有一点。看看你应付得来吗！","You handled it, all right.":"你确实应付得来。","There is a grove behind the trees to the west. You need to cut your way in.":"西边的树后面有一片小树林。得砍开树才能进去。","Route 230. West: Fight Area. East: Route 229.":"230号水路。西：战斗区。东：229号道路。","I swim from Fight Area and back every day. Today I will beat a Champion on the way!":"我每天都从战斗区游个来回。今天顺路打败一个冠军！","Or not. Back to swimming.":"看来不行。继续游吧。","The island in the middle is a good place to rest your arms.":"中间那个小岛很适合让胳膊歇一歇。","Pinch, pinch! My crabs are hungry!":"夹夹夹！我的螃蟹饿了！","Ouch. They pinched me instead.":"哎哟。它们夹的是我。","Kingler can cut through anything. Except you, it seems.":"巨钳蟹什么都能夹断。看来除了你。","I followed a Lapras out here, and now I cannot find my way back. Battle me while I think!":"我跟着一只拉普拉斯游到这里，现在找不到回去的路了。我想办法的时候，陪我打一场吧！","I think I know the way now. That way. Probably.":"我想我知道路了。往那边。大概吧。","Lapras carries people across the sea. Mine just carries me.":"拉普拉斯会载人渡海。我的只载我一个。","Delibird has a present for you! It might be a nice one. It might not.":"信使鸟有礼物要送你！也许是好东西。也许不是。","Not a nice one, then. For me.":"看来不是好东西。对我来说。","Mantine glides over the waves. I wish I could.":"巨翅飞鱼能在浪上滑翔。真希望我也可以。","The water is cold out here. A battle will warm us up!":"这里的水好冷。打一场暖暖身吧！","I am warm now. Warm and beaten.":"现在暖和了。暖和，但是输了。","Sealeo loves cold water. It is the only one of us who does.":"海魔狮最爱冷水了。我们俩里只有它喜欢。","My Surskit walks on water. I have to swim. It is not fair!":"我的溜溜糖球能在水上走。我却得游泳。太不公平了！","This is not fair either!":"这个也不公平！","Route 229 is right there. You can see the flowers from the water.":"229号道路就在那边。在水里就能看到花。","A villa by the sea. It has stood empty all season.":"海边的别墅。整个季节都空着。","The Ribbon Syndicate. Members only.":"缎带同好会。仅限会员。","The Resort Area. Rest, relax, and leave your battles at the door.":"名胜区。休息、放松，把对战留在门外。","The villa over there has stood empty all season. Someone will move in one day, I am sure of it.":"那边的别墅整个季节都空着。总有一天会有人搬进去的，我敢肯定。","I came for one night and stayed three weeks. Nobody here is ever in a hurry.":"我本来只想住一晚，结果待了三个星期。这里谁都不着急。","The water here is warm all year. The swimmers on Route 230 are less friendly, though.":"这里的海水一年到头都很暖和。不过230号水路上的游泳选手就没这么友好了。","Welcome, welcome! You came all the way from the Survival Area? Then you have seen the whole Battle Zone.":"欢迎欢迎！你是从生存区一路走过来的？那你已经把整个对战特区都看过了。","This is the Resort Area. People come here to rest after their battles: the villas, the beach, the sound of the sea.":"这里是名胜区。大家打完仗都来这里休息：别墅、沙滩，还有海浪声。","Stay as long as you like. The sea will still be here tomorrow.":"想待多久就待多久。明天海也还在这里。","The door is locked. A note says the villa is waiting for its owner.":"门锁着。字条上写着：别墅在等它的主人。","Your team received the Sinnoh Champ Ribbon!":"你的队伍得到了神奥冠军奖章！","{mon} received the {ribbon}!":"{mon}得到了{ribbon}！","Good day. The Ribbon Syndicate is for members only.":"您好。奖章尊享会只对会员开放。","A Trainer may join once one of their Pokémon has earned ten ribbons. The most any of yours has is {n}.":"只要训练家有一只宝可梦得到十枚奖章，就能入会。你的宝可梦当中最多的有{n}枚。","A Trainer may join once one of their Pokémon has earned ten ribbons.":"只要训练家有一只宝可梦得到十枚奖章，就能入会。","Ten ribbons and more on {mon}! A Pokémon of such standing is always welcome. Please, come in.":"{mon}有十枚以上的奖章！这样身份的宝可梦永远受欢迎。请进。","Welcome back to the Ribbon Syndicate.":"欢迎回到奖章尊享会。","Welcome to the Ribbon Syndicate. We offer ribbons of the finest make, for Pokémon of the finest standing.":"欢迎光临奖章尊享会。我们为身份最尊贵的宝可梦，提供做工最精致的奖章。","Which Pokémon will wear it?":"要让哪只宝可梦佩戴？","Has them all":"已全部拥有","Do come again.":"欢迎再次光临。","{mon} already wears every ribbon we offer. Splendid!":"{mon}已经佩戴了我们提供的所有奖章。太出色了！","For {mon}, the {ribbon}, at ₽{price}. Shall I wrap it?":"为{mon}准备的是{ribbon}，价格₽{price}。需要为您包起来吗？","Of course. Take all the time you need.":"当然。请慢慢考虑。","I am afraid that is beyond your means today.":"恐怕您今天的预算不太够。","Our oils need a full day to warm. Please come back tomorrow.":"我们的精油要一整天才能温好。请明天再来。","Welcome to the spa. A massage with our special oils makes a Pokémon feel loved.":"欢迎来到水疗中心。用我们特制精油按摩，能让宝可梦感受到被爱。","Shall I give one of your Pokémon a massage?":"要为您的宝可梦按摩吗？","Which Pokémon?":"哪一只宝可梦？","{mon} looks wonderfully relaxed. It seems even fonder of you now.":"{mon}看起来非常放松。它好像更喜欢你了。","The Alert Ribbon, for waking up the week with a bright face.":"振奋奖章，送给精神饱满开始新一周的宝可梦。","The Shock Ribbon, for a heart that still races at surprises.":"心跳奖章，送给遇到惊喜仍会心跳加速的宝可梦。","The Downcast Ribbon, to remember a sad day and grow from it.":"失望奖章，记住难过的日子，并从中成长。","The Careless Ribbon, a reminder to slow down and look around.":"大意奖章，提醒自己放慢脚步，多看看身边。","The Relax Ribbon, for the easy calm at the end of the week.":"畅快奖章，送给一周结束时轻松自在的心情。","The Snooze Ribbon, for the deep, happy sleep of a weekend.":"酣睡奖章，送给周末那种又沉又甜的好觉。","The Smile Ribbon, for a smile that lights up everyone nearby.":"欢笑奖章，送给能让身边所有人都开心起来的笑容。","Hello! I am Julia. I can tell how a Pokémon feels just by looking at it, and every day of the week has a feeling of its own.":"你好！我是文子。我只要看一眼就知道宝可梦的心情，而一周的每一天也都有各自的心情。","So I made a ribbon for each day. Come by every day, and your Pokémon can collect all seven!":"所以我为每一天都做了一枚奖章。每天都来的话，你的宝可梦就能集齐七枚！","I have given away today's ribbon already. Come and see me tomorrow!":"今天的奖章已经送出去了。明天再来找我吧！","Who will wear the {ribbon}?":"谁来佩戴{ribbon}？","Has it":"已拥有","Come back any time today!":"今天随时都可以再来！","{mon} already has the {ribbon}. Maybe another of your Pokémon?":"{mon}已经有{ribbon}了。换一只宝可梦怎么样？","Hard work deserves a reward. Show me a Pokémon you have trained with all your heart!":"努力就该有回报。给我看看你用心训练的宝可梦吧！","{mon} wears the Effort Ribbon already, and it shows!":"{mon}已经戴着努力奖章了，一看就知道！","{mon} has trained well, but it could grow stronger still. Keep at it!":"{mon}练得不错，不过还能变得更强。继续加油！","Oh! {mon} has trained as hard as any Pokémon can. This is for it!":"哇！{mon}已经练到了宝可梦能达到的极限。这是给它的！","I am Dr. Footstep! One look at a Pokémon's footprints, and I know how it feels about its Trainer.":"我是足迹博士！只要看一眼宝可梦的脚印，就知道它对训练家有什么感觉。","Which Pokémon's footprints?":"要看哪只宝可梦的脚印？","Come back with footprints to show me!":"下次带脚印来给我看吧！","These footprints dance! {mon} loves you more than anything in the world.":"这些脚印在跳舞！{mon}爱你胜过世上的一切。","Such footprints deserve a ribbon of their own.":"这样的脚印，值得一枚专属的奖章。","Light, happy steps. {mon} loves being with you.":"轻快又开心的脚步。{mon}很喜欢和你在一起。","Steady steps. {mon} is fond of you, and growing fonder.":"稳稳的脚步。{mon}喜欢你，而且越来越喜欢。","Careful steps. {mon} is still getting to know you.":"小心翼翼的脚步。{mon}还在慢慢认识你。","Heavy steps... {mon} keeps its distance. Be kind to it.":"沉重的脚步……{mon}和你保持着距离。要对它好一点。","Doorman":"门卫","Butler":"管家","Masseuse":"按摩师","The spa is upstairs. A massage there leaves any Pokémon glowing with happiness.":"水疗中心在楼上。在那里按摩过的宝可梦，都会幸福得容光焕发。","Hearthome's Gym Leader is one of us, you know. She says the ribbons on her Pokémon are her proudest decorations.":"家缘市的道馆馆主也是我们的会员哦。她说她宝可梦身上的奖章，是她最自豪的装饰。","A Pokémon's ribbons tell its story. The Gorgeous Royal Ribbon tells everyone it is very, very rich.":"宝可梦的奖章诉说着它的故事。豪华高贵奖章则告诉大家：它非常、非常有钱。","They say the oils here are made with crushed pearls. My Pokémon has never been so calm.":"听说这里的精油是用磨碎的珍珠做的。我的宝可梦从来没有这么平静过。","Alexandra":"亚历珊德拉","Louis":"路易斯","A breeze blows through the tunnel. Eterna City and Celestic Town are joined again, under the mountain.":"一阵风吹过隧道。百代市和神和镇又在山底下连在一起了。","My birds ride the wind that comes down off the mountain. Want to see them fly?":"我的鸟儿乘着从山上吹下来的风。想看看它们飞吗？","They flew, and they fell.":"飞起来了，又掉下来了。","Birds cannot fly over Mt. Coronet. It is too tall, even for them.":"鸟儿飞不过天冠山。就算是它们，山也太高了。","Every Hiker in Sinnoh comes to Mt. Coronet sooner or later. Let me test your legs first!":"神奥的登山男迟早都会来天冠山。先让我考考你的腿力！","Strong legs. Strong Pokémon, too.":"腿力不错。宝可梦也不错。","The tunnel goes right through the mountain. Bring something that can break rocks.":"隧道穿过整座山。带上能打碎岩石的宝可梦吧。","You found my hiding place! A ninja never forgives that!":"你找到了我的藏身处！忍者绝不会原谅这种事！","I will find a better hiding place.":"我要找个更好的藏身处。","I hide here because nobody ever comes this way. Well, nobody used to.":"我藏在这里，是因为从来没人走这条路。嗯，以前是没人走。","Rocks have been falling up ahead all week. I would not go any further if I were you.":"前面这一整个星期都在落石。我要是你，就不再往前走了。","Route 211. East: Mt. Coronet, and through it Celestic Town. West: Eterna City.":"211号道路。东：天冠山，穿过山就是神和镇。西：百代市。","Jason":"杰森","Melissa":"梅莉莎","Reina":"蕾娜","Bobby":"鲍比","Alex":"亚历克斯","Caleb":"凯莱布","Allison":"艾莉森","Taylor":"泰勒","Danny":"丹尼","Alexa":"亚历克莎","Stefano":"斯特凡诺","Shaun":"肖恩","Belinda":"贝琳达","Emily":"艾米莉","Elena":"埃琳娜","Clare":"克莱尔","Celeste":"塞莱斯特","Welcome, welcome! I am Backlot, and this is my Mansion, the finest house in all of Sinnoh.":"欢迎欢迎！我是现慕，这是我的宅邸，全神奥最气派的房子。","Behind it lies my Trophy Garden. I walk in it every morning, and every morning I see some Pokémon or other.":"宅邸后面是我的自豪的后院。我每天早上都去散步，每天早上都会看到一些宝可梦。","This morning, {mon} was out in my Trophy Garden! A fine one. Go and look, if you like.":"今天早上我在自豪的后院里看到了{mon}！好漂亮的一只。想看的话就去看看吧。","My father owns half of Hearthome. I own this Prinplup. Battle me!":"我爸爸拥有半个家缘市。我拥有这只波皇子。来对战吧！","I shall tell my father about this.":"我要告诉我爸爸。","The Mansion over there is bigger than ours. I do not like to talk about it.":"那边的宅邸比我们家的还大。我不想提这件事。","I am out for a stroll with my Cherubi. Would you care for a little battle?":"我正带着樱花宝散步。来一场小小的对战如何？","Oh my. That was not little at all.":"哎呀。这一点都不小。","Mr. Backlot invites everyone to tea. His garden is lovely in the morning.":"现慕先生会请所有人喝茶。他的院子早上特别美。","My Chatot has learned to say \"battle\". It says it all day long. Very well, battle!":"我的聒噪鸟学会说“对战”了，一整天都在说。好吧，那就对战！","Now it is saying \"lost\". Clever bird.":"现在它在说“输了”。真是只聪明的鸟。","A gentleman always walks this road before lunch. It is good for the digestion.":"绅士总在午饭前走这条路。有助于消化。","My Roselia matches my dress. Do try to keep up!":"我的毒蔷薇和我的裙子很配。你可要跟上哦！","You have ruined my dress. Well, my battle.":"你弄坏了我的裙子。哦，是我的对战。","They say it rains all year to the south. I never go there. My shoes, you understand.":"听说南边一年到头都在下雨。我从来不去。你懂的，我的鞋子。","Halt! Routine check. Show me your Pokémon!":"站住！例行检查。把你的宝可梦拿出来！","Everything is in order. Very much in order.":"一切正常。非常正常。","We patrol this road for the Mansion. A lot of valuable things in there.":"我们在这条路上巡逻，是为了保护那座宅邸。里面有很多值钱的东西。","You look suspicious. That is, you look like a strong Trainer. Same thing!":"你看起来很可疑。我是说，你看起来是个很强的训练家。一个意思！","Not suspicious at all. Strong, though.":"一点也不可疑。倒是很强。","If you see anything strange on this road, report it. Or battle it.":"在这条路上看到奇怪的东西，就报警。或者跟它打一场。","Police! Stop right there. A battle is the fastest way to check your papers.":"警察！站住。对战是检查证件最快的方法。","Your papers are fine. Your Pokémon are better.":"证件没问题。宝可梦更没问题。","My partner and I take turns. One battles, the other writes the report.":"我和搭档轮流来。一个对战，一个写报告。","The south road was underwater for weeks. Now that it is open, I check everyone!":"南边的路淹了好几个星期。现在通了，我要检查每一个人！","Checked, and found strong.":"检查完毕，结论：很强。","Bring an umbrella. Further south, the rain never stops.":"带把伞吧。再往南走，雨就没停过。","A ranger keeps going whatever the weather. Can you?":"巡护员不管天气怎样都要前进。你行吗？","You can. Clearly.":"你行。显然。","My Monferno hates the rain. It battles twice as hard to get it over with.":"我的猛火猴讨厌下雨。它打得格外卖力，想早点结束。","The marsh is full of Pokémon that love the rain. So are we!":"湿地里全是喜欢下雨的宝可梦。我们也是！","You are not even wet. How?":"你居然一点都没淋湿。怎么做到的？","Leafeon grows faster in the rain. So does the grass. So does everything here.":"叶伊布在雨里长得更快。草也是。这里的一切都是。","Careful on the bridges! And careful of me!":"过桥小心！也要小心我！","You were careful. And strong.":"你很小心。也很强。","Carnivine hang from the trees here and wait. Watch your head.":"这里的尖牙笼挂在树上等着。小心你的脑袋。","Even in this weather, the law never sleeps. Battle!":"就算天气这样，法律也从不休息。对战！","The law is soaked. And beaten.":"法律淋湿了。还输了。","I am posted down here as a punishment. Do not ask what I did.":"我是被罚到这里站岗的。别问我做了什么。","My parasol keeps the rain off. Nothing keeps my Pokémon off you!":"阳伞能挡雨，可挡不住我的宝可梦！","I stayed dry, but I lost.":"我没淋湿，可是输了。","A parasol in the rain? It works for both, you know.":"下雨天打阳伞？晴天雨天都能用嘛。","Nothing bites when it rains this hard. So I bite instead!":"雨这么大，什么都不上钩。那就换我来咬人了！","Not much bite left in me now.":"现在我咬不动了。","Gyarados love the rain. I hooked this one on a day like today.":"暴鲤龙最喜欢下雨。我就是在这样的天气钓到它的。","Two Goldeen, two chances. Let us see!":"两只角金鱼，两次机会。来吧！","Two chances, two losses.":"两次机会，两次失败。","The channels are deeper than they look. Surf carefully.":"这些水道比看起来深。冲浪的时候小心点。","Wooper loves puddles, and there are puddles everywhere. We are very happy here!":"乌波最喜欢水坑了，这里到处都是。我们在这里好开心！","Still happy. A little less, maybe.":"还是很开心。可能少了一点点。","If you stand still long enough in the marsh, a Wooper will sit on your foot.":"在湿地里站着不动够久的话，会有乌波坐到你脚上。","I am measuring the rain. Your battle will make an interesting data point.":"我在测量降雨量。你的对战会是个有趣的数据。","An outlier! Fascinating.":"异常值！太有意思了。","It has rained here every day for the last three hundred days. I have the numbers.":"这里过去三百天每天都在下雨。我有数据为证。","Electricity and water! Science says this is a bad idea. Let us test it!":"电和水！科学说这是个坏主意。来验证一下吧！","The experiment failed. Science is satisfied.":"实验失败了。科学很满意。","Do not try what I just did at home.":"我刚才做的事，千万别在家里尝试。","Barboach! Barboach! Barboach! And one Gyarados, for luck!":"泥泥鳅！泥泥鳅！泥泥鳅！再加一只暴鲤龙，讨个吉利！","Not so lucky, then.":"看来也没那么吉利。","Barboach live in the mud. That is why they like this place.":"泥泥鳅住在泥里。所以它们喜欢这里。","One for the day and one for the night. A collector needs both!":"一只白天的，一只晚上的。收藏家两只都得有！","My collection lost. It is still a very nice collection.":"我的收藏输了。但还是很棒的收藏。","Eevee can become many things. I want them all. My wallet does not.":"伊布能进化成好多种。我全都想要。我的钱包可不想。","I guard this statue day and night. Mostly day. Nobody has tried to steal it yet.":"我日夜守着这座雕像。主要是白天。还没有人想偷它。","Welcome to the Pokémon Mansion. The maids enjoy a battle, if you have the time. The young master and the young lady prefer to watch.":"欢迎光临宝可梦屋。有空的话，女仆们很乐意和您对战。少爷和小姐更喜欢在旁边看。","A statue of a Pokémon nobody has ever seen. Mr. Backlot had it made from a picture in an old book.":"一座谁都没见过的宝可梦的雕像。现慕先生照着一本旧书里的图画请人做的。","Welcome, Master Trainer! May I offer you a battle with your tea?":"欢迎光临，训练家大人！要来一场对战配茶吗？","Thank you for the lesson.":"谢谢您的指教。","Our Clefairy all know Metronome. Anything can happen!":"我们的皮皮都会挥指。什么都可能发生！","The second course is a battle. Please enjoy!":"第二道菜是对战。请慢用！","I hope it was to your taste.":"希望合您的口味。","The young master is watching from upstairs. He loves a good battle.":"少爷在楼上看着。他最喜欢精彩的对战了。","I have just finished the dusting. Now, a battle!":"我刚打扫完灰尘。现在，来对战！","Everything is clean, and I am beaten.":"屋子干净了，我也输了。","Encore! That is what Clefairy says when it likes something.":"再来一次！皮皮喜欢什么的时候就会这么说。","Only the finest battles in this house. Shall we?":"这座宅邸里只有最高级的对战。我们开始吧？","Very fine indeed.":"确实很高级。","There is one more of us. She is the strongest.":"我们还有一位。她是最强的。","I am the head maid. If you beat me, the young master and the young lady wish to meet you.":"我是女仆长。如果您赢了我，少爷和小姐想见见您。","Splendid. I shall tell them at once.":"太精彩了。我这就去告诉他们。","They are waiting for you in the hall. Do go and see them.":"他们在大厅等您。请过去吧。","You beat all five of our maids! Now you must battle my Blissey. It is only fair.":"你打败了我们家的五位女仆！现在你得和我的幸福蛋对战。这才公平。","My Blissey is the happiest Blissey in Sinnoh, even when it loses.":"我的幸福蛋是神奥最幸福的幸福蛋，输了也一样。","Come back any time. The maids always want another battle.":"随时再来。女仆们总想再打一场。","The maids say you are very strong. My Blissey and I would like to see for ourselves.":"女仆们说你很强。我和我的幸福蛋想亲眼看看。","How exciting! Nobody ever beats my Blissey.":"好刺激！从来没有人赢过我的幸福蛋。","Father says I may have a battle every day, as long as I finish my lessons.":"爸爸说只要我做完功课，每天都可以对战。","Mr. Backlot walks here every morning. Whatever he sees, he tells everyone about. Then it is my job to find it again.":"现慕先生每天早上都来这里散步。他看到什么都会告诉大家。然后我就得负责再找到它。","Route 212. North: Hearthome City. South: Pastoria City.":"212号道路。北：家缘市。南：湿原市。","The Pokémon Mansion. The home of Mr. Backlot. Visitors welcome, Pokémon most welcome.":"宝可梦屋。现慕先生的宅邸。欢迎来访，更欢迎宝可梦。","Route 212. East: Pastoria City. Mind the rain, and the marsh.":"212号道路。东：湿原市。小心雨和湿地。","Route 212. West: Hearthome City, past the Pokémon Mansion.":"212号道路。西：家缘市，要经过宝可梦屋。","Welcome to Pal Park! Pokémon brought here from faraway lands run free in the park, and Trainers may catch them.":"欢迎来到伙伴公园！从遥远的地方带来的宝可梦会在园里自由奔跑，训练家可以捕捉它们。","...But no Pokémon from faraway lands have arrived yet, so the park is not open. We are very sorry!":"……不过，还没有从遥远地方来的宝可梦，所以公园还没开放。非常抱歉！","Trenton":"特伦顿","My float and me can go anywhere! Even to a battle!":"我和我的游泳圈哪里都能去！连对战也能去！","My float sprang a leak...":"我的游泳圈漏气了……","The sea goes on and on down there. Grown-ups swim all the way to the next beach.":"往那边，海一直一直延伸下去。大人们会一路游到下一片沙滩。","Mariel":"玛丽尔","This sandbar is my secret island. You have to battle to visit!":"这片沙洲是我的秘密小岛。想来玩就得先对战！","Okay, you can visit. Just this once.":"好吧，你可以来玩。就这一次哦。","Marill and I build sandcastles here every day. The waves always win in the end.":"我和玛力露每天都在这里堆沙堡。最后总是被海浪冲掉。","I swim from Sandgem to Route 221 and back every morning. Today you are my warm-up!":"我每天早上都从真砂镇游到221号道路再游回来。今天就拿你来热身！","I need a longer warm-up.":"看来我得多热身一会儿。","Swim east, and you will reach land. Then you can rest your Pokémon.":"往东游就能上岸。到时候可以让你的宝可梦休息一下。","Vincent":"文森特","Out here, nobody can hear you lose. Shall we?":"在这片海上，没人听得到你输掉的声音。来吧？","Well, at least nobody heard that.":"唉，至少没人听到。","The islands out here are tiny, but people leave all kinds of things on them.":"这附近的小岛都很小，可是总有人在上面留下各种东西。","A whole school of Goldeen! Can you keep up with us?":"一整群角金鱼！你跟得上我们吗？","We scattered like a school of fish.":"我们像鱼群一样被冲散了。","Goldeen love the warm water around the islands.":"角金鱼最喜欢小岛周围温暖的海水。","Erica":"艾丽卡","My Finneon glows at night. In the daytime, it battles!":"我的荧光鱼晚上会发光。白天嘛，就来对战！","Not even a glimmer of a chance.":"连一丝希望的微光都没有。","Finneon swim in pairs. I am still looking for a second one.":"荧光鱼都是成双成对地游。我还在找第二只。","Adrian":"阿德里安","Remoraid can shoot water like a cannon. Want to see?":"铁炮鱼能像大炮一样喷水。想看看吗？","Missed every shot!":"一发都没打中！","Octillery grabbed my leg once. We have been friends ever since.":"有一次章鱼桶缠住了我的腿。从那以后我们就成了朋友。","Katelyn":"凯特琳","My Medicham meditates on the waves. Do not break its focus!":"我的恰雷姆在浪上冥想。别打断它！","Its focus broke. So did mine.":"它的专注被打断了。我也是。","Medicham cannot swim, but it floats very calmly.":"恰雷姆不会游泳，可是浮得很平静。","Claire":"克莱尔","Floatzel and I race the boats out here. Race me instead!":"我和浮潜鼬常在这里跟船比赛。来跟我比吧！","You win the race. By a lot.":"比赛你赢了。赢了好多。","Route 221 is just ahead. There is a park at the end of it.":"前面就是221号道路。路的尽头有一座公园。","Last stretch before the beach! Let us make it count!":"离沙滩只剩最后一段了！好好打一场吧！","I will float the rest of the way.":"剩下的路我就漂过去吧。","Fishermen line the beach here. Mind their lines.":"这片沙滩上都是钓鱼的人。小心他们的鱼线。","Vanessa":"瓦妮莎","Golduck taught me to swim. Now it teaches Trainers to lose!":"哥达鸭教会了我游泳。现在它要教训练家怎么输！","Golduck is holding its head. So am I.":"哥达鸭抱着头。我也是。","Golduck always gets a headache when it battles. It still loves it.":"哥达鸭一对战就头痛。可它还是很喜欢对战。","Cory":"科里","Three Finneon on one line! Now watch them battle!":"一根鱼线钓到三只荧光鱼！现在看它们对战吧！","They all got away from me...":"全都从我手里溜走了……","With a good rod you can catch Finneon here. With a super rod, something much bigger.":"用好钓竿能在这里钓到荧光鱼。用厉害钓竿的话，能钓到大得多的家伙。","My Togetic is the rarest thing in my collection. Want a closer look?":"我的波克基古是我收藏里最稀有的。想近一点看看吗？","A rare loss, too.":"这场败仗也很稀有。","They say Pokémon from faraway lands come to the park at the end of this road. I am waiting at the gate!":"听说从遥远地方来的宝可梦会到这条路尽头的公园。我要在大门口等着！","Jake":"杰克","I came all this way to train where nobody bothers me. You will do, though!":"我大老远跑来，就是想在没人打扰的地方修行。不过你来得正好！","That is the kind of battle I came for.":"我就是为了这种对战才来的。","Staraptor and Girafarig make a strange pair. That is why they work.":"姆克鹰和麒麟奇是奇怪的组合。所以才合得来。","Shannon":"香农","The flowers here are lovely, and so is my team. Let me show you!":"这里的花很美，我的队伍也一样。让我给你看看！","Lovely, and beaten.":"美丽，但输了。","Cherrim opens up whenever the sun comes out. Today it stayed shut.":"樱花儿只要出太阳就会绽放。今天它一直合着。","I brought my Pokémon all the way from another land to see the park. It seems I am a little early.":"我特地带着宝可梦从别的地方来看这座公园。看来我来得早了点。","Route 221. East: Pal Park.":"221号道路。东：伙伴公园。","Micah & Brandi":"米卡和布兰迪","Desiree & Landon":"德西蕾和兰登","Deandre & Kendra":"迪安德烈和肯德拉","Eddie & Willie":"埃迪和威利","Terrell":"特雷尔","Clarice":"克拉丽斯","Brenden":"布伦登","Ruben":"鲁本","Maxwell":"麦克斯韦","Armando":"阿曼多","...You are the Champion. I am Marley. I want to see the stone at the end of Route 224.":"……你是冠军吧。我是米依。我想去看224号道路尽头的石碑。","The fog out there is thick, and my Arcanine cannot clear it. I would rather not go alone. May I come with you?":"外面的雾很浓，我的风速狗没办法把雾吹散。我不太想一个人去。可以和你一起走吗？","The Trainers in here like to battle in pairs. Arcanine and I will fight beside you, and I will see to your team.":"这里的训练家喜欢两人一组对战。我和风速狗会在你身边一起战斗，也会照顾你的队伍。","Arcanine knows the way by smell. I just follow Arcanine. And you.":"风速狗是靠鼻子认路的。我只要跟着风速狗。还有你。","Marley looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"米依照顾了你的宝可梦。它们完全恢复了！","So this is the stone. They say a Pokémon covered in flowers comes here to give thanks.":"这就是那块石碑啊。听说有一只全身开满花的宝可梦会来这里表达感谢。","I do not see it. Maybe it only comes when nobody is looking. ...That is all right.":"没看到它。也许它只在没人看的时候才来。……没关系。","Thank you for walking with me. Sometimes I battle at the Battleground in the Survival Area. Come and find me.":"谢谢你陪我走这一趟。我有时会在生存区的对决场对战。来找我吧。","Only Champions come this way. Let us see if you two deserve to!":"只有冠军才会来这里。看看你们两个配不配！","You deserve it. Both of you.":"你们配。两个都配。","The road east comes out by the sea. It is always foggy there.":"往东的路出去就是海边。那里总是有雾。","I have walked these caves since before the League was built. Show me what the new Champion can do.":"联盟建起来之前，我就在这些洞窟里走了。让我看看新冠军有多大本事。","The new Champion can do a great deal.":"新冠军果然本事不小。","There is a stone at the end of Route 224. Nobody knows who carved it.":"224号道路尽头有一块石碑。没人知道是谁刻的。","We saw two Trainers coming in our dreams. Here you are!":"我们在梦里看到有两位训练家要来。你们来了！","Our dreams did not show us losing.":"梦里可没看到我们会输。","The girl with you has a gentle mind. She worries more than she says.":"跟你一起的女孩心思很温柔。她担心的比她说出口的多。","I train here because nobody bothers me. You are bothering me. Battle!":"我在这里修行，就是因为没人打扰。你在打扰我。对战！","Fine. Go on. Stop bothering me.":"好吧。走吧。别再打扰我了。","The exit area is ahead. More Trainers who want to be left alone.":"前面就是出口那一片。还有更多想清静的训练家。","A Champion in my training spot? Then it is a good day for a hard battle.":"冠军跑到我修行的地方来了？那今天正适合打一场硬仗。","Hard, and short.":"硬仗，而且很短。","Magnezone loves this cave. All this metal in the rocks.":"自爆磁怪最喜欢这个洞窟了。岩石里全是金属。","Ghosts love the dark at the end of a cave. So do we.":"幽灵最喜欢洞窟深处的黑暗。我们也是。","The ghosts fled. So will we.":"幽灵逃走了。我们也要溜了。","Outside, the fog will feel like home to our Pokémon.":"到了外面，那片雾会让我们的宝可梦像回到家一样。","Two fists, two Trainers, two Pokémon! Hyah!":"两只拳头，两个训练家，两只宝可梦！嘿呀！","Two losses. Hyah...":"两场败仗。嘿呀……","We train in the dark so we can fight blind. It is harder than it sounds.":"我们在黑暗里修行，好练成闭着眼也能打。比听起来难多了。","My birds flew in here and will not fly out. So I battle whoever comes by!":"我的鸟儿飞进来就不肯出去了。所以谁路过我就跟谁打！","Maybe they stay because of Trainers like you.":"也许它们是为了你这样的训练家才留下的。","Murkrow likes shiny things. Watch your Badges.":"黑暗鸦喜欢亮晶晶的东西。看好你的徽章。","Dragons grow up in caves like this one. Mine are nearly grown!":"龙就是在这样的洞窟里长大的。我的龙快长大了！","Nearly is not enough, it seems.":"看来快长大还不够。","One day my Gabite will be a Garchomp. Then we will talk again.":"总有一天我的尖牙陆鲨会变成烈咬陆鲨。到时候再说。","The last Trainer before the sea. Let me be a good memory of this cave.":"出海前的最后一位训练家。让我成为你对这个洞窟的美好回忆吧。","A good memory indeed.":"确实是美好的回忆。","Out there it is Route 224. Mind the fog, and mind the edge of the water.":"外面就是224号道路。小心雾，也小心水边。","I came out here to see the stone, and got lost in the fog. A battle will clear my head!":"我是来看石碑的，结果在雾里迷路了。打一场让我清醒清醒！","My head is clear. My team is not.":"我是清醒了。我的队伍可没有。","Follow the road north. The stone is at the very end.":"沿着路往北走。石碑就在最尽头。","I can see through the fog with my mind. I saw you coming!":"我能用心灵看穿浓雾。我早就看到你来了！","I did not see that, though.":"不过这个我没看到。","Something gentle lives beyond the stone. I can feel it, but I cannot reach it.":"石碑那边住着一个温柔的存在。我感觉得到，却够不着。","I come here every year to read the stone. Every year someone challenges me on the way.":"我每年都来读这块石碑。每年都有人在半路上向我挑战。","And every year I lose. It is a tradition now.":"然后每年都输。现在都成传统了。","The words on the stone are about thanks. Thanks for what, nobody agrees.":"石碑上的字是关于感谢的。至于感谢什么，大家说法不一。","That stone is older than the League! I have been studying it for years!":"那块石碑比联盟还古老！我研究它好多年了！","Years of study, and one battle undoes me.":"研究了这么多年，一场对战就把我打垮了。","My Aerodactyl came out of an old Fossil. Old things are the best things.":"我的化石翼龙是从一块古老的化石里复活的。老东西才是好东西。","The last stretch to the stone. A Dragon Tamer guards it, at least today!":"到石碑的最后一段路。至少今天，由驯龙师来把守！","Go on, then. The stone is all yours.":"去吧。石碑归你了。","Read the stone, then go home. That is how it works out here.":"读完石碑就回家。这里的规矩就是这样。","A great white stone stands at the end of the road. Words are carved into it, worn almost smooth: \"Give thanks to the land, and the land gives back.\"":"路的尽头立着一块巨大的白色石碑。上面刻着几乎被磨平的字：“感谢大地，大地便会回报。”","Now then, {player}. Your Pokédex, if you please.":"那么，{player}，请把你的图鉴给我。","...There. It will record the Pokémon of Sinnoh as well. Many of them evolve in ways you will not have seen before.":"……好了。现在它也能记录神奥的宝可梦了。很多宝可梦的进化方式你恐怕从没见过。","Hi! I am {assistant}, the professor's assistant. I help him by studying Pokémon all over Sinnoh.":"你好！我是博士的助手{assistant}。我在神奥各地研究宝可梦，帮博士的忙。","These are for you. You will need them to catch the Pokémon of Sinnoh!":"这些送给你。要抓神奥的宝可梦，少不了它们！","And I am off! I am going to see everything in Sinnoh before you do, {player}!":"那我先走啦！我要比你先看遍整个神奥，{player}！","North of Sandgem, Route 202 leads to Jubilife City. Once the road is cleared, your journey through Sinnoh begins there.":"真砂镇北边的202号道路通往祝庆市。等道路清理好了，你的神奥之旅就从那里开始。","Sinnoh has Pokémon found nowhere else, and many that evolve in ways seen nowhere else. Study them well.":"神奥有别处见不到的宝可梦，也有很多以别处见不到的方式进化的宝可梦。好好研究吧。","And remember: Pokémon from other regions listen to you only up to the level your Sinnoh badges allow.":"还有，记住：来自其他地区的宝可梦，只会在你的神奥徽章允许的等级以内听你的话。","The ship sails back south to Lilycove City in Hoenn. Would you like to go?":"这艘船会往南开回丰缘的水静市。你要去吗？","The ship sounded its horn and put out to sea.":"船鸣响汽笛，驶向了大海。","The ship sailed south for days and nights...":"船日夜不停地向南航行……","Professor Rowan? He left for Lake Verity early this morning, with his assistant.":"七灶博士？他今天一大早就带着助手去心齐湖了。","Take Route 201 west out of town. The lake is at the far end of the route, past the way down to Twinleaf Town.":"出了镇子往西走201号道路。湖就在道路的尽头，过了往双叶镇的岔路就是。","Oh, and you will be staying in Twinleaf, with Barry's family. The professor arranged it all.":"对了，你会住在双叶镇的阿驯家。博士都安排好了。","The professor says a Pokédex is filled one meeting at a time. Let's both fill ours!":"博士说，图鉴要靠一次次的相遇慢慢填满。我们一起努力吧！","Prof. Rowan":"七灶博士","A tree came down across the road to Jubilife City in last night's storm. We are clearing it as fast as we can!":"昨晚的暴风雨把一棵树刮倒在通往祝庆市的路上了。我们正在尽快清理！","Professor Rowan studies how Pokémon evolve. He looks stern, but nobody in Sinnoh cares more about Pokémon.":"七灶博士在研究宝可梦的进化。他看起来很严肃，但在神奥没有人比他更爱护宝可梦。","The sea south of town is Route 219. The Pokémon that swim out there are a lot tougher than the ones on land.":"镇子南边的海是219号水路。在那里游泳的宝可梦比陆地上的厉害多了。","The PCs in Sinnoh reach the same storage system as everywhere else. Your boxes are right where you left them.":"神奥的电脑也连着同一个存储系统。你的盒子都还在原来的地方。","With the road north closed, the whole town is in here stocking up while we wait.":"北边的路封了，全镇的人都跑来这里囤东西，一边等着通路。","People in Sinnoh say three Pokémon sleep in three lakes. One of them is Lake Verity, just west of here.":"神奥流传着三只宝可梦沉睡在三座湖里的说法。其中一座就是这里西边的心齐湖。","Professor Rowan frowns at everybody. But my Bidoof runs to him every time he walks past!":"七灶博士对谁都板着脸。可是每次他经过，我的大牙狸都会跑到他身边！","Sandgem Town. A town that smells of the sea and the sand.":"真砂镇。飘着海水与沙子气味的小镇。","Research notes: \"Some Pokémon evolve only beside a Trainer they trust. What is it that they feel?\"":"研究笔记：“有些宝可梦只有待在信任的训练家身边才会进化。它们感受到的究竟是什么？”","{player}! Cynthia was here, and she has told me all of it. A world behind our own, and you walked through it.":"{player}！竹兰来过了，全都告诉我了。我们世界背后的世界，你竟然走了一趟。","In all my years I never thought to see the old stories proved. I shall be writing about this for the rest of my life.":"我这一辈子都没想到能看到古老的传说得到证实。这件事够我写到老了。","Team Galactic is finished, and the quakes around Mt. Coronet have stopped. I have told them to open the road east of Valor Lakefront again.":"银河队已经完了，天冠山一带的地震也停了。我已经请他们重新开放立志湖畔东边的路。","Sunyshore City lies at the end of it, and with it the last Gym in Sinnoh. Go on, then. There is still a journey to finish.":"路的尽头是滨海市，那里有神奥最后一个道馆。去吧。你的旅程还没有结束。","Hm! The Champion of Sinnoh, in my lab. Let me have a look at that Pokédex of yours.":"嗯！神奥的冠军来我的研究所了。让我看看你的图鉴。","As I thought. Pokémon from Kanto to Sinnoh, all in one little machine. It has outgrown any one region.":"果然。从关都到神奥的宝可梦，全在这台小机器里。一个地区已经装不下它了。","{player}'s Pokédex was upgraded to the National Pokédex! It now lists every Pokémon known.":"{player}的图鉴升级成了全国图鉴！现在所有已知的宝可梦都会列出来。","Now listen. {uxie}, {mesprit} and {azelf} have gone home to their lakes, and each has a cave there. Lake Valor's you can walk to. For the other two you will have to Surf.":"听好。{uxie}、{mesprit}和{azelf}都回到了各自的湖，每个湖都有一个洞穴。立志湖的走路就能到，另外两个要用冲浪。","And the elder of Celestic Town has been asking for you. Something to do with the Spear Pillar. Do not keep her waiting.":"还有，神和镇的长老一直在找你，好像和枪之柱有关。别让她等太久。","{player}! Do you remember Jubilife City, when those two grunts would not leave me alone? We battled them side by side.":"{player}！你还记得在祝庆市，那两个手下一直缠着我不放的时候吗？我们并肩打败了他们。","Since then you have battled beside so many people, and you became the Champion. I am proud I was your first partner!":"从那以后，你和好多人并肩作战过，还成为了冠军。我很骄傲自己是你第一个并肩作战的伙伴！","One thing more. A Pokédex that has outgrown Sinnoh deserves a better way to fill it. Take this.":"还有一件事。一本已经超出神奥范围的图鉴，值得用更好的方法来填满。收下这个吧。","Stand in tall grass and switch it on, and the grass around you will shake. Walk into a shaking patch and a Pokémon will be there.":"站在高草丛里打开它，周围的草丛就会摇晃。走进摇晃的草丛，就会有宝可梦在那里等着。","Beat it or catch it, and new patches shake. Keep meeting the same kind and the chain grows. Some say a long chain turns up Pokémon of unusual colors.":"打倒或抓住它之后，又会有别的草丛摇晃。一直遇到同一种宝可梦，连锁就会越来越长。听说连锁够长，就会遇到颜色与众不同的宝可梦。","Its battery charges as you walk: fifty steps between uses. Run away, or wander off, and the chain is broken.":"电池会在你走路时充电：每用一次要走五十步。逃跑或走远了，连锁就会中断。","Is that all? You talk a lot for somebody so easy to beat.":"就这点本事？这么容易就输了，话倒是挺多。","Oh, it is you. I remember you from our building in Eterna. You have come all this way for nothing.":"哦，是你啊。我记得你，在百代市我们的大楼里见过。你白跑这一趟了。","Uxie is already ours, the last of the three. Our boss will be very pleased.":"由克希已经是我们的了，三只之中的最后一只。老大一定会很满意。","If you want to complain, you know where Veilstone is. I would not bother, if I were you.":"想抱怨的话，你知道帷幕市在哪里。换作是我，就不会白费力气。","Team Galactic left Lake Acuity, and took Uxie with them.":"银河队离开了睿智湖，把由克希也带走了。","I could not wait for you, so I climbed the slope the hard way and ran straight into her.":"我等不及你，就硬是爬上了坡，结果正好撞上她。","And I lost. I said I would protect this lake, and I lost.":"然后我输了。我说过要保护这座湖，却输了。","I am not strong enough yet. I am going away to train, {player}. Next time I see that Commander, I will win!":"我还不够强。{player}，我要去修行了。下次再见到那个干部，我一定会赢！","When you focus with your whole heart, even a blizzard feels warm. Now go and see what is going on at the lake!":"只要全心全意地集中精神，连暴风雪都会觉得温暖。快去看看湖那边发生了什么吧！","A clear mind can copy any good idea. That is all Psych Up is.":"头脑清醒，就能学来任何好主意。自我暗示就是这么回事。","I came here to clear my mind, and I have found that I do not need this any more. Take it.":"我来这里是为了让头脑清醒，现在发现已经用不上这个了。你拿去吧。","TM77 is Psych Up. It copies every stat change the foe has made.":"招式学习器77是自我暗示。它能复制对手所有的能力变化。","You look frozen, dear! Sit by the fire for a while.":"孩子，你都冻僵了！来炉火边坐一会儿吧。","There, all warm again. Come back whenever the cold gets to you.":"好了，又暖和起来了。觉得冷的时候随时回来。","There you are, {player}! Took you long enough! Look at this slope: Lake Acuity is right up there!":"{player}，你总算来了！太慢了！看这道坡，睿智湖就在上面！","But the people around here say nobody gets up without the badge from the Snowpoint Gym. The town is just east of here.":"可是这里的人说，没有雪峰市道馆的徽章就上不去。雪峰市就在东边。","So go and win it! I will keep watch here. Nobody gets past me!":"所以快去赢下来吧！我在这里守着，谁也别想过去！","The Gym is just east of here! Go on, I will keep watch on the slope.":"道馆就在东边！快去，这道坡我来守着。","Hey there, future Champion! Candice uses Ice Pokémon, and her Gym is all ice.":"嗨，未来的冠军！小菘使用冰属性宝可梦，她的道馆也全是冰。","On the ice you slide until something stops you. Use the rocks to stop in the right place.":"在冰上会一直滑，直到被什么东西挡住。利用岩石停在正确的位置吧。","Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel moves are what you want. Her Froslass is part Ghost, though, so Normal and Fighting moves do nothing to it.":"火、格斗、岩石和钢属性的招式最有效。不过她的雪妖女也是幽灵属性，一般和格斗招式对它没用。","Up to level 60, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"在这里，你从家乡带来的宝可梦在60级以下都会听你的话。","What focus! The Icicle Badge is yours.":"好专注！冰柱徽章是你的了。","{player} received the Icicle Badge from Candice!":"{player}从小菘那里得到了冰柱徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 70 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，70级以下的宝可梦在神奥都会听你的话，就算来自其他地区也一样。","And take TM72, Avalanche. It hits twice as hard when the foe has already hurt the user that turn!":"再收下招式学习器72，雪崩。如果这回合已经被对手打伤，威力就会加倍！","With that badge you can go up the slope to Lake Acuity. People say they have seen strange grey uniforms up there.":"有了这枚徽章，你就能爬上坡去睿智湖了。听说有人在那里看到了奇怪的灰色制服。","Katherine":"凯瑟琳","My Noctowl sees everything on this road, day or night!":"我的猫头夜鹰不分昼夜，这条路上什么都看得见！","The birds here will not fly over the mountain. It is too high, even for them.":"这里的鸟不会飞过那座山。对它们来说也太高了。","Nick":"尼克","You did not see me! That is the whole point of being a ninja!":"你没看见我吧！这就是忍者的意义！","Poison is the ninja way. Nobody sees it coming.":"毒就是忍者之道。谁也防不住。","Sean":"肖恩","I climb this road every morning. It builds strong legs!":"我每天早上都爬这条路。腿都练结实了！","My legs were fine. It was the rest of me.":"腿倒是没问题。问题出在其他地方。","The cold on the far side of the mountain is good training, too.":"山那一边的严寒也是很好的修行。","Bronzor were found in old tombs. I want to know why!":"有人在古墓里发现过铜镜怪。我想知道为什么！","History repeats itself. So do my losses.":"历史会重演，我的失败也会。","The ruins in Celestic Town are the oldest I have ever seen.":"神和镇的遗迹是我见过最古老的。","Bradley":"布拉德利","Fresh snow, and nobody on the slope but me!":"新雪！整条雪道都是我的！","I hit a tree. A very strong tree.":"我撞到树了。一棵很强的树。","All three of my Pokémon love the hail. Yours? Not so much.":"我的三只宝可梦都喜欢冰雹。你的嘛，就不一定了。","Kaitlyn":"凯特琳","I can ski and battle at the same time. Watch!":"我能一边滑雪一边对战。看好了！","Maybe not at the same time.":"看来还是不能同时做。","Snover grow tall on the snowfields around here.":"雪笠怪在这一带的雪原上长得很高。","Philip":"菲利普","I train in the snow with bare feet. Feel my spirit!":"我光着脚在雪地里修行。感受我的斗志吧！","My spirit is fine. My feet are not.":"斗志还在，脚不行了。","There is a lodge to the west, if you are cold. I am not. Not at all.":"觉得冷的话，西边有间小屋。我可不冷。一点也不。","Blake":"布莱克","Only strong Trainers come this far north. Let us see about you.":"只有强大的训练家才会来到这么北边。让我看看你的实力。","The Gym in Snowpoint is no easier than this road.":"雪峰市的道馆可不比这条路轻松。","My Tropius came from somewhere warm. It has grown tough here!":"我的热带龙来自温暖的地方。在这里它变得很坚强！","It will want some fruit after that.":"这下它要吃点水果了。","Tropius has never once complained about the snow.":"热带龙从来没有抱怨过下雪。","Garrett":"加勒特","A team with no weak point. Go on, try and find one!":"一支没有弱点的队伍。来吧，试着找找看！","You found three.":"你找到了三个。","North of here the snow gets so thick you can hardly see.":"再往北，雪大得几乎看不见路。","Fire, water and rock, right here in the snow. Ready?":"火、水和岩石，就在这片雪地上。准备好了吗？","You were ready.":"看来你准备得很充分。","A balanced team is the best way to get through the north.":"想穿过北方，最好带一支均衡的队伍。","Three Snover! I named them Left, Right and Down the Hill!":"三只雪笠怪！我给它们取名叫左转、右转和冲下山！","All three went down the hill.":"三只都冲下山了。","On a good day you can ski from here all the way to the lake.":"天气好的时候，可以从这里一路滑到湖边。","Lexie":"莱克西","This is my mountain. Lost in the snow? Too bad!":"这是我的地盘。在雪里迷路了？真可惜！","Glaceon can freeze the air around it. It is the perfect friend for a long winter.":"冰伊布能把周围的空气冻住。漫长的冬天有它陪伴最好不过了。","Bjorn":"比约恩","Nobody comes up here! Finally, somebody to battle!":"这里从来没人来！终于有对手了！","I should have asked you to wait a bit.":"早知道就让你等一下了。","Snowpoint City is just past the lakefront. You are nearly there.":"过了睿智湖畔就是雪峰市。你快到了。","Snowpoint Temple lies beyond this point. It is older than the town, and only the Gym Leader may go inside.":"再往前就是雪峰神殿。它比这座城市还古老，只有道馆馆主才能进去。","Our Gym Leader is the coolest person in Sinnoh. Get it? Coolest?":"我们的馆主是神奥最酷的人。酷……懂了吗？很冷的那种酷！","Up the slope from the lakefront there is a lake. Nobody goes up without the Gym badge.":"湖畔的坡上面有一座湖。没有道馆徽章的人是上不去的。","In hail, every Pokémon that is not an Ice type loses a little HP each turn. Ice types do not mind it at all!":"下冰雹时，除了冰属性以外的宝可梦每回合都会损失一点HP。冰属性完全不在乎！","Ice Heal is the best seller up here, for some reason.":"不知为什么，这里卖得最好的是解冻药。","Ships from here go to a far island, but only for the very strongest Trainers.":"从这里有船开往遥远的小岛，不过只载最强的训练家。","My grandchildren have never seen the ground in this town. Only snow.":"我的孙子们从没见过这座城市的地面，只见过雪。","Sergio":"塞尔吉奥","Sliding on the ice is the easy part. Now try me!":"在冰上滑还算简单。现在来试试我吧！","I slipped up.":"我滑倒了。","Rocks stop you on the ice. Look for the one you need before you move.":"岩石能让你在冰上停下来。动之前先找好需要的那块。","Brenna":"布伦娜","Candice told me to focus, so I am focusing on you!":"小菘叫我集中精神，所以我要集中对付你！","I lost my focus.":"我分心了。","Every morning we all polish the ice for Candice.":"每天早上，我们都要帮小菘把冰打磨一遍。","My Sneasel are quick on the ice. Can you keep up?":"我的狃拉在冰上很快。你跟得上吗？","You kept up.":"你跟上了。","If you fall back down, just climb up again. Nobody stays stuck here.":"滑回去了就再上来。在这里没有人会被困住。","Savannah":"萨凡纳","Snorunt, Snorunt and Glalie: my frozen family!":"雪童子、雪童子和冰鬼护：我的冰冻一家人！","The family has melted.":"一家人都融化了。","Snorunt live in caves full of snow. They are shy, but mine are not.":"雪童子住在积满雪的洞窟里。它们很怕生，不过我的不会。","You crossed all the ice. But Candice is behind me!":"你穿过了所有的冰。但小菘就在我身后！","My tusks were not enough.":"我的獠牙还不够。","Candice is ready for you. Good luck!":"小菘已经准备好了。祝你好运！","Anton":"安东","Glalie froze a whole lake once. Well, a pond. A puddle!":"冰鬼护曾经冻住一整座湖。呃，一个池塘。一个水坑！","Not even a puddle.":"连水坑都没冻住。","Ice is weak to Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel, but it hits Grass, Ground, Flying and Dragon hard.":"冰怕火、格斗、岩石和钢，但对草、地面、飞行和龙很有效。","Welcome to the coldest Gym in Sinnoh! I am Candice. I put my whole heart into everything: the ice, my Pokémon, even my scarf! Focus, now. Here we go!":"欢迎来到神奥最冷的道馆！我是小菘。无论是冰、宝可梦，还是我的围巾，我都全心投入！集中精神，我们开始吧！","Wow! You kept your head the whole way through!":"哇！你从头到尾都没有乱了阵脚！","Route 211. West: Mt. Coronet. East: Celestic Town.":"211号道路。西：天冠山。东：神和镇。","Route 216. West, then north: Route 217. Hail is falling, so take care in battle!":"216号道路。往西再往北：217号道路。正在下冰雹，对战时请小心！","A lodge for travellers. Come in and get warm!":"旅人小屋。请进来暖暖身子！","Route 217. North: Acuity Lakefront. South: Route 216.":"217号道路。北：睿智湖畔。南：216号道路。","North: Lake Acuity. East: Snowpoint City.":"北：睿智湖。东：雪峰市。","Lake Acuity. Its waters are said to be the home of a spirit of knowledge.":"睿智湖。传说湖水中住着知识的精灵。","Snowpoint City. The town where the snow never melts.":"雪峰市。积雪永不融化的城市。","Snowpoint City Gym. Leader: Candice, who never lets the cold win.":"雪峰市道馆。馆主：绝不输给严寒的小菘。","North: Snowpoint Temple. No entry.":"北：雪峰神殿。禁止进入。","Ahoy, Champion! Shall I take you to the Battle Zone?":"喂，冠军！要我送你去对战特区吗？","The ship sailed out across the northern sea...":"船驶入了北方的海……","This ship goes to the Battle Zone, and only Trainers who have beaten the Pokémon League may board.":"这条船开往对战特区，只有打败过宝可梦联盟的训练家才能上船。","Snowpoint Harbor. The ship sails to the Battle Zone.":"雪峰市港口。此船开往对战特区。","Candice told me a Trainer filling in the National Pokédex may enter the temple. Every floor below is ice, so mind your step.":"小菘说过，在完成全国图鉴的训练家可以进神殿。下面每一层都是冰，走路小心点。","Summer":"萨默","The river here is so pretty. Battling beside it is even better!":"这里的河好漂亮。在河边对战就更棒了！","At least the view is nice.":"至少风景很美。","Marill float on the river like little balloons. So cute!":"玛力露像小气球一样漂在河上。好可爱！","Nothing is biting today. You will have to do!":"今天一条鱼都没上钩。只好拿你凑数了！","Still nothing biting...":"还是没有鱼上钩……","The best fishing spot is under the bridge. Do not tell anyone.":"最好的钓点在桥下。别告诉别人哦。","Terry":"泰瑞","I am camping my way to Solaceon. Battle me on the road!":"我一路露营前往随意镇。在路上和我对战吧！","Back to walking, then.":"那就继续赶路吧。","Solaceon has a Day Care. You can leave a Pokémon there while you travel.":"随意镇有培育屋。旅行的时候可以把宝可梦寄放在那里。","My Pokémon are the cutest in Sinnoh. Let me show you!":"我的宝可梦是神奥最可爱的。让你见识一下！","Cute and strong are not the same thing...":"可爱和强大不是一回事啊……","Did you know Clefairy dance under the full moon on Mt. Coronet?":"你知道吗？皮皮会在天冠山的满月下跳舞哦。","Strange letter Pokémon float around inside the ruins. Every one of them has a different shape!":"遗迹里飘着奇怪的文字宝可梦。每一只的形状都不一样！","Life here is slow and peaceful. That is just how we like it in Solaceon.":"这里的生活悠闲又平静。我们随意镇的人就喜欢这样。","Veilstone City is east of Route 210. Its Gym Leader, Maylene, fights with her own fists... and Fighting-type Pokémon!":"帷幕市在210号道路的东边。那里的道馆馆主阿李用自己的拳头战斗……还有格斗属性的宝可梦！","It rains all the time on Route 215. Fire moves are weaker in the rain, you know.":"215号道路一直在下雨。下雨的时候，火属性招式会变弱哦。","Grandpa says the ruins are older than any town in Sinnoh. Nobody knows who carved those letters.":"爷爷说，那座遗迹比神奥任何一个城镇都古老。谁也不知道那些文字是谁刻的。","Every life began from one, and every thread still leads back to it.":"一切生命皆源于一，每一条线都仍通往那里。","A crowd of Psyduck is holding its heads and blocking the path. They will not budge.":"一群可达鸭抱着头，把路堵住了。它们一动也不动。","Joel":"乔尔","I bent a spoon this morning. Now I will bend your will!":"我今天早上弄弯了一把汤匙。现在轮到你的意志了！","My spoon is straight again...":"我的汤匙又变直了……","Those Psyduck up north have terrible headaches. Something must be bothering them.":"北边那些可达鸭头痛得厉害。一定有什么东西在困扰它们。","A Champion of three regions? I have been waiting for someone like you!":"三个地区的冠军？我一直在等你这样的人！","Maylene in Veilstone is strong. Bring Flying or Psychic moves.":"帷幕市的阿李很强。带上飞行或超能力属性的招式吧。","This route is all grass and hills. Perfect for training!":"这条路上全是草地和山丘。最适合训练了！","More training needed.":"还得多加训练。","East of here is Route 215. Bring an umbrella. It never stops raining.":"往东是215号道路。带把伞吧，那里的雨从来不停。","Route 209. North: Solaceon Town. West: Hearthome City.":"209号道路。北：随意镇　西：家缘市","Solaceon Town. A quiet town where people and Pokémon live at an easy pace.":"随意镇。人与宝可梦悠闲生活的宁静小镇。","Solaceon Ruins. Please do not touch the carvings.":"随意遗迹。请勿触摸石刻。","A note on the shelf: \"Our cousins run the Day Care on Route 34 in Johto. A Pokémon left with one of us can be picked up at either!\"":"架子上的字条：“我们的表亲在城都的34号道路经营培育屋。寄放在任何一边的宝可梦，在两边都能领回！”","Letters are carved all over the wall. Together they seem to say: \"Every life began from one, and every thread still leads back to it.\"":"墙上刻满了文字。连起来似乎在说：“一切生命皆源于一，每一条线都仍通往那里。”","Route 210. South: Solaceon Town. East: Route 215 and Veilstone City.":"210号道路。南：随意镇　东：215号道路、帷幕市","Give them the {item}?":"要给它们{item}吗？","The Psyduck stopped holding their heads and waddled away, quacking happily!":"可达鸭们不再抱着头，开心地嘎嘎叫着摇摇摆摆走了！","You cured them! Thank you, {player}. The road north is open again.":"你治好它们了！谢谢你，{player}。往北的路又通了。","Could I ask one more favor? This Old Charm belongs to my grandmother, the elder of Celestic Town, past the fog to the west.":"能再拜托你一件事吗？这个古代护符是我奶奶的。她是神和镇的长老，穿过雾往西走就到了。","I hear Team Galactic has been seen near the ruins there. Please be careful.":"听说有人在那里的遗迹附近看到了银河队。请多加小心。","My Snorlax only ever left Snorlax Eggs here. Then I let it hold a Full Incense, and out came a Munchlax! Some Pokémon lay their baby only when one of the pair holds the right incense.":"我的卡比兽在这里只会生下卡比兽的蛋。后来我让它带着饱腹薰香，结果孵出了小卡比兽！有些宝可梦要两只之中有一只带着对的薰香，才会生下幼年宝可梦。","Graham":"格雷厄姆","Geneva":"吉内瓦","Stanley":"斯坦利","Mikayla":"米凯拉","Griffin":"格里芬","Felicia":"费利西娅","Saul":"索尔","Darien":"达里恩","Keenan & Kassandra":"基南和卡桑德拉","Skylar & Natasha":"斯凯勒和娜塔莎","Chelsey & Sterling":"切尔西和斯特林","Krystal & Ray":"克丽丝托和雷","Stefan & Jasmin":"斯特凡和贾丝明","Drake & Jarrett":"德雷克和贾勒特","Abel & Monique":"亚伯和莫妮克","Harlan & Kenny":"哈兰和肯尼","Hey! I know you, you are the Champion! My big brother Flint told me all about you. I am Buck.":"嘿！我认识你，你就是冠军！我哥哥大叶跟我讲过你的事。我叫麦可。","This mountain is where I train. But people in Team Galactic uniforms came through here, and they went straight for the deepest room.":"我一直在这座山里修行。可是有穿银河队制服的人从这里经过，直奔最深处的房间去了。","Nobody messes with my mountain! I am going after them, and you are coming too.":"谁也别想在我的山上乱来！我要去追他们，你也一起来。","The Trainers in here like to fight in pairs, so we will fight as a pair as well. And after each battle I will see to your team.":"这里的训练家喜欢两人一组，所以我们也搭档上阵。每打完一场，我都会替你照顾队伍。","Stay close! This mountain is hot, but my Claydol does not mind, and neither do I.":"跟紧我！这座山很热，不过我的念力土偶不在乎，我也不在乎。","Buck's Claydol looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"麦可的念力土偶照顾了你的宝可梦。它们完全恢复了！","Oh, it is you again. Do you ever stop following Team Galactic around?":"哦，又是你。你就不能别再跟着银河队了吗？","We only came to see what Charon has been doing with the name of our team.":"我们只是来看看，冥王拿我们队的名字干了些什么。","Hey! This is my mountain! Whatever you are up to down here, it stops now!":"喂！这是我的山！不管你们在这里搞什么，到此为止！","A friend of yours? Then two against two. We have been bored since the Spear Pillar.":"你的朋友？那就二对二吧。自从枪之柱之后，我们一直闲得发慌。","Wait, let me see to your team first. Right, {player}, together!":"等等，先让我照顾一下你的队伍。好，{player}，一起上！","Beaten again. Funny, I do not even mind this time.":"又输了。真奇怪，这次我一点也不在意。","Cyrus wanted a whole new world. Charon only wants money. That is not what we signed up for.":"赤日想要的是一个全新的世界，冥王想要的只有钱。我们不是为了这个才加入的。","We are done. As of now, we have left Team Galactic.":"我们不干了。从现在起，我们退出银河队。","Goodbye, Trainer. Try not to get burned.":"再见了，训练家。小心别被烧着。","Fools! Who needs them? Look at this, children. The Magma Stone, the seal of this mountain!":"蠢货！谁稀罕她们？孩子们，看看这个。火山镇石，这座山的封印！","With it I shall wake what sleeps below, and the people of Sinnoh will pay anything to make the volcano sleep again!":"我要用它唤醒沉睡在下面的东西，到时候神奥的人为了让火山重新睡去，花多少钱都愿意！","Excuse me, sir. One small question.":"打扰一下，长官。有个小问题。","What is it now? Can you not see I am gloating?":"又怎么了？没看到我正在得意吗？","Do you have the right to carry that stone? No? Then you are under arrest!":"你有资格拿着那块石头吗？没有？那你被捕了！","You! You have been carrying my bags for a month!":"你！你帮我提了一个月的行李！","And they were very heavy. Looker of the International Police, at your service. A fine disguise, no?":"而且还很重。国际警察帅哥，为您效劳。这身伪装不错吧？","Officers, take him away. And his friend.":"警官们，把他带走。还有他的同伙。","He dropped it! So this is the Magma Stone. It is warm, and...":"他把它掉在这儿了！这就是火山镇石啊。热乎乎的，而且……","The whole room shook! Far below, something answered.":"整个房间都在摇晃！在很深的地下，有什么回应了。","Whoa! I do not think it likes being moved! I am taking this to my grandfather, he will know what to do.":"哇！看来它不喜欢被人挪动！我把它拿去给爷爷，他肯定知道该怎么办。","Thanks for everything, {player}. Come and find me at home in the Survival Area!":"谢谢你的帮忙，{player}。到生存区的我家来找我吧！","Team Galactic is finished, my friend, and you helped to finish it. Now, the paperwork. There is always paperwork.":"银河队完了，我的朋友，这也有你的功劳。接下来是写报告。永远都有写不完的报告。","The mountain is quiet again, but something is awake down there. Be careful, {player}.":"山又安静下来了，但是下面有什么东西醒了。小心点，{player}。","{player}! You made it. I showed the stone to Grandfather, and he went white.":"{player}！你来了。我把石头拿给爷爷看，他脸都白了。","He says it holds down the heart of the mountain. So I ran all the way back and put it where it was.":"他说这块石头镇着山的心脏。所以我一路跑回去，把它放回了原处。","The shaking stopped. But I felt something looking at me from the lava, in the deepest room. Something huge.":"摇晃停了。可是在最深处的房间，我感觉有什么东西从岩浆里看着我。是个很大的东西。","If anyone can face it, you can. Go and see!":"要是有人能面对它，那就是你了。去看看吧！","Where the Magma Stone rests, {mon} rises from the lava. The air burns around it.":"在火山镇石安放的地方，{mon}从岩浆中升起。周围的空气都在燃烧。","{mon} sank back into the lava. It may rise again.":"{mon}又沉回了岩浆里。它也许还会再升起来。","Stark Mountain breathed out, and the rumbling stopped at last.":"严酷山长长地吐了一口气，轰鸣声终于停了。","See the smoke up north? That is Stark Mountain. People say it has not slept in a long time.":"看到北边的烟了吗？那就是严酷山。听说它已经很久没有安睡了。","The wind off the sea keeps me sharp. Let us see how sharp you are.":"海风让我保持敏锐。让我看看你有多敏锐。","Not sharp enough, it seems.":"看来还不够敏锐。","Past this beach it is the sea, and after the sea, the volcano.":"过了这片沙滩就是海，过了海就是火山。","My birds can see a Trainer coming from the other shore.":"我的鸟儿在对岸就能看见训练家走过来。","Nothing flies over the volcano for long. The air is too hot.":"什么都没法在火山上空飞太久。空气太烫了。","Only a Dragon Tamer comes this far out. So what are you?":"只有驯龙师才会走到这么远。那你是什么人？","A Champion. I should have asked first.":"是冠军啊。我该先问一声的。","The dragons on Stark Mountain do not like visitors.":"严酷山的龙不喜欢客人。","I swim here every day. The current is the only thing that ever beats me.":"我每天都在这里游泳。能赢我的只有海流。","Well, now there are two things.":"好吧，现在多了一个。","There is a little island out here. Nobody ever goes there.":"这片海上有个小岛。从来没人去。","These waters are mine! Any swimmer who comes through has to battle me!":"这片海是我的！游过这里的都得跟我打一场！","Ow! I should have let you through!":"哎哟！早知道就让你过去了！","The far shore is close. Follow the road north from there.":"对岸不远了。上岸后沿着路往北走。","Ash in my hair, ash in my shoes. I am in a bad mood, so battle me.":"头发里是灰，鞋子里也是灰。我心情很差，来打一场吧。","Now I have ash in my pride.":"现在连自尊心都落满灰了。","The ash falls every day. You stop noticing, more or less.":"火山灰每天都在落。久了也就不太在意了。","I walk this road barefoot, for the heat! Hyah!":"我光着脚走这条路，就为了感受热度！嘿呀！","My feet are fine. My pride is burned.":"脚没事。烧伤的是我的自尊心。","Do not step off the rock. That is not water down there.":"别踩到岩石外面去。下面那可不是水。","A ranger watches this road for rockfalls, lava and lost Trainers. Which are you?":"巡护员要看着这条路上的落石、岩浆和迷路的训练家。你是哪一种？","Not lost at all. My mistake.":"一点也没迷路。是我看错了。","People in uniform went up the mountain last week. They did not say why.":"上周有穿制服的人上山去了。他们没说要干什么。","One Pokémon. One battle. That is all I ever need.":"一只宝可梦，一场对战。我只需要这些。","One was not enough.":"一只还不够。","Stark Mountain is just ahead. It is hotter inside than you think.":"严酷山就在前面。里面比你想的还要热。","My Dragonite and I keep watch on this slope. Nobody gets up here by accident.":"我和我的快龙守着这片山坡。没人会碰巧走到这里。","Then you came on purpose. Good.":"那你是特意来的。很好。","If you are going in, take Full Heals. And respect the mountain.":"要进去的话，带上万灵药。还有，要敬畏这座山。","Two of us, and this heat. Whoever you are, you picked a bad day!":"我们两个人，再加上这股热气。不管你是谁，你挑错日子了！","It was a bad day for us instead!":"挑错日子的是我们！","With Buck beside you? No wonder.":"有麦可在你身边？难怪。","We came here to train as a pair. You two will do nicely!":"我们是来练搭档的。你们两个正合适！","You two work well together.":"你们配合得真好。","Buck comes here every day. He knows this place better than anyone.":"麦可每天都来这里。这地方他最熟了。","We saw this battle in our minds. We saw ourselves winning.":"我们在脑海里看见了这场对战。看见的是我们赢了。","Our minds must have been a little hot.":"大概是脑袋被烤热了。","Something sleeps under this mountain. We can feel it dreaming.":"这座山下睡着什么东西。我们能感觉到它在做梦。","Wings and fists! Nothing gets past both!":"翅膀加拳头！谁也过不了我们两关！","You got past both.":"你两关都过了。","Strange people in uniforms walked past here. Not even a hello.":"有一群穿制服的怪人从这里走过去。连个招呼都不打。","This is as far as most Trainers get.":"大多数训练家只能走到这里。","But not you.":"但你不是。","Keep going. It only gets hotter.":"继续走吧。只会越来越热。","A dragon and a fighter. We cover each other's weak points!":"龙和格斗家。我们互相弥补弱点！","You found them anyway!":"你还是找到了！","The way on is blocked by cracked rock. Break it, if you can.":"前面的路被裂开的岩石堵住了。有本事就打碎它。","Ice in a volcano? Yes. That is how tough we are.":"火山里用冰系？没错。我们就是这么硬气。","It melted.":"化了。","The people in uniforms went through the last door. Watch out.":"那些穿制服的人走进最后那道门了。小心点。","I have seen Trainers come and go from this mountain for forty years.":"四十年来，我看着训练家在这座山里来来去去。","And there you go.":"你也要走了。","Go on, then. Whatever is at the bottom of this mountain, it has been waiting for a long time.":"去吧。不管这座山的最深处有什么，它已经等了很久了。","Route 226. East: the sea. Beyond it, the road to Stark Mountain.":"226号水路。东：大海。海的那边是通往严酷山的路。","Route 227. North: Stark Mountain. Mind the ash.":"227号道路。北：严酷山。小心火山灰。","And Grandfather's Battleground is open to you now. The Gym Leaders come there to battle, and some days so do I!":"爷爷的对决场现在也向你开放了。道馆馆主们会去那里对战，有些日子我也会去！","Route 226. North: Route 227 to Stark Mountain. South: Route 228. West: the sea and the Survival Area.":"226号水路。北：227号道路通往严酷山。南：228号道路。西：大海和生存区。","Elite Four Flint":"四天王大叶","Brett":"布雷特","Alec":"亚历克","Nicola":"妮可拉","Trey":"特雷","Luther":"路德","Thomas":"托马斯","Conner":"康纳","Holly":"霍莉","Janet":"珍妮特","Tiera":"蒂埃拉","Forrest":"福雷斯特","Jerry":"杰瑞","Meghan":"梅根","Lonnie":"朗尼","Zachery":"扎卡里","Route 222. West: Valor Lakefront. East: Sunyshore City.":"222号道路。西：立志湖畔。东：滨海市。","Sunyshore City ahead. The city that runs on the light of the sun.":"前方是滨海市。靠太阳光运转的城市。","A level 43 Magikarp! Yes, I know. I have been fishing a long time.":"43级的鲤鱼王！没错，我钓了很久的鱼。","It splashed very well.":"它跃得很好。","The sea here is the best in Sinnoh. Everybody who fishes says so.":"这里的海是神奥最好的。钓鱼的人都这么说。","One Gyarados is all a real fisherman needs!":"真正的钓鱼人只需要一只暴鲤龙！","Maybe two would be better.":"也许两只更好。","I started with a Magikarp too. Everybody does.":"我也是从鲤鱼王开始的。大家都一样。","Everything I caught today is in this battle!":"今天钓到的全都上场了！","Now I have to catch them all again.":"这下又要重新钓了。","The fish do not care who wins.":"鱼才不管谁赢。","You scared off a bite! You will pay for that!":"你吓跑了上钩的鱼！你要付出代价！","I think I scared it off myself.":"好像是我自己吓跑的。","Patience is the whole of fishing. I am working on it.":"钓鱼全靠耐心。我还在练。","My Lopunny and I walk this road every day to stay beautiful.":"我和长耳兔每天都走这条路，保持美丽。","At least we still look good.":"至少我们还是很好看。","The sea air does wonders for fur.":"海风对毛发特别好。","My Luxray cost more than your whole team, I expect. Shall we see?":"我的伦琴猫比你整支队伍都贵吧。要试试吗？","I shall have to buy a better one.":"看来得买一只更好的。","Money cannot buy everything, Father says. He says it from his yacht.":"父亲说，钱买不到一切。他是在自己的游艇上说的。","I just came ashore, and I have not had a good fight in weeks!":"我刚上岸，已经好几周没好好打一场了！","That was worth the wait.":"这一场值得等。","Ships from Sunyshore sail all over the world.":"从滨海市出发的船开往世界各地。","This road was closed until today. Let me check that you are up to it.":"这条路今天才开放。让我看看你够不够格。","You may pass. Drive safely. Or walk safely.":"可以通过了。注意行车安全。或者走路安全。","I heard a rumor that a great detective passed through here. Nobody saw him.":"听说有个大侦探从这里经过。谁也没看见他。","My Mantyke rode on my ship all the way from the far side of the sea!":"我的小球飞鱼坐着我的船，从大海那头一路过来！","It is still only little.":"它还小呢。","It will be a Mantine one day, when there is a Remoraid around.":"等身边有铁炮鱼的时候，它总有一天会变成巨翅飞鱼。","I can swim as far as this ring lets me!":"这个泳圈能漂多远，我就能游多远！","The ring is losing air.":"泳圈漏气了。","Do not tell my mum I came out this far.":"别告诉我妈我游到这么远。","My Remoraid squirts better than anybody's!":"我的铁炮鱼喷水喷得比谁都好！","It got water in my eyes.":"水进眼睛里了。","I am going to swim to Sunyshore. One day.":"总有一天我要游到滨海市。","Welcome to the Pikachu Fan Club! We meet every day, and we talk about Pikachu. That is the whole club.":"欢迎来到皮卡丘粉丝俱乐部！我们每天聚会，聊皮卡丘。俱乐部就这么点事。","One Pikachu is cute. Two Pikachu is twice as cute!":"一只皮卡丘很可爱。两只皮卡丘就加倍可爱！","They are still cute.":"它们还是很可爱。","Do you like Pikachu? You have to say yes in here.":"你喜欢皮卡丘吗？在这里你只能说喜欢。","Sunyshore City. The city that runs on the light of the sun.":"滨海市。靠太阳光运转的城市。","Sunyshore Market, to the south. The beach is to the north.":"南边是滨海市场。北边是海滩。","Sunyshore City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Volkner. The shining star that lights the way.":"滨海市宝可梦道馆。馆主：电次。照亮道路的闪耀之星。","Vista Lighthouse. On a clear day you can see the Pokémon League from the top.":"瞭望灯塔。天气晴朗时，从塔顶能看到宝可梦联盟。","Our streets and rooftops are covered in solar panels. The whole city runs on sunshine.":"我们的街道和屋顶都铺满了太阳能板。整座城市都靠阳光运转。","Volkner used to battle everybody who came. These days the lighthouse sees more of him than the Gym.":"电次以前来者不拒。现在他待在灯塔的时间比在道馆还多。","Past this water lies Route 223, and at the end of it the Pokémon League. It is a long way, and the current is strong.":"这片水的那边是223号道路，尽头就是宝可梦联盟。路很远，水流也很急。","Volkner's Gym is the last one in Sinnoh. If you can beat him, the League is the only thing left.":"电次的道馆是神奥最后一个。赢了他，就只剩下联盟了。","Paralyze Heal sells very well here. I wonder why.":"解麻药在这里卖得特别好。不知道为什么。","Welcome to the Sunyshore Market! The stalls are shut today. Everybody has gone to look at the sea.":"欢迎来到滨海市场！今天摊位都关了。大家都去看海了。","When I was young, you could see every star from here. Then we lit up the city, and now the stars are in the streets.":"我年轻的时候，在这里能看到满天星星。后来城市亮起来了，星星就跑到街上去了。","The lift goes to the top. Volkner is up there. He comes here to look at the sea and say nothing.":"电梯通到塔顶。电次就在上面。他来这里看海，什么也不说。","Through the viewer you can just see the Pokémon League, far across the sea.":"从望远镜里能隐约看到大海远处的宝可梦联盟。","Through the viewer you can see the whole of Sunyshore City shining in the sun.":"从望远镜里能看到整座滨海市在阳光下闪闪发亮。","I read all about Electric types, and now I will show you!":"电属性的书我全读过了，现在就让你见识！","That was not in the book.":"书上没写这个。","The plates on the floor open some gates and shut others. Keep trying!":"地上的开关会打开一些闸门，关上另一些。多试试吧！","Three Magnemite are stronger than one. That is simple mathematics!":"三只小磁怪比一只强。这是简单的数学！","I forgot to carry the one.":"我忘了进位。","A gate that is open now may be shut when you come back.":"现在开着的闸门，等你回来时可能就关了。","This next one is called \"Shock to the System\"!":"下一首歌叫《全身过电》！","My amp blew.":"我的音箱烧了。","Volkner played guitar with us once. He was bored by the second song.":"电次跟我们合奏过一次吉他。第二首歌他就腻了。","I have four Pikachu, and they are all my favorite!":"我有四只皮卡丘，每一只都是我的最爱！","They all did their best.":"它们都尽力了。","I named them all Pikachu. It is easier.":"我给它们都取名叫皮卡丘。这样比较方便。","One Raichu, one chord, and that is all I need!":"一只雷丘，一个和弦，这就够了！","That was the wrong chord.":"这个和弦弹错了。","The lights in here are powered by the Leader's Pokémon. That is what he tells us.":"这里的灯是靠馆主的宝可梦发电的。他是这么跟我们说的。","Two Luxio, in perfect harmony!":"两只勒克猫，完美和声！","We fell out of tune.":"我们跑调了。","Volkner has been smiling since he came back. It is a little frightening.":"电次回来之后一直在笑。有点吓人。","You have come a long way through these gates. It ends here.":"你穿过这些闸门走了很远。到此为止了。","I see why Volkner came back.":"我明白电次为什么回来了。","The Leader is behind the last gate. You will need the right plates down to open it.":"馆主在最后一道闸门后面。要踩对开关才打得开。","Nobody has reached this room in a long time. Let me welcome you.":"很久没人走到这个房间了。让我来欢迎你。","He will give you the battle he has been waiting for. Be ready for that.":"他会给你一场他等了很久的对战。做好准备吧。","So you made it through. I built those gates because nobody was giving me a fight. Now show me that spark.":"你走到这里了。我造那些闸门，是因为没人能跟我好好打一场。来吧，让我看看你的火花。","There it is. That is the spark I was missing!":"就是这个。这就是我一直缺少的火花！","I had forgotten how good this feels. Thank you. Now go on, somebody on the beach was asking for you.":"我都忘了这种感觉有多好。谢谢你。去吧，海滩上有人在找你。","Hey, you there! You look like you have been through something. Are you here for the Gym?":"喂，你！看起来经历了不少事啊。你是来挑战道馆的吗？","I am Flint, one of the Elite Four. Volkner is my friend, so let me warn you: he is not at his Gym.":"我是四天王大叶。电次是我的朋友，所以先提醒你：他不在道馆。","He says nobody gives him a real battle any more, and he has stopped caring. He sits at the top of the lighthouse all day.":"他说再也没人能跟他好好打一场，已经什么都不在乎了。他整天都待在灯塔顶上。","Go up there and light a fire under him. I would do it myself, but he stopped listening to me a long time ago.":"上去给他点把火吧。我本想自己去，可他早就不听我的了。","So Flint sent you. He does that.":"是大叶让你来的吧。他总是这样。","I have beaten everybody who came to my Gym, so I rebuilt it to make it harder, and then nobody came at all. I got bored of winning.":"来我道馆的人我全赢了，所以我把道馆改得更难，结果就没人来了。赢也赢腻了。","But people say you went up against Team Galactic and came back. Your Pokémon do look like they have seen something.":"不过听说你和银河队交过手，还活着回来了。你的宝可梦确实像是见过世面。","All right. If you can get through my gates, I will give you a battle. Let us see if you can make me feel anything.":"好吧。你要是能过我的闸门，我就跟你打一场。看看你能不能让我有点感觉。","Volkner went back to his Gym.":"电次回道馆去了。","Oh... {player}. It has been a long time since Olivine City. I came to see this sea with my own eyes.":"啊……{player}。自从浅葱市一别，好久不见了。我是来亲眼看看这片海的。","You have all eight badges of Sinnoh now? I can tell. Your Pokémon stand differently.":"你已经拿到神奥的八枚徽章了吧？看得出来。你的宝可梦站姿都不一样了。","Then you will need this. There is a great waterfall on the way to the League.":"那你会需要这个。去联盟的路上有一道大瀑布。","You already know the way of the Waterfall, I am sure. You will need it on the road to the League.":"你应该已经会用攀瀑了。去联盟的路上用得着。","Route 223 starts across this water, and the Pokémon League is at the end of it. Whenever you are ready.":"223号道路就在这片水的对面，尽头是宝可梦联盟。等你准备好吧。","I will go back and watch the sea a little longer. Good luck, {player}.":"我再看一会儿海。祝你好运，{player}。","The doors are shut. A note says: \"Gone out. Do not wait.\" It is signed by Volkner.":"门关着。纸条上写着：“出去了，别等。”署名是电次。","Hey there, future Champion! Volkner uses Electric Pokémon, and this is the last Gym in Sinnoh.":"嘿，未来的冠军！电次使用电属性宝可梦，这里是神奥最后一个道馆。","Each plate on the floor opens some gates and shuts others. Plates of the same power work the same gates, so watch what changes.":"地上每个开关都会打开一些闸门，关上另一些。有些开关控制同样的闸门，要留意哪里变了。","Ground moves are what you want. His Pokémon know a few surprises, so do not bring only one type!":"地面属性的招式最有效。他的宝可梦有些意想不到的招式，别只带一种属性！","That is the best battle I have had in years. The Beacon Badge is yours.":"这是我这些年打得最痛快的一场。灯塔徽章是你的了。","{player} received the Beacon Badge from Volkner!":"{player}从电次那里得到了灯塔徽章！","That is all eight. Every Pokémon will obey you now, wherever it comes from.":"八枚集齐了。现在无论来自哪里的宝可梦都会听你的话。","And take TM57, Charge Beam. It can raise the user's Sp. Atk as it hits.":"再收下招式学习器57，充电光束。命中时可能提高使用者的特攻。","Somebody on the beach to the north was asking about you. Go and see.":"北边海滩上有人在打听你。去看看吧。","Words are carved deep into the wall: \"Far below sleeps the one that pulled the land into place. From rock, from ice and from iron it made three. When the three come home to it, it will stir.\"":"墙上深深刻着字：“在遥远的地底，沉睡着把大地拉到原位的那一位。它用岩石、冰与钢铁造出了三位。当三位回到它身边，它便会苏醒。”","A colossal statue sits in the cold. Three marks are carved at its feet: one of rock, one of ice, one of iron. It does not move.":"一座巨大的石像坐在寒气之中。它脚下刻着三个记号：一个是岩石，一个是冰，一个是钢铁。石像一动也不动。","{rock}, {ice} and {steel} stir in their Poké Balls, as if something were calling them home.":"{rock}、{ice}和{steel}在精灵球里躁动起来，好像有什么在呼唤它们回家。","Light flickers in the statue's eyes. {mon} is moving!":"石像的眼睛闪起了光。{mon}动起来了！","The light went out of its eyes. {mon} sits as still as stone again.":"它眼中的光熄灭了。{mon}又像石头一样一动不动了。","The Clefairy is not worth this much trouble. Take it back, then.":"这只皮皮不值得这么麻烦。还给你就是了。","But remember this: Team Galactic is working toward a new world, and the boss does not like being kept waiting.":"不过你给我记住：银河队正在为新世界努力，首领可不喜欢等待。","Team Galactic left the Eterna Building, and the Clefairy ran straight home to the cycle shop.":"银河队撤出了百代大楼，皮皮直接跑回了自行车店。","Cycling Road starts at the south of town. Enjoy the ride, and watch the corners!":"自行车道从城市南边开始。好好享受，转弯小心！","You brought my Clefairy back! Thank you, thank you!":"你把我的皮皮带回来了！谢谢你，谢谢你！","I wanted to give you a bike, but you already ride one from Kanto? Then take this. Clefairy loved to play with it.":"我本想送你一辆自行车，不过你已经有关都的了？那就收下这个吧。皮皮最喜欢拿它玩了。","A Moon Stone makes some Pokémon evolve. And with Team Galactic gone, Cycling Road is open again!":"月之石能让某些宝可梦进化。而且银河队走了，自行车道也重新开放了！","A kid in our building? You must be lost. Let me show you the way out!":"小鬼跑进我们大楼了？你是迷路了吧。我来带你出去！","You found the way in instead...":"结果你找到的是进来的路……","Commander Jupiter is upstairs. She is much scarier than me.":"岁星干部在楼上。她可比我吓人多了。","This is a Team Galactic building. Trespassers get battled!":"这里是银河队的大楼。擅闯者一律对战！","Trespasser one, Team Galactic zero.":"擅闯者一分，银河队零分。","We are only borrowing that Clefairy. It is for science! ...Probably.":"我们只是借用一下那只皮皮。是为了科学！……大概吧。","Clefairy is shaking in the corner. It looks like it wants to go home.":"皮皮在角落里发抖，看起来很想回家。","The Commander is busy. Nobody gets past me!":"干部正忙着呢。谁也别想过去！","Somebody got past me...":"有人过去了……","Go on, then. Do not say I did not warn you.":"去吧。可别说我没提醒你。","So you are the Trainer Mars told me about. I am Jupiter, a Commander of Team Galactic. That Clefairy is part of our research, and research does not stop for children.":"原来你就是伙星说的那个训练家。我是银河队的干部岁星。那只皮皮是我们研究的一部分，研究可不会因为小孩子而停下。","Hmph. Mars was right about you.":"哼。伙星说得没错。","Clefairy is twirling happily around the shop.":"皮皮开心地在店里转圈圈。","Axel":"阿克塞尔","Downhill all the way! Can you keep up?":"一路下坡！你跟得上吗？","You were faster...":"你比我快……","Let go of the pedals and the slope does the rest. Best road in Sinnoh!":"松开踏板，剩下的交给坡道。神奥最棒的路！","Kayla":"凯拉","My Luxio and I race down this road every morning!":"我和我的勒克猫每天早上都在这条路上比赛！","We lost the race...":"我们比输了……","At the bottom of the road is Route 207. Oreburgh City is to the west of it.":"这条路的尽头是207号道路，黑金市在它的西边。","Brakes? Who needs brakes? Battle!":"刹车？谁要刹车啊？对战吧！","Okay, maybe I need brakes.":"好吧，也许我需要刹车。","Mt. Coronet is east of Route 207. It splits Sinnoh right down the middle.":"天冠山在207号道路的东边。它把神奥从正中间分开。","Last stop before the bottom. Let me see what you have got!":"到底之前的最后一站。让我看看你的本事！","You have got a lot.":"你本事真大。","Hearthome City is on the other side of Mt. Coronet. Its Gym Leader uses Ghost types.":"家缘市在天冠山的另一边。那里的道馆馆主使用幽灵属性。","I am heading into Mt. Coronet. First, a warm-up battle!":"我要进天冠山了。先来场热身对战吧！","Warmed up and worn out.":"热身完，也累坏了。","Inside the mountain the air is cold and still. Strange people go in there, too.":"山里的空气又冷又静。还有些奇怪的人会进去。","Maria":"玛莉亚","My Ponyta loves running along this route. Let us run you over, too!":"我的小火马最喜欢在这条道路上奔跑了。连你也一起撞飞！","Oops, we tripped.":"哎呀，我们绊倒了。","Ponyta's mane is made of fire, but it does not burn people it trusts.":"小火马的鬃毛是火焰，但不会烧伤它信任的人。","Route 206: Cycling Road. North: Eterna City. South: Route 207.":"206号道路：自行车道。北：百代市　南：207号道路","Route 207. East: Mt. Coronet. North: Cycling Road. South-west: Oreburgh City.":"207号道路。东：天冠山　北：自行车道　西南：黑金市","In my day I raised more dragons than I can count. There is one move I learned from them that I still pass on.":"我年轻时养过的龙多得数不清。从它们身上学到的一个招式，我到现在还在传授。","It is called {move}: the dragon calls down stars from the sky. Only a Dragon-type that trusts its Trainer with all its heart can learn it.":"它叫{move}：龙会从天上召来流星。只有全心全意信任训练家的龙属性宝可梦才学得会。","Shall I teach {move} to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的宝可梦{move}吗？","Do come back and see this old woman again.":"有空再来看看我这个老太婆吧。","None of your Pokémon could learn {move} from me. Bring me a Dragon-type, dear.":"你的宝可梦没有一只能跟我学{move}。带一只龙属性的来吧，孩子。","An Egg cannot learn a move yet. Let it hatch first.":"蛋还学不了招式。等它孵化吧。","Only a Dragon-type can learn {move}.":"只有龙属性的宝可梦才能学会{move}。","{mon} does not trust you with all its heart yet. Travel together a little longer.":"{mon}还没有全心全意地信任你。再一起旅行一阵子吧。","{move} is the strongest of dragon moves, but it takes so much out of the user that its Sp. Atk falls sharply. Use it wisely.":"{move}是最强的龙之招式，但用了会大量消耗体力，特攻会大幅下降。要用在关键时刻哦。","You came all the way across this sand? Then you have earned something. I teach the ultimate moves.":"你穿过这片沙地一路走来？那你值得一点奖励。我教的是究极招式。","Only the Pokémon a professor gives to a new Trainer, fully grown and fully devoted to their Trainer, can learn them.":"只有博士送给新手训练家的宝可梦，在完全进化、并且对训练家死心塌地之后，才学得会。","Shall I teach an ultimate move to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的宝可梦究极招式吗？","That is fine. The sand and I will wait.":"没关系。我和这片沙地都会等你。","I am sorry, but that Pokémon cannot learn an ultimate move.":"抱歉，这只宝可梦学不了究极招式。","{mon} and you are not close enough yet. The ultimate moves come only from a perfect bond.":"你和{mon}的感情还不够深。究极招式只会从完美的羁绊中诞生。","Shall {mon} learn {move}?":"要让{mon}学会{move}吗？","After such a move the user must rest for a turn. Choose the moment well.":"用了这种招式之后，下一回合必须休息。要挑好时机。","A list pinned to the shelf: the Pokémon who may learn an ultimate move.":"钉在书架上的名单：能学会究极招式的宝可梦。","{one}, {two}, {three} and {four}: {move}.":"{one}、{two}、{three}、{four}：{move}。","My grandmother raised dragons before I was born. Even now, a Dragon that loves its Trainer will listen to her.":"我出生前，奶奶就在养龙了。到现在，爱着训练家的龙还是会听她的话。","Hey, hey! Are you {player}? The Champion from Hoenn? My mom said you were coming! I am Barry!":"喂喂！你就是{player}吗？丰缘的冠军？我妈说你要来！我是阿驯！","Listen! Professor Rowan went to Lake Verity today. And they say a legendary Pokémon lives in that lake!":"听我说！七灶博士今天去了心齐湖。听说那座湖里住着传说中的宝可梦！","If we go now, maybe we will see it! The lake is at the west end of Route 201, north of town. Race you there!":"现在去的话，说不定能看到！湖在镇子北边201号道路的西头。比比谁先到！","So this is Lake Verity... I do not see any legendary Pokémon. Hey, there are people down by the water!":"这里就是心齐湖啊……没看到什么传说中的宝可梦嘛。咦，水边有人！","So. You must be {player}, the Trainer Birch wrote to me about. I am Rowan.":"嗯。你就是小田卷信里提到的训练家{player}吧。我是七灶。","I came to watch for the Pokémon of this lake today, but it would not show itself. Perhaps it does not care for visitors.":"我今天来这里观察湖中的宝可梦，但它始终没有现身。也许它不喜欢有人打扰吧。","...We will talk another time. {assistant}, we are going back to the lab.":"……我们改天再谈。{assistant}，回研究所了。","He is kind of scary... Hey, look! He left his briefcase behind!":"那个人有点吓人……喂，你看！他把公文包落下了！","A wild Starly swooped down on you!":"野生的姆克儿俯冲了过来！","Whoa, it wants a fight! There are Poké Balls in the briefcase... Quick, take one!":"哇，它想打架！公文包里有精灵球……快，拿一个！","Then I will take {mon}! You keep that Starly busy!":"那我就选{mon}！你先拖住那只姆克儿！","You did it! That Pokémon of yours is pretty good!":"你做到了！你那只宝可梦还挺厉害的嘛！","Phew, it flew off. That was close!":"呼，它飞走了。好险啊！","Uh-oh... We used the professor's Pokémon without asking. We had better take his briefcase back to him!":"糟了……我们没问一声就用了博士的宝可梦。还是赶快把公文包还给他吧！","There you are. I came back for my briefcase... and I see you have opened it.":"你们在这里啊。我回来拿公文包……看来你们已经打开过了。","Hmm. That Pokémon fought for you, and it seems at ease by your side. A Pokémon knows a good Trainer.":"嗯。那只宝可梦为你而战，而且待在你身边似乎很安心。宝可梦是能分辨好训练家的。","Birch tells me you are the Champion of three regions. But Sinnoh is new to you, and so are its ways.":"小田卷说你是三个地区的冠军。不过，神奥对你来说是个新地方，这里的规矩也是。","A Pokémon trained to a high level in another region only listens to a Trainer who has earned Sinnoh's Gym badges. The more badges, the stronger the Pokémon that obey.":"在其他地区练到高等级的宝可梦，只听拥有神奥道馆徽章的训练家的话。徽章越多，听话的宝可梦就越强。","So keep that Pokémon, and raise it here. It will be your partner in Sinnoh.":"所以，那只宝可梦就交给你了，在这里好好培养它吧。它会是你在神奥的伙伴。","{player} received {mon} from Prof. Rowan!":"{player}从七灶博士那里得到了{mon}！","Barry, you may keep yours as well. Now, both of you: come to my lab in Sandgem Town.":"阿驯，你也可以留下你的那只。好了，你们两个都到真砂镇的研究所来。","{player}! Let us battle, right here! Just our new partners, one on one!":"{player}！我们就在这里对战吧！只用我们的新伙伴，一对一！","Argh, I lost! I am going to train until I am the strongest Trainer in Sinnoh, you will see!":"啊啊，我输了！我要一直训练，直到成为神奥最强的训练家，你等着瞧！","I won! I beat a Champion! Well... a Champion with a brand-new Pokémon. It still counts!":"我赢了！我打败了冠军！嗯……虽然是带着刚拿到的宝可梦的冠军。但还是算数！","Come on, the professor is waiting! Race you to Sandgem!":"快走吧，博士在等我们！比比谁先到真砂镇！","There you are! The lake is just through here. Come on, come on!":"你可来了！湖就在这边。快点，快点！","Oh, hello! I am {assistant}, Professor Rowan's assistant.":"啊，你好！我是七灶博士的助手{assistant}。","The professor is studying Lake Verity right now, and he asked not to be disturbed.":"博士现在正在调查心齐湖，他交代过不要去打扰他。","Are you the Trainer from Hoenn? You are staying with Barry's family in Twinleaf Town, just south of here. Barry is dying to meet you!":"你就是从丰缘来的训练家吗？你会住在南边双叶镇的阿驯家。阿驯可是很想见你呢！","{player}, you look worn out. Sit down and rest a while.":"{player}，你看起来累坏了。坐下来休息一会儿吧。","There you go! Off with you, and keep an eye on Barry for me, will you?":"好啦！去吧，帮我看着点阿驯，好吗？","Oh! You must be {player}. Professor Rowan asked us to put you up while you are in Sinnoh. Welcome to Twinleaf!":"哎呀！你就是{player}吧。七灶博士拜托我们，在你待在神奥的期间让你住在这里。欢迎来到双叶镇！","Your room is upstairs. Make yourself at home.":"你的房间在楼上。就当是自己家吧。","Barry has been waiting for you all morning. He is outside somewhere... That boy never sits still!":"阿驯一整个早上都在等你。他就在外面哪里……那孩子一刻也闲不下来！","Barry runs everywhere. Once he ran so fast he went right past his own front door!":"阿驯去哪里都用跑的。有一次他跑得太快，连自己家门口都冲过头了！","Our pond is small, but Psyduck still come to swim in it. Bring a Pokémon that can Surf and see for yourself.":"我们这里的池塘虽小，可达鸭还是会来游泳。带上会冲浪的宝可梦，自己来看看吧。","Lake Verity is a quiet place. They say a Pokémon lives deep under its water, though no one I know has ever seen it.":"心齐湖是个安静的地方。听说湖底深处住着一只宝可梦，不过我认识的人谁也没见过。","My big brother set out on his journey from Twinleaf last spring. Every Trainer in Sinnoh starts somewhere!":"我哥哥去年春天从双叶镇出发去旅行了。神奥的每个训练家都是从某个地方起步的！","Twinleaf Town. Where new leaves open, two by two.":"双叶镇。新叶两两舒展的地方。","A tidy guest room. A note on the shelf says: \"Welcome to Sinnoh!\"":"整洁的客房。架子上的纸条写着：“欢迎来到神奥！”","Route 201. East: Sandgem Town. South: Twinleaf Town. West: Lake Verity.":"201号道路。东：真砂镇　南：双叶镇　西：心齐湖","Team Galactic got here first! I cannot get past them on my own.":"银河队先到了！我一个人过不去。","Commander Mars said nobody comes through here!":"伙星干部说了，谁也不准过去！","She will not be happy...":"她不会高兴的……","The lake is ours now.":"这座湖现在是我们的了。","You again? Commander Mars will take care of you!":"又是你？伙星干部会收拾你的！","Commander, help!":"干部，救命！","Fine. Go and see how far you get.":"好吧。看你能走多远。","You again? I remember you from the windworks. This time I have a real reason to win. Let us see if you can stop me!":"又是你？我记得你，在山谷发电厂见过。这次我有非赢不可的理由。看你拦不拦得住我！","Not again!":"怎么又输了！","Oh, and Professor Rowan called for you, Champion. He says to come to his lab in Sandgem Town when you have rested.":"对了，七灶博士打过电话来，冠军。他说你休息好了就去真砂镇的研究所找他。","Barry ran off to some place called the Battle Zone. There is a ship from Snowpoint City, he says. He left without his lunch, of course.":"阿驯跑去一个叫对战特区的地方了。他说雪峰市有船去。午饭当然又没带。","The next Gym is in Pastoria City, south past Route 214. Its Leader, Crasher Wake, splashes around with Water types!":"下一个道馆在湿原市，往南经过214号道路就到。那里的馆主吉宪会用水属性掀起大浪！","The door is locked. A sign says: \"Team Galactic HQ. Members only.\"":"门锁着。牌子上写着：“银河队总部。非成员禁止入内。”","The Game Corner. A sign says: \"Closed for renovations.\"":"游戏城。牌子上写着：“装修中，暂停营业。”","Hey, Champion! Maylene uses Fighting-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠军！阿李使用格斗属性的宝可梦。","Flying and Psychic moves work great on them. And their Fighting moves cannot touch Ghost-type Pokémon!":"飞行和超能力属性的招式对它们效果拔群。而且它们的格斗招式打不到幽灵属性的宝可梦！","Watch out for her Lucario: it is part Steel, so Fire, Fighting and Ground moves are what you want. Up to level 35, your Pokémon from home will listen to you here.":"小心她的路卡利欧：它也是钢属性，所以要用火、格斗或地面属性的招式。在这里，你从家乡带来的宝可梦在35级以下都会听话。","This is the Cobble Badge. You earned it, fair and square.":"这是圆石徽章。你堂堂正正地赢得了它。","{player} received the Cobble Badge from Maylene!":"{player}从阿李那里得到了圆石徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 40 will obey you here in Sinnoh, even ones from other regions.":"有了它，40级以下的宝可梦在神奥都会听你的话，就算来自其他地区也一样。","And take this. TM60 is Drain Punch: it hits the foe and heals the user by half the damage.":"还有这个。招式学习器60是吸取拳：攻击对手，并回复造成伤害一半的HP。","Kirby":"柯比","Rain or shine, I train! Today it is rain. As always!":"不管下雨还是晴天，我都要训练！今天下雨。和平常一样！","I am soaked and beaten.":"我浑身湿透，还输了。","Maylene trains in this rain too. She says it toughens the spirit.":"阿李也会在这场雨里训练。她说这能磨炼心志。","Ella":"艾拉","My Meditite meditates under the falling rain. Its focus is perfect!":"我的玛沙那在雨中冥想。它的专注力无懈可击！","Our focus slipped.":"我们的专注力断了。","Meditite are part Psychic, so Psychic moves only hit them normally. Flying moves are what they fear.":"玛沙那也是超能力属性，所以超能力招式只能造成普通伤害。它们怕的是飞行属性的招式。","A Cool Trainer never lets a little rain stop a battle!":"精英训练家才不会因为一点小雨就停止对战！","Fire moves are weaker in the rain, and Water moves are stronger. Use that!":"下雨时，火属性招式会变弱，水属性招式会变强。好好利用吧！","Veilstone is just ahead. Get past my fists first!":"帷幕市就在前面。先过了我这双拳头再说！","My fists are tired.":"我的拳头累了。","Maylene's Lucario reads the aura of its foes. You cannot hide anything from it.":"阿李的路卡利欧能读取对手的波导。在它面前什么都藏不住。","Rocks slid onto Route 214 in the rain. The way south is closed for now.":"因为下雨，214号道路发生了落石。往南的路暂时封闭了。","This is the headquarters of Team Galactic. Members only. Go away, kid!":"这里是银河队的总部。非成员禁止入内。小鬼，走开！","Team Galactic built their headquarters right here in town. Nobody knows what they do in there.":"银河队把总部盖在了城里。谁也不知道他们在里面做什么。","Maylene trains in the mountains around the city. She is strong, but very kind.":"阿李在城市周围的山里修行。她很强，但人非常温柔。","Fighting types hit hard, but Flying and Psychic moves send them flying. Remember that in the Gym.":"格斗属性打得很狠，但飞行和超能力招式能把它们打飞。到道馆可要记住这一点。","The Veilstone Store has everything a Trainer needs, all on one floor!":"帷幕百货里有训练家需要的一切，全都在同一层！","When I was young, the meteorites glowed on clear nights. Or maybe I only dreamed it.":"我年轻时，陨石会在晴朗的夜里发光。也可能只是我做的梦吧。","In this Gym we train body and spirit. Show me yours!":"我们在这座道馆锻炼身体和心灵。让我看看你的吧！","My spirit needs more training.":"我的心灵还需要更多锻炼。","Maylene once broke a boulder with one punch. I have seen it!":"阿李曾经一拳打碎过一块巨石。我亲眼看到的！","Darcy":"达茜","I train every day with Maylene. Let me see what you have got!":"我每天都和阿李一起训练。让我看看你有多少本事！","You have got a lot!":"你本事真不小！","Croagunk is Poison and Fighting. Psychic moves hit it four times as hard!":"不良蛙是毒和格斗属性。超能力招式对它有四倍的效果！","Jeffery":"杰弗里","Hiyah! A battle is the best training there is!":"嘿呀！对战就是最好的训练！","Hiyah... ow.":"嘿呀……好痛。","Flying moves come from above. Fighting types hate that.":"飞行招式是从上方来的。格斗属性最讨厌这个了。","Maylene is right behind me. You will have to beat me first!":"阿李就在我身后。你得先打败我！","Go on. She is ready for you.":"去吧。她已经准备好了。","Riolu can sense feelings. Mine knew I was going to lose before I did.":"利欧路能感知情绪。我的利欧路比我还早知道我会输。","Welcome to the Veilstone Gym. I am Maylene, the Gym Leader. I train with my Pokémon, side by side, every single day. A Champion of three regions... Then I will give you everything I have!":"欢迎来到帷幕道馆。我是道馆馆主阿李。我每一天都和我的宝可梦并肩训练。三个地区的冠军……那我就拿出我的全部力量！","I lost... But I am not sad. That battle made me stronger, too.":"我输了……但我并不难过。这场对战也让我变得更强了。","Route 215. East: Veilstone City. West: Route 210.":"215号道路。东：帷幕市　西：210号道路","Veilstone City. A city carved out of the rock, where stones fell from the sky.":"帷幕市。在岩石中开凿出的城市，天上曾有石头落在这里。","A meteorite. Long ago stones fell from the sky here, and the city grew up around them.":"陨石。很久以前，石头从天而降落在这里，城市就围绕着它们发展起来。","A meteorite. Some say these stones came from a world beyond our own.":"陨石。有人说，这些石头来自我们世界之外的另一个世界。","The door of the warehouse is locked.":"仓库的门锁着。","Team Galactic Warehouse. Authorized members only.":"银河队仓库。非授权成员禁止入内。","Wesley":"韦斯利","Ricardo":"里卡多","Francisco":"弗朗西斯科","Miranda":"米兰达","Aubree":"奥布丽","Crystal":"克丽丝朵","Cassandra":"卡桑德拉","Zachariah":"撒迦利亚","Bryce":"布莱斯","Miles":"迈尔斯","Hana":"花","Clinton":"克林顿","Omar":"奥马尔","Sydney":"悉妮","Clayton":"克莱顿","Al & Kay":"阿尔和凯","Jo & Pat":"乔和帕特","Ondrej":"翁德雷","Valencia":"瓦伦西亚","The League is a long swim from here. Are you sure you can make it?":"从这里游到联盟可远了。你真游得到吗？","You swim better than I thought.":"你比我想的会游。","I swim this way every morning, and I have never once reached the waterfall.":"我每天早上都游这条路，一次也没游到瀑布。","Nobody crosses my stretch of water for free!":"谁也别想白白穿过我这片水！","Fine. It is free.":"好吧。免费。","The current gets stronger from here on. So do I!":"从这里开始水流变急了。我也变强了！","The current was not on my side.":"水流没站在我这边。","I do not swim with this Gyarados. I swim away from it.":"我不是和这只暴鲤龙一起游，我是在躲它。","It is not happy with either of us now.":"现在它对我们两个都不高兴。","We all travel together. It saves on swimming!":"我们一起行动。这样能少游点！","We will drift home.":"我们漂回家吧。","My Lumineon lights up the deep water. Look at it glow!":"我的霓虹鱼能照亮深水。看它发光！","It glowed so nicely.":"它发的光真好看。","They say the League can be seen from the top of the waterfall.":"听说从瀑布顶上能看到联盟。","A swimmer needs friends who can float!":"游泳的人需要会浮的朋友！","They floated very well.":"它们浮得很好。","I came all this way to get away from people, and here you are!":"我游这么远就是为了躲开人，结果你来了！","Well, now you can go.":"好了，你可以走了。","Seaking is the queen of the water, and I am her friend!":"金鱼王是水中女王，我是她的朋友！","Her horn was not enough.":"她的角也没能赢。","I can see a very long way from out here. I saw you coming!":"从这里能看得很远。我早看到你来了！","The waterfall is right behind me. You will have to get past me first!":"瀑布就在我身后。你得先过我这一关！","Go on, climb it.":"去吧，爬上去吧。","You will need Waterfall to get up there, and a strong Pokémon that knows it.":"要上去得用攀瀑，还要有会这招的强壮宝可梦。","I live on this island, and I do not get many visitors. Let us battle!":"我住在这座小岛上，很少有人来。来打一场吧！","I should get out more.":"我该多出去走走。","Every Trainer who goes to the League goes past my island. Few of them stop to talk.":"去联盟的训练家都会经过我的岛。很少有人停下来说话。","Victory Road. Only Trainers with all eight badges of Sinnoh may enter.":"冠军之路。只有集齐神奥八枚徽章的训练家才能进入。","Beyond this cave stands the Pokémon League of Sinnoh. It has turned back more Trainers than I can count.":"穿过这个洞窟就是神奥的宝可梦联盟。被它挡回去的训练家数都数不清。","I got as far as the second floor of Victory Road. Bring strong Pokémon, and something that can push boulders.":"我走到冠军之路二楼就不行了。要带强壮的宝可梦，还要有能推大石的。","An officer stands in the way. \"Only Trainers with all eight badges of Sinnoh may enter Victory Road.\"":"一名警官挡在路上。“只有集齐神奥八枚徽章的训练家才能进入冠军之路。”","I saw you coming in a vision. In the vision, I won.":"我在幻象里看到你来了。幻象里是我赢了。","I must have been looking at it upside down.":"大概是我把它看反了。","Up the ladder and over the rocks. That much I can see.":"爬上梯子，越过岩石。这个我还是看得到的。","One Pokémon, four arms, no mercy!":"一只宝可梦，四条手臂，毫不留情！","All four arms are tired.":"四条手臂都累了。","I have been training in this cave for a year. I still have not found the way out.":"我在这个洞窟修行一年了。到现在还没找到出口。","If you cannot beat me, you have no business at the League.":"赢不了我的话，你去联盟也没用。","You have business at the League.":"你确实有资格去联盟。","The Elite Four are stronger than anybody in this cave. Remember that.":"四天王比这个洞窟里的任何人都强。记住这一点。","My birds do not like caves, and neither do I. So let us be quick!":"我的鸟不喜欢洞窟，我也不喜欢。速战速决吧！","That was quick.":"确实够快的。","There is daylight at the end of this passage. We are nearly out.":"这条通道尽头有亮光。快出去了。","I have walked this road more times than you have years. Show me what you have learned.":"我走这条路的次数比你的年纪还多。让我看看你学到了什么。","You have learned a great deal.":"你学到了不少。","Every Trainer walks this road alone, in the end. Or with their Pokémon, which is the same.":"到头来，每个训练家都是独自走这条路。或者说和宝可梦一起走，这是一回事。","The Champion trains Dragons. I mean to be ready for her, and so should you!":"冠军在训练龙。我要做好准备，你也该如此！","I am not ready.":"我还没准备好。","If you think my Gabite is frightening, wait until you see what it grows into.":"要是觉得我的尖牙陆鲨吓人，等着看它进化吧。","That rock wall has stopped better Trainers than you!":"那道石墙拦住过比你更强的训练家！","Maybe not better.":"也许没有更强。","There is a plate in the floor. Something heavy on it might do something.":"地上有一块机关板。在上面放点重东西，也许会有用。","You got through the wall? Then you are worth my time.":"你过了石墙？那就值得我花时间。","You are worth more than that.":"你不止值这些。","Rest when you can. The League will not wait for you to be ready.":"能休息就休息。联盟不会等你准备好的。","At my age you stop trying to reach the League. You just enjoy the road.":"到了我这个年纪，就不再想着去联盟了。只管享受这条路。","I enjoyed that.":"打得很开心。","I hope you enjoy the road as well. It goes by quickly.":"希望你也能享受这条路。它过得很快。","We came to the League together, and we fight together. Two against two!":"我们一起来到联盟，也一起战斗。二对二！","We lost together, too.":"输也一起输了。","If one of us goes through those doors, we both do.":"我们要过那扇门，就两个人一起过。","Water and fire, side by side. Nobody expects that!":"水和火并肩作战。谁也想不到吧！","You expected that.":"你想到了。","You will have to Surf across the lake. The ladder is on the far side.":"你得用冲浪穿过湖。梯子在对岸。","You crossed the lake for this? I admire that. I will still beat you.":"你穿过湖就为了这个？佩服。不过我还是会赢的。","I admire that as well.":"这个我也佩服。","I trained in Blackthorn City once. Dragons are the same everywhere: they do not listen.":"我在烟墨市修行过。龙到哪儿都一样：不听话。","My Absol feels a disaster coming. I think it means you.":"我的阿勃梭鲁感觉到灾难要来了。我想说的就是你。","It meant me.":"原来是说我。","The ladder behind me goes up to the last part of the cave.":"我身后的梯子通往洞窟的最后一段。","Nobody has made it this far today. Let me fix that.":"今天还没人走到这里。我来解决这件事。","Somebody has.":"有人走到了。","You are nearly there. I can almost smell the fresh air from here.":"快到了。在这里几乎能闻到外面的空气了。","The Pokémon League of Sinnoh. Trainers who reach this place have already come a long way.":"神奥宝可梦联盟。能走到这里的训练家，已经走过了漫长的路。","Five battles in a row, and no way back once you start. That is the League. I am just here to look at it.":"连打五场，一旦开始就不能回头。这就是联盟。我只是来看看。","There you are, {player}! I got here first! I got lost twice in Victory Road, but I still got here first!":"你来了，{player}！我先到的！虽然在冠军之路迷路了两次，但还是我先到的！","Since the Spear Pillar I have thought about nothing else. If I cannot beat you, I have no business going through those doors.":"从枪之柱之后，我满脑子都是这件事。如果赢不了你，我就没资格走进那扇门。","All six of them are ready. This is the real one, {player}. Here we go!":"六只全都准备好了。这才是真正的对决，{player}。来吧！","...That was everything I had. And you are still standing.":"……我已经用尽全力了。而你还站着。","All right. I get it. You are the one who goes first through those doors, and I will be right behind you. You had better not lose in there!":"好吧，我明白了。先走进那扇门的是你，我会紧跟在后面。你要是在里面输了，我绝不放过你！","This part of Victory Road is for Trainers who are filling in the National Pokédex. Come back when you have one.":"冠军之路的这一片是给在完成全国图鉴的训练家走的。等你有了再来吧。","Big Sofa":"大沙发","Small Sofa":"小沙发","Bed":"床","Night Table":"床头柜","Audio System":"音频系统","Bookshelf":"书架","Rack":"行李架","Houseplant":"盆栽","PC Desk":"个人电脑桌","Music Box":"音乐盒","Pokémon Bust":"宝可梦雕塑","Silver Pokémon Bust":"银色宝可梦雕塑","Piano":"钢琴","Guest Set":"会务桌","Wall Clock":"挂钟","Masterpiece":"名画","Tea Set":"茶具","Chandelier":"吊灯","Order the Rack first.":"要先订购行李架。","Order the Guest Set first.":"要先订购会务桌。","Win at least once at every facility of the Battle Frontier ({n} of {all} so far).":"在对战开拓区的每个设施都至少赢过一次（目前 {n} / {all}）。","Earn a Silver Symbol at the Battle Frontier.":"在对战开拓区得到一个银色象征。","Enter the Hall of Fame 10 times ({n} so far).":"登录殿堂 10 次（目前 {n} 次）。","Win 50 battles at the Battleground ({n} so far).":"在对决场赢 50 场对战（目前 {n} 场）。","Pick berries from trees 50 times ({n} so far).":"从树上摘 50 次树果（目前 {n} 次）。","Hatch 30 Eggs ({n} so far).":"孵化 30 个蛋（目前 {n} 个）。","Walk {max} steps ({n} so far).":"走 {max} 步（目前 {n} 步）。","Villa owner":"别墅主人","Ah, you must be the Trainer everyone in the Battle Zone talks about. I have been hoping you would come by.":"啊，你就是对战特区里大家都在谈论的那位训练家吧。我一直盼着你会来。","This villa is mine. I came to Sinnoh to look for rare stones, and now I have found every one I wanted.":"这栋别墅是我的。我来神奥是为了找稀有的石头，现在想要的都找齐了。","So I am going home, and the villa needs someone new. It should belong to a strong Trainer. Here: it is yours, and it costs you nothing!":"所以我要回去了，别墅需要一位新主人。它应该属于一位强大的训练家。拿去吧，它是你的了，一分钱都不用花！","{player} became the owner of the villa!":"{player}成为了别墅的主人！","It is a little empty inside. There is a furniture catalog on the table; I am afraid nothing in it is cheap. Farewell!":"里面有点空。桌上有一本家具目录，只是恐怕上面没有便宜的东西。再会了！","A big, bright room that smells of the sea. Only a table stands in the middle, with a thick catalog on it.":"宽敞明亮的房间，带着海的气味。中间只放着一张桌子，上面有一本厚厚的目录。","A thick furniture catalog. Whatever you order is delivered right away.":"一本厚厚的家具目录。订购的东西马上就会送到。","Furniture catalog":"家具目录","The {item} cannot be ordered yet. {need}":"{item}现在还不能订购。{need}","Order the {item} for {price}?":"要用{price}订购{item}吗？","The {item} was delivered!":"{item}送到了！","A big, soft bed. Will you rest for a while?":"又大又软的床。要休息一下吗？","{player} slept well. Your Pokémon are full of energy!":"{player}睡得很好。宝可梦们都精神饱满！","A cooking show: today, a cake made with Oran Berries. It looks delicious.":"烹饪节目：今天做的是橙橙果蛋糕。看起来很好吃。","The news: a Trainer has been winning one battle after another in the Battle Zone.":"新闻：有一位训练家在对战特区接连获胜。","A nature programme about the Pokémon that live deep in the sea.":"介绍深海宝可梦的自然节目。","{player} turned on the TV.":"{player}打开了电视。","The wall clock says {time}.":"挂钟显示 {time}。","A table for receiving guests. A tea set is laid out, ready for visitors.":"接待客人用的桌子。上面摆好了茶具，随时可以招待客人。","A table for receiving guests.":"接待客人用的桌子。","{player}'s villa. The sea is right outside the door.":"{player}的别墅。一出门就是大海。","So the villa found its owner at last! I knew someone would come.":"别墅终于有主人了！我就知道会有人来的。","A big, soft sofa. From here you can hear the waves.":"又大又软的沙发。坐在这里能听见海浪声。","A small sofa, just right for one. It is very comfortable.":"刚好坐一个人的小沙发。非常舒服。","A lamp glows softly on the night table.":"床头柜上的台灯发出柔和的光。","The audio system plays a lively tune.":"音频系统放起了轻快的曲子。","Books about Pokémon from every region. One of them is all about the Pokémon of the Resort Area.":"介绍各地区宝可梦的书。其中有一本专门讲名胜区的宝可梦。","A rack for bags and boxes. Everything has its place.":"放包和箱子的行李架。东西都摆得整整齐齐。","A big houseplant with glossy leaves.":"叶子油亮的大盆栽。","The music box plays a gentle melody.":"音乐盒奏起了温柔的旋律。","A stone statue of a Pokémon. It looks proud of itself.":"宝可梦的石雕。看起来很神气。","A statue of a Pokémon, tinted silver. It shines in the light.":"银色的宝可梦雕塑。在光线下闪闪发亮。","{player} played a few notes on the piano.":"{player}弹了几个音。","A famous painting of green hills under a bright sun. It must be worth a fortune.":"画着阳光下绿色山丘的名画。一定价值连城。","So this is the villa I have heard about. I came to see the Pokémon of the Resort Area.":"原来这就是传闻中的别墅。我是来看名胜区的宝可梦的。","A fine bookshelf, too. Read about the Pokémon of other regions: there is always more to learn.":"书架也很不错。多读读其他地区宝可梦的书吧，要学的东西永远学不完。","The rocks along this beach are something else. Some of them came up from very deep down.":"这片海滩的岩石真了不起。有些是从很深的地底来的。","Your houseplant looks so happy! Plants can tell when someone takes care of them.":"你的盆栽看起来好开心！植物知道有人在照顾它们。","I ran here from Veilstone this morning! The sand is great for training your legs.":"我今天早上从帷幕市一路跑过来的！沙滩最适合锻炼腿力了。","Hah! My boy Roark told me about this villa. Sea air is good for an old fossil hunter like me!":"哈！我儿子瓢太跟我说过这栋别墅。海边的空气对我这把老骨头的化石猎人最好了！","Whoa, so this is your villa? It is huge! I am going to have an even bigger one someday, just you wait!":"哇，这就是你的别墅？好大啊！总有一天我会有一栋更大的，你等着瞧！","I only came to look. Next time we meet, we battle! Got it?":"我只是来看看。下次见面就来对战！听到了吗？","Hi! I heard you got a villa, so I had to see it. This sofa is so comfortable!":"嗨！听说你有了别墅，我一定要来看看。这张沙发好舒服！","Professor Rowan says even a Champion needs somewhere to rest.":"七灶博士说，就算是冠军也需要一个休息的地方。","So this is your villa! You really have grown up, haven't you?":"原来这就是你的别墅！你真的长大了呢。","Eat properly, even on holiday. And come home to Twinleaf now and then!":"就算在度假也要好好吃饭。偶尔也要回双叶镇的家看看哦！","Flint said I should get out of Sunyshore for a day... It is quiet here. Quiet is good.":"大叶说我该离开滨海市一天……这里很安静。安静挺好。","Ha! Some place you have here! I told Volkner a change of scenery would fire him up.":"哈！你这地方真不错！我就跟电次说过，换个环境能让他燃起来。","...The sea is nice. I will give him that much.":"……大海不错。这点我承认。","Maylene and I came to train on the beach! Focus, focus!":"我和阿李来海滩训练了！集中，集中！","Candice says the sand is good for footwork. I think she just wanted to see the sea.":"小菘说沙滩能练步法。我看她只是想来看海吧。","Bonjour! What an elegant villa. It would be perfect for a dance party, non?":"Bonjour！多么优雅的别墅。用来开舞会再合适不过了，non？","WAHAHA! A villa right by the sea! Crasher Wake approves! The waves here are just right!":"哇哈哈！就在海边的别墅！吉宪认可了！这里的浪刚刚好！","It is so warm here! Snowpoint is lovely, but a little sunshine is good for focus too.":"这里好暖和啊！雪峰市很美，不过晒晒太阳对集中精神也有好处。","I thought I heard a piano... This villa suits you.":"我好像听到了钢琴声……这栋别墅很适合你。","When I want to forget about battles for a while, I play too. Not very well, I am afraid.":"想暂时忘掉对战的时候，我也会弹一弹。只是弹得不怎么好。","Reginald & Lorenzo":"雷金纳德和洛伦佐","Cassidy & Wayne":"卡西迪和阿伟","Tori & Diego":"托莉和迭戈","Ana & Parker":"安娜和帕克","Terry & Gerald":"泰瑞和杰拉德","Oh! Somebody is here! I am Mira. I came in to look for strong Pokémon, and now I cannot find the way out.":"哎！有人在！我是麦儿。我进来找厉害的宝可梦，结果找不到出去的路了。","Please, can I come with you? My Kadabra and I will help in battles, and I will look after your team!":"求求你，我可以跟你一起走吗？我和我的勇基拉会在对战里帮忙，我也会照顾你的队伍！","It is so dark in here. Please do not go too fast!":"这里好黑啊。拜托别走太快！","Mira looked after your Pokémon. They are fully healed!":"麦儿照顾了你的宝可梦。它们完全恢复了！","The way out! I can feel the wind! Thank you, thank you!":"是出口！我感觉到风了！谢谢你，谢谢你！","I will train until I am never lost again, in caves or in battles. One day I will battle you, and then you will see.":"我要好好修行，再也不迷路，不管是在洞窟里还是在对战里。总有一天我要和你对战，到时候你就知道了。","Two Hikers in a cave. This is where we feel at home!":"两个登山男在洞窟里。这里就是我们的家！","Home is where you lose, apparently.":"看来在家里也会输。","This cave goes round and round. Keep heading up and you will find the way out.":"这个洞窟绕来绕去的。一直往上走就能找到出口。","We got lost together, so we might as well battle together!":"我们是一起迷路的，那就一起对战吧！","Lost and beaten. What a day.":"又迷路又输了。今天真倒霉。","If you see a girl with pink hair, she was looking for the way out too.":"要是看到一个粉色头发的女孩，她也在找出口。","We came in here for a picnic. It was too dark to see the sandwiches!":"我们是来野餐的。太黑了，连三明治都看不见！","At least we can see who won.":"至少看得清是谁赢了。","The mouth is just up there. You can feel the breeze.":"洞口就在上面。能感觉到风。","Camping in a cave is the best. No rain, no sun, no way out!":"在洞窟里露营最棒了。没有雨，没有太阳，也没有出口！","Not the best, then.":"看来也没那么棒。","We have been in here three days. We are fine. Probably.":"我们在这里待了三天了。我们没事。大概吧。","A collector and a ruin maniac. We both came looking for something rare!":"收藏家和遗迹迷。我们都是来找稀有东西的！","Rare, and strong. That was you.":"又稀有又强。原来是你。","There is another cave under the Cycling Road. That is where the rare one lives.":"自行车道下面还有一个洞窟。稀有的那只就住在那里。"},"zh-Hans",""]);
